rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the spell is not countered (because the spell it targets can\'t be countered), then it does not get exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card does not go to the graveyard before being exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "If you target Ghost Quarter with its own ability, the ability won\'t resolve because its target is no longer on the battlefield. You won\'t get to search for a land card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Ghost Quarter\'s ability resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The land\'s controller won\'t get to search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The target land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if that land wasn\'t destroyed by Ghost Quarter\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible or because it was regenerated."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a Blazing Torch controlled by one player somehow winds up equipping a creature a different player controls, the damage ability can’t be activated by either player. Only the creature’s controller may activate the ability — but since that player can’t sacrifice Blazing Torch (a permanent they don’t control), the ability’s cost can’t be paid.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The source of the damage is Blazing Torch, not the equipped creature. However, the equipped creature’s ability is what targets the permanent or player. If Blazing Torch is equipped to a red creature, for example, the ability couldn’t target a creature with protection from red. It could target a creature with protection from artifacts, but all the damage would be prevented.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Although the named card can\'t be cast, it can still be put onto the battlefield by a spell or ability (if it\'s a permanent card)."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time a card is named and the time that Nevermore\'s ability starts to work."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Spells with the chosen name that somehow happen to already be on the stack when Nevermore enters the battlefield are not affected by Nevermore\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The named card can be cast again once Nevermore leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You can name either half of a split card, but not both. If you do so, that half (and both halves, if the split card has fuse) can\'t be cast. The other half is unaffected."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you name one of the faces of a modal double-faced card, players may still play the face you didn\'t name. (Players can never cast the back face of a transforming double-faced card)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Mask of Avacyn somehow becomes attached to a creature an opponent controls, that creature can\'t be the target of spells or abilities you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you control fewer than two Zombies, you won\'t get any tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The number of Zombies you control is counted when the ability resolves. If you control multiple Endless Ranks of the Dead, the tokens you get when the first ability resolves will count for the subsequent abilities (if the tokens are still under your control at that time).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you control multiple Undead Alchemists, the multiple replacement abilities will have no added effect. Combat damage dealt to a player by a Zombie you control will be replaced only once with cards being put into that player\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Whenever a creature card is put into an opponent\'s graveyard from their library, the triggered ability of each Undead Alchemist you control will trigger. The first such ability to resolve will exile that creature card and create a Zombie token. Subsequent abilities won\'t exile the creature card, but each will create another Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than four cards in your library, you\'ll look at all the cards there and put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "In most cases, when determining whether a creature entering the battlefield under your control should get a +1/+1 counter, you\'ll simply look at what the creature will looklike on the battlefield. You\'ll consider any effects affecting a creature entering the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The effect is cumulative. Human creatures you control will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter for each Dearly Departed in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You may reveal the card even if it\'s not an instant or sorcery. Whether or not you reveal it, the card stays on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You\'ll gain life equal to the creature\'s last known toughness before it died. For example, if Abattoir Ghoul deals 3 first-strike damage to a 7/7 creature and then you give the creature -5/-5 before the regular combat damage step, you\'ll gain 2 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'"You" refers to the controller of Curiosity, which may be different from the controller of the enchanted creature. "An opponent" refers to an opponent of Curiosity\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Any damage dealt by the enchanted creature to an opponent will cause Curiosity to trigger, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Curiosity doesn\'t trigger if the enchanted creature deals damage to a planeswalker or to a battle."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you control Curiosity and it\'s enchanting an opponent\'s creature, you won\'t draw a card when that creature deals damage to you. The creature has to deal damage to one of your opponents for the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You draw one card each time the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, no matter how much damage it deals.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'A card that’s exiled face down doesn’t have any characteristics or abilities, so it can’t be the target of Runic Repetition.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'An effect that gives flashback to an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard stops applying once that card has left the stack. The card won’t have flashback while exiled and can’t be the target of Runic Repetition (unless it naturally has flashback).'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The card could have been exiled for any reason, not just because it was cast using flashback.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'A creature that is both a Werewolf and a Wolf will only get +1/+1 from Howlpack Alpha.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'A “non-Human creature” is any creature that doesn’t have the creature type Human. A creature that is a Human in addition to other creature types is not a non-Human creature.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Spare from Evil resolves will be affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn won’t be.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'All of the tokens enter the battlefield simultaneously. They’ll have the same name, color, type and subtype, abilities, power, toughness, and so on.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the effect creating the tokens instructs you to do something with those tokens at a later time, like exiling them at the end of combat, you’ll do that for all the tokens.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the effect is putting more than one kind of token onto the battlefield, it’ll put twice as many of each kind onto the battlefield. For example, if you cast Bestial Menace while controlling Parallel Lives, you’ll put two Snake tokens, two Wolf tokens, and two Elephant tokens onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control two Parallel Lives, then the number of tokens created is four times the original number. If you control three, then the number of tokens created is eight times the original number, and so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'You count the number of creature cards in your graveyard when the triggered ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker each token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Kessig Cagebreakers is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Although you’re paying the card’s mana cost, you aren’t casting that card. Abilities that reduce the cost to cast a creature spell won’t apply, and additional costs to cast that creature can’t be paid. Alternative costs that affect what it costs to cast a creature spell, such as evoke, can’t.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the exiled creature card has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be zero.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you exile a double-faced creature card this way, you’ll pay the mana cost of the front face. The token will be a copy of the front face and it won’t be able to transform.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Any of the targeted cards that are illegal targets by the time Memory’s Journey resolves aren’t shuffled into their owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If no cards were targeted by Memory’s Journey or if all the targeted cards are illegal targets by the time Memory’s Journey resolves, the targeted player will still shuffle their library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the player is an illegal target by the time Memory’s Journey resolves, the spell will have no effect, even if the cards are still legal targets. This is because a spell can’t make an illegal target (the player) perform any actions (such as shuffling their library).'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you cast Memory’s Journey with flashback, it won’t be in the graveyard when you choose targets. It can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You don’t have to target any cards when you cast Memory’s Journey, but you must target a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'As long as Geist-Honored Monk is on the battlefield, its second ability will count itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability that defines Geist-Honored Monk’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Ashmouth Hound’s ability triggers once for each creature it blocks or becomes blocked by.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Because creatures you control enter the battlefield as a copy of Essence of the Wild, any enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities printed on such creatures won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Creatures you control don’t copy whether Essence of the Wild is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'External abilities may still affect how a creature enters the battlefield. For example, if your opponent controls Urabrask the Hidden, which reads, in part, “Creatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped,” a creature entering the battlefield under your control will be a tapped Essence of the Wild.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a creature such as Clone is entering the battlefield under your control, there will be two copy effects to apply: the creature’s own and Essence of the Wild’s. No matter what order these effects are applied, the creature will be a copy of Essence of the Wild when it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a creature such as Cryptoplasm that’s already on the battlefield copies Essence of the Wild and modifies its own copy effect, that modification is also copied by creatures entering the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control more than one Essence of the Wild, creatures you control will enter the battlefield as a copy of the one whose copy effect you apply last.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Other enters-the-battlefield replacement abilities printed on the creature entering the battlefield won’t be applied because the creature will already be Essence of the Wild at that point (and therefore it won’t have those abilities). For example, a creature that normally enters the battlefield tapped will enter the battlefield as an untapped Essence of the Wild, and a creature that would normally enter the battlefield with counters on it will enter the battlefield as an Essence of the Wild with no counters.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Replacement effects that modify how a creature enters the battlefield are applied in the following order: first control-changing effects (such as Gather Specimens), then copy effects (such as the abilities of Essence of the Wild and Clone), then all other effects. This is a minor rules change to make Essence of the Wild and similar cards in the future work intuitively.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Traitorous Blood can target any creature, even one that’s tapped or one you already control.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Garruk Relentless’s first ability is a state-triggered ability. It triggers once Garruk has two or fewer loyalty counters on him and it can’t retrigger while that ability is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when the third ability of Garruk, the Veil-Cursed resolves will receive the bonus. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn won’t be affected.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The number of creature cards in your graveyard is counted when the third ability of Garruk, the Veil-Cursed resolves. Once the ability resolves, the bonus doesn’t change if that number changes later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The second ability of Garruk, the Veil-Cursed doesn’t target a creature. However, when that ability resolves, you must sacrifice a creature if you control one.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can’t activate a loyalty ability of Garruk Relentless and later that turn after he transforms activate a loyalty ability of Garruk, the Veil-Cursed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You don’t add or remove loyalty counters from Garruk Relentless when he transforms into Garruk, the Veil-Cursed. In most cases, he’ll have one or two loyalty counters on him.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Hysterical Blindness’s effect will continue to apply to a creature even if you (or a teammate) gains control of that creature later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only creatures controlled by your opponent when Hysterical Blindness resolves will get -4/-0. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that an opponent gains control of later in the turn will be unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Civilized Scholar attacks, and later in the turn (but before the beginning of your end step), it transforms, Homicidal Brute’s last ability won’t trigger. This is because the creature attacked that turn, even if had its other face up at the time.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You don’t have priority between untapping Civilized Scholar and transforming it. You can’t activate the draw-and-discard ability again, for example.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You’ll tap and transform Homicidal Brute even if it couldn’t attack.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Feeling of Dread targets two creatures, and one of them is an illegal target by the time Feeling of Dread resolves, the other creature will still be tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Gutter Grime leaves the battlefield, the power and toughness of each Ooze token it created will become 0. Unless another effect is raising its toughness above 0, each of these Ooze tokens will be put into its owner’s graveyard the next time state-based actions are checked.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control more than one Gutter Grime, each Ooze token remembers which one created it. The power and toughness of that Ooze will be equal to the number of slime counters on that Gutter Grime only.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The power and toughness of the Ooze tokens will constantly update as Gutter Grime accumulates slime counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Kruin Outlaw somehow transforms after blockers have been declared but before combat ends, any Werewolves you control that are blocked by a single creature will remain blocked.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Moldgraf Monstrosity’s ability can’t exile it (perhaps because it’s not still in the graveyard when the ability resolves), the two creature cards are still returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If two Moldgraf Monstrosities die simultaneously, the first ability to resolve could return the other Moldgraf Monstrosity to the battlefield. If it does, the second Moldgraf Monstrosity’s ability won’t exile it but it will return two more creature cards to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Rage Thrower dies at the same time as another creature, its ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Splinterfright’s controller has only one card in their library, they put that card into their graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability that defines Splinterfright’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Splinterfright is in your graveyard, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Unbreathing Horde enters the battlefield from a graveyard, it will count itself when determining how many +1/+1 counters it enters the battlefield with.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Unbreathing Horde has no +1/+1 counters on it (but its toughness is raised above 0 by another effect), any damage dealt to it will still be prevented, even though no counter will be removed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only one +1/+1 counter will be removed, no matter how much damage is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a creature is equipped with a second Inquisitor’s Flail, combat damage dealt by and dealt to that creature will be multiplied by four. A third Inquisitor’s Flail would multiply the combat damage by eight, and so on.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you divide the combat damage dealt by the equipped creature, perhaps because the creature has trample or is dealing combat damage to multiple creatures, you’ll divide the original amount and then double the results. For example, if a 5/5 creature with trample is blocked by a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then doubled to 4 and 6 damage, respectively. You can’t double the damage to 10 first and then assign 2 to the creature and 8 to the player.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If all three cards have a converted mana cost of 0, no damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the entire ability won’t resolve. No cards will be put into your graveyard, and no damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you have two or fewer cards in your library when the ability resolves, all of them will be put into your graveyard. Heretic’s Punishment will still deal damage equal to the highest converted mana cost among those cards.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card in your graveyard is the converted mana cost of the front face.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If another creature (such as Necrotic Ooze) gains Mirror-Mad Phantasm’s activated ability, its owner reveals cards until they reveal a card named Mirror-Mad Phantasm.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If no card named Mirror-Mad Phantasm is revealed (possibly because it was a card copying Mirror-Mad Phantasm or it was a token), all cards from that library will be put into their owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can only activate the ability if you control Mirror-Mad Phantasm, even if you don’t own it.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If it’s your turn, and you cast a spell with flashback from your hand, you’ll have priority to cast that spell again using flashback before any other player has priority to cast Purify the Grave in order to remove that card from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Purify the Grave can’t be used in response to a spell being cast with flashback or a spell that requires cards to exiled from a graveyard as an additional cost to try and counter the spell or prevent it from being cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If one of Into the Maw of Hell’s targets is illegal by the time it resolves, Into the Maw of Hell will still affect the remaining legal target. If both targets are illegal at this time, Into the Maw of Hell won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Into the Maw of Hell targets both the land and the creature. You can only cast it if you can choose a legal target for both.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If one of Lost in the Mist’s targets is illegal by the time it resolves, Lost in the Mist will still affect the remaining legal target. If both targets are illegal at this time, Lost in the Mist won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Lost in the Mist targets both the spell and the permanent. You can only cast it if you can choose legal targets for both parts.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the combat damage Creepy Doll deals to a creature is lethal, you’ll still flip a coin. If the creature is still on the battlefield (perhaps because it regenerated), it could be destroyed a second time, depending on the coin flip.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You don’t flip the coin until the ability resolves. If you want to respond to the ability, perhaps by regenerating the damaged creature, you’ll have to do so before you know the outcome of the flip.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the defending player controls no creatures when Grimgrin attacks, the last ability will be removed from the stack and have no effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Grimgrin\'s last ability resolves, the entire ability doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. You won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Grimgrin."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If Grimgrin\'s last ability resolves, but the targeted creature isn\'t destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), you\'ll still put a +1/+1 on Grimgrin."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the enchanted player has only one card in their graveyard, they exile that card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the enchanted player has only one card in their library, they put that card into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Maw of the Mire resolves, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will occur. You won’t gain 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control a Human, and an effect tries to destroy each Human you control and Angelic Overseer simultaneously, Angelic Overseer won’t be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control a Human, and lethal damage is dealt to Angelic Overseer, that damage will remain marked on it that turn. If later in the turn you no longer control a Human, Angelic Overseer will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control the only Vampire, Werewolf, or Zombie, you must target it with Slayer of the Wicked’s ability. You choose whether or not to destroy the target when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you have fewer than four cards in your library when Armored Skaab enters the battlefield, you’ll put all of them into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you only have one card in your graveyard when Make a Wish resolves, that card will be returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Make a Wish isn’t put into its owner’s graveyard until it is finished resolving, so it can’t be returned by its own effect.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The cards aren’t randomly chosen until Make a Wish resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If, during the enchanted player’s declare attackers step, a creature they control is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The enchanted player still chooses which player or planeswalker each creature they control attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In order to regenerate Werewolves involved in combat, you must sacrifice Full Moon’s Rise before combat damage is assigned. This means they will lose the +1/+0 and trample bonuses before combat damage assignment.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Like other lands, Stensia Bloodhall is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source, even though activating its ability requires colored mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Moonmist causes any double-faced Human to transform, not just Werewolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Moonmist will prevent combat damage dealt by a creature that isn’t a Werewolf or a Wolf even if that creature wasn’t on the battlefield (or was a Werewolf or a Wolf) when Moonmist resolved.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Whether or not a creature is a Werewolf or a Wolf is checked only as combat damage is dealt. If the creature isn’t a Werewolf or a Wolf at that time, its combat damage will be prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Once the ability has resolved, the bonus won’t change if the number of creatures you control changes later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The number of creatures you control is counted as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Once the enchanted creature has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature, causing it to stop being a Human won’t remove it from combat. It will lose the +2/+2 bonus, however.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only Lantern Spirit’s controller may activate its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only Vampires you control when Vampiric Fury resolves will receive the bonus. Creatures that enter the battlefield, that you gain control of later in the turn, or that become Vampires later in the turn won’t be affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Selfless Cathar’s ability resolves will be affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn will not.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can activate Selfless Cathar’s ability even if you control no other creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Skaab Ruinator is on the stack when you pay its costs. It can’t be exiled to pay for itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You must exile three creature cards from your graveyard no matter what zone you’re casting Skaab Ruinator from.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Spidery Grasp can target a creature that’s already untapped. It will still get +2/+4 and gain reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Starting with the player whose turn it is, each player chooses a creature in turn order. Players will know the choice of each player who chose before them.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Curse must be legally able to enchant the player. For example, if the player has protection from red, you couldn’t put a red Curse onto the battlefield this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Spirit card must already be in your graveyard when the ability triggers at the beginning of your upkeep. If there is no Spirit card in your graveyard when your upkeep begins, the ability will be removed from the stack with no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Vampire is destroyed before any combat damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability that defines Sturmgeist’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability will trigger when any creature deals combat damage to the enchanted player, including one controlled by another opponent or even by the enchanted player (if combat damage gets redirected somehow).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the toughness of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, not its toughness in the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The creature card isn’t chosen at random until the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Woodland Sleuth could die in response to its own morbid ability. If this happens, the ability could return Woodland Sleuth to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The first ability doesn’t reduce any colored mana requirements of the creature spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The mana cost and mana value of the spell are unchanged. Rooftop Storm only changes what you pay.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You must still pay any mandatory additional costs, such as exiling a creature card from your graveyard for Makeshift Mauler.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The morbid ability is mandatory. If you control the only non-Demon creature when the ability triggers, you must choose it as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The number of creature cards in your graveyard is counted when Spider Spawning resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The player discards a card even if they pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You must target a spell in order to cast Frightful Delusion. You can’t cast it without a legal target just to make a player discard a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The target creature with flying is chosen when the ability triggers and goes on the stack. You choose whether or not Geistcatcher’s Rig will deal 4 damage to it when then ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The targeted player chooses which card to exile when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The value of X is constantly updated as creature cards are put into or removed from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The value of X is constantly updated as instant cards and sorcery cards are put into or removed from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can choose to put the basic land card into your hand even if a creature died the turn you cast Caravan Vigil.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can regenerate Ulvenwald Primordials in response to the triggered ability that would transform it. If you do, the regeneration shield will apply to Ulvenwald Mystics that turn.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice the creature Demonmail Hauberk is equipping in order to equip it to another creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': '“Creature cards” includes each card with the type creature, even if it has additional types, such as artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage dealt to Manor Gargoyle while it has indestructible will stay marked on it that turn. If Manor Gargoyle loses indestructible after having been dealt lethal damage earlier in the turn, it will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Claustrophobia can target and enchant a tapped or untapped creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The enchanted creature can still be untapped in other ways. Claustrophobia will remain attached, and the creature will continue to not untap during its controller’s untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If Unruly Mob and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both attacking or blocking), Unruly Mob won\'t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can\'t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it."}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If multiple creatures you control die simultaneously, Thraben Sentry’s ability will trigger that many times. Only the first one to resolve will cause it to transform.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Although flashback and retrace are the most common ways to cast a spell from your graveyard, Burning Vengeance will trigger whenever you cast a spell from your graveyard through any means.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Burning Vengeance doesn’t trigger when you activate an ability of a card in your graveyard, such as unearth or the ability of Reassembling Skeleton.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Burning Vengeance’s triggered ability will resolve before the spell you cast from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Rally the Peasants resolves will be affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'You draw two cards and discard one randomly all while Desperate Ravings is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "A double-faced creature only has the name of the face that\'s up. For example, if Village Ironsmith is targeted by Sever the Bloodline, Ironfang wouldn\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Sever the Bloodline resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Only creatures on the battlefield will be exiled. In other zones, they\'re “creature cards,” not “creatures.”"}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'Unless a token is a copy of another permanent or was explicitly given a name by the effect that created it, its name is the subtypes it was given when it was created plus the word "Token." For example, if an effect creates a 1/1 Soldier creature token, that token is named "Soldier Token."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If Falkenrath Noble and another creature die at the same time, Falkenrath Noble\'s triggered ability will trigger for each of them."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as equip, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'No abilities of artifacts can be activated, including mana abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Stony Silence’s ability affects only artifacts on the battlefield. Activated abilities that work in other zones (such as cycling) can still be activated. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Evil Twin enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Evil Twin copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below) and it gains the activated ability. It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If Evil Twin somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Evil Twin can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Evil Twin copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Evil Twin is not a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Evil Twin), then your Evil Twin enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The activated ability that Evil Twin gains as part of its copy effect is a copiable value that other effects may copy.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Unless a token is a copy of another creature or was explicitly given a name by the effect that created it, its name is the creature types it was given when it was created. For example, the Beast tokens created by Thragtusk and by Baloth Cage Trap are both named “Beast.”'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Evil Twin enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature is a token, the token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is an Evil Twin), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If Olivia Voldaren deals lethal damage to a creature with its first activated ability, that creature will become a Vampire before dying.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If you activate Olivia Voldaren’s last ability, and before that ability resolves you lose control of Olivia Voldaren, the ability will resolve with no effect. You won’t gain control of the targeted Vampire.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For split cards, the flashback cost you pay is determined by the half you cast'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard already has flashback, you may use either flashback ability to cast it from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast a spell from a graveyard using its flashback ability, you can’t pay other alternative costs (such as that of Foil).'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may pay any optional additional costs the spell has, such as kicker costs. You must pay any mandatory additional costs the spell has, such as that of Tormenting Voice.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-17\', \'text\': \'Geist of Saint Traft is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Although the Angel is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the Angel can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the Angel token from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you create more than one Angel token (most likely due to Doubling Season), both are exiled at end of combat. On the other hand, if something else becomes a copy of the Angel token, the copy isn\'t exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the Angel token is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Geist of Saint Traft is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random as it’s returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Because the first ability doesn’t target the instant or sorcery card, any instants or sorceries put into your graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The instant or sorcery card returned to your hand is chosen at random as Charmbreaker Devils’s first ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be returned.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the equipped creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of the planeswalker is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The land card is counted when calculating the bonus, and it will be put into the graveyard with the other revealed cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Any toughness-modifying effects, counters, Auras, or Equipment will apply after its toughness is set to your former life total. For example, say Tree of Redemption is enchanted with Lunarch Mantle (which makes it 2/15) and your life total is 7. After the exchange, Tree of Redemption would be a 2/9 creature (its toughness became 7, which was then modified by Lunarch Mantle) and your life total would be 15.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Tree of Redemption isn\'t on the battlefield when its activated ability resolves, the exchange can\'t happen and the ability will have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "When its activated ability resolves, Tree of Redemption\'s toughness will become your former life total and you will gain or lose an amount of life necessary so that your life total equals Tree of Redemption\'s former toughness. Other effects that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If another creature dies at the same time as Murder of Crows, its last ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you activate Deranged Assistant\'s ability while casting a spell, you can\'t choose to rewind the ability once you see the card that was put into your graveyard."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger on the Homunculus token entering the battlefield will resolve after you’ve sacrificed a creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The creature you sacrifice for the ability of Stitcher’s Apprentice could be the Homunculus you’ve just created. It could also be Stitcher’s Apprentice itself.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You create a token and sacrifice a creature all while the activated ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'If Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the target creature indefinitely. This is different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if you lose the game, the creature exiled with Fiend Hunter remains exiled indefinitely. This is also different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Travel Preparations targets two creatures, and one of them is an illegal target by the time Travel Preparations resolves, you’ll still put a +1/+1 counter on the other creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can’t target the same creature twice to put two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Prey Upon resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The ability that defines Boneyard Wurm’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Boneyard Wurm is in your graveyard, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The damage dealt by Balefire Dragon’s triggered ability isn’t combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Pitchburn Devils is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the ability goes on the stack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Unlike Skirsdag High Priest itself, the two other creatures you tap to activate its ability aren\'t required to have been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when the morbid ability triggers, the ability must target Morkrut Banshee itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Morkrut Banshee\'s morbid ability triggers only once, not once for each creature that has died this turn. If no creatures have died by the time it enters the battlefield, its ability won\'t trigger at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple instances of flashback, you may choose any of its flashback costs to pay.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with no mana cost gains flashback, it has no flashback cost. It can\'t be cast this way."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a split card gains flashback, you pay only the cost of the half you\'re casting."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with flashback, you can\'t pay any alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell with flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Past in Flames affects only cards in your graveyard at the time it resolves. Instant and sorcery cards put into your graveyard later in the turn won\'t gain flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If for some reason you can’t win the game (because your opponent has cast Angel’s Grace this turn, for example), you won’t lose for having tried to draw a card from a library with no cards in it. The draw was still replaced.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If two or more players each control a Laboratory Maniac and each player is instructed to draw a number of cards, first the player whose turn it is draws that many cards. If this causes that player to win the game instead, the game is immediately over. If the game isn’t over yet, repeat this process for each other player in turn order.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'A pile can be empty. If the player chooses an empty pile, no permanents will be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'When Liliana’s first ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'When Liliana’s third ability resolves, you put each permanent the player controls into one of the two piles. For example, you could put a creature into one pile and an Aura enchanting that creature into the other pile.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'You can activate Liliana’s first ability even if some or all players will be unable to discard a card.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abteigreif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Dunkelheit verstecken sich Vampire und Ghule, aber wir sind auch nicht ohne Verbündete." —Lunarch Mikaeus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d91d03a-ec36-46a6-b951-dd9ab05a0680\', \'multiverseId\': 273611}, \'multiverseid\': 273611}, {\'name\': \'Grifo de la abadía\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"La oscuridad avanza con vampiros y necrófagos, pero no nos faltan aliados." —Mikaeus, el Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e47e53-c457-49fe-ba02-cb93e569c065\', \'multiverseId\': 273895}, \'multiverseid\': 273895}, {\'name\': "Griffon d\'abbaye", \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': \'« Les ténèbres grouillent de vampires et de goules, mais nous ne sommes pas sans alliés. » —Mikaeus, le lunarque\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273043&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25634a09-5f90-416a-9db7-6432997ede52\', \'multiverseId\': 273043}, \'multiverseid\': 273043}, {\'name\': "Grifone dell\'Abbazia", \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'oscurità brulica di vampiri e ghoul, ma non ci mancano gli alleati." —Mikaeus, il Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'624f12f2-bd53-43b0-85db-494b0c3bad31\', \'multiverseId\': 274179}, \'multiverseid\': 274179}, {\'name\': \'修道院のグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'「闇が吸血鬼やグールであふれるとて、我々に味方がおらぬわけでは無い。」 ――月皇ミケウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d1fa19-0a2d-41f9-9aa8-5746f029eeed\', \'multiverseId\': 274463}, \'multiverseid\': 274463}, {\'name\': \'수도원 그리핀\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그리핀\', \'flavor\': \'"암흑 속에는 흡혈귀들과 악귀들이 득실거리지만, 우리를 도와줄 자들이 없는 건 아니니라."—달의 교주 미케이우스\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25c0d20-0cf6-421c-8222-648434d647cc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Grifo da Abadia\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"A escuridão avança rastejante com vampiros e carniçais, mas nós também temos nossos aliados." — Mikaeus, o Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254eebe3-70b8-4536-a660-630c3c654eea\', \'multiverseId\': 272759}, \'multiverseid\': 272759}, {\'name\': \'Грифон Аббатства\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\', \'type\': \'Существо — Грифон\', \'flavor\': \'«Темнота кишит вампирами и упырями, но у нас найдутся союзники». — Микеас, Лунарх\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc2f031-d09d-475e-abaf-3991a9a1091a\', \'multiverseId\': 273327}, \'multiverseid\': 273327}, {\'name\': \'修道院狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼与食尸鬼在黑暗中潜伏，但我们并不缺盟友。」 ～月主教米凯耶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06fe0cf-c0d3-4f56-85ff-e39d577b4f39\', \'multiverseId\': 272191}, \'multiverseid\': 272191}, {\'name\': \'修道院獅鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～獅鷲\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼與食屍鬼在黑暗中潛伏，但我們並不缺盟友。」 ～月主教米凱耶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfd78d3-fe28-4895-9c53-c8cc66f4ddd5\', \'multiverseId\': 272475}, \'multiverseid\': 272475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adliger von Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Adlige von Falkenrath oder eine andere Kreatur stirbt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich denke oft darüber nach, wie aufregend es sein muss, von mir als Beute ausgewählt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5079483e-ec3b-41fc-ac03-286226546de8\', \'multiverseId\': 273522}, \'multiverseid\': 273522}, {\'name\': \'Noble Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Noble Falkenrath u otra criatura muera, el jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A veces pienso en lo felices que deben sentirse de ser elegidos como mi presa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ebd371-630b-46f4-934d-d9b4cb34b3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 273806}, \'multiverseid\': 273806}, {\'name\': \'Noble Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Noble Falkenrath ou une autre créature meurt, le joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Souvent, je me dis qu\'ils doivent être si excités d\'avoir été choisis par moi pour proie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ebbd14-ef67-448e-b8f0-84541ce103dc\', \'multiverseId\': 272954}, \'multiverseid\': 272954}, {\'name\': \'Nobile Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Nobile Falkenrath o un\'altra creatura muore, un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Penso spesso a quanto debbano essere emozionate per esser state scelte come mie prede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e9a3af-c57f-4f24-b2f6-92cda8e4055d\', \'multiverseId\': 274090}, \'multiverseid\': 274090}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの貴族\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nファルケンラスの貴族か他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「私は常々考えるのだ。私の餌食に選ばれたことで、奴らがどれだけ喜ぶべきなのかと言うことを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59668f58-7afa-4fbd-ac68-487851b8be6c\', \'multiverseId\': 274374}, \'multiverseid\': 274374}, {\'name\': \'팔켄라스가의 귀족\', \'text\': \'비행팔켄라스가의 귀족이나 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃고, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"난 가끔씩 내 사냥감으로 선택된 자들은 얼마나 흥분될까 생각하곤 한다."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ceb2a40-4f50-4381-8f73-5571777e7f64\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Nobre Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Nobre Falkenrath ou outra criatura morre, o jogador alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Penso sempre em como eles devem ficar entusiasmados de serem minhas presas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b25534a-5ad7-42bd-b8cb-7fe5b4411a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 272670}, \'multiverseid\': 272670}, {\'name\': \'Дворянин из Рода Фалькенратов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз когда Дворянин из Рода Фалькенратов или другое существо умирает, целевой игрок теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Я часто думаю о том, какое восхищение они должны испытывать от того, что я выбрал их добычей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd39db0d-28c8-49a4-895c-989cea7957c2\', \'multiverseId\': 273238}, \'multiverseid\': 273238}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳贵族\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当伐肯纳贵族或另一个生物死去时，目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我经常在想，被选为我的猎物者会感到多么刺激。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1bc3f33-3fda-4680-9b7e-7f80f8fb6ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 272102}, \'multiverseid\': 272102}, {\'name\': \'伐肯納貴族\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當伐肯納貴族或另一個生物死去時，目標玩家失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我經常在想，被選為我的獵物者會感到多麼刺激。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977475ca-2493-4d1f-9fb4-a82474c636c3\', \'multiverseId\': 272386}, \'multiverseid\': 272386}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adliger von Stromkirch\', \'text\': \'Der Adlige von Stromkirch kann nicht von Menschen geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Adlige von Stromkirch einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein verantwortlicher König begibt sich zu seinen Untertanen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273582&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c82630-17ab-4a24-8a47-ca136f300dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 273582}, \'multiverseid\': 273582}, {\'name\': \'Noble Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'El Noble Stromkirk no puede ser bloqueado por Humanos.\\nSiempre que el Noble Stromkirk haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un rey responsable camina entre sus súbditos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253a0031-bcab-48f8-ba85-3fc11a1f69ed\', \'multiverseId\': 273866}, \'multiverseid\': 273866}, {\'name\': \'Noble de Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Le Noble de Stromkirk ne peut pas être bloqué par les humains.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Noble de Stromkirk inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Un souverain responsable va rencontrer ses sujets. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333d25d9-fc99-486e-8546-991ed3f67886\', \'multiverseId\': 273014}, \'multiverseid\': 273014}, {\'name\': \'Nobile di Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Il Nobile di Stromkirk non può essere bloccato dagli Umani.\\nOgniqualvolta il Nobile di Stromkirk infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Nobile di Stromkirk.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un re responsabile cammina in mezzo ai suoi sudditi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1be35b8-79e3-4baa-abd5-1003d304105c\', \'multiverseId\': 274150}, \'multiverseid\': 274150}, {\'name\': \'流城の貴族\', \'text\': \'流城の貴族は人間にはブロックされない。\\n流城の貴族がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「賢明な王は臣下の中を歩く。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c572c478-4cca-450d-9298-3bdc1b754b10\', \'multiverseId\': 274434}, \'multiverseid\': 274434}, {\'name\': \'스트롬커크가의 귀족\', \'text\': \'스트롬커크가의 귀족은 인간에게 방어당할 수 없다.스트롬커크가의 귀족이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 스트롬커크가의 귀족에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"책임감 있는 왕이라면 백성들과 함께 다녀야 하거늘."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adfd926-6541-4b46-96b9-cd278255cec6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Nobre Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Nobre Stromkirk não pode ser bloqueado por Humanos.\\nToda vez que Nobre Stromkirk causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Um rei responsável caminha entre seus súditos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b74c830b-82be-4754-acf0-9e730f3b87e6\', \'multiverseId\': 272730}, \'multiverseid\': 272730}, {\'name\': \'Дворянин из Рода Стромкирков\', \'text\': \'Дворянин из Рода Стромкирков не может быть заблокирован существами с типом Человек.\\nКаждый раз когда Дворянин из Рода Стромкирков наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Сознательный король живет среди своих подданных».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f03256-3a76-4889-90e4-323347bc3006\', \'multiverseId\': 273298}, \'multiverseid\': 273298}, {\'name\': \'溪堡贵族\', \'text\': \'溪堡贵族不能被人类阻挡。\\n每当溪堡贵族对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「认真负责的国王当与臣民同行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f074e715-03cc-40c8-966c-61273a96f9c3\', \'multiverseId\': 272162}, \'multiverseid\': 272162}, {\'name\': \'溪堡貴族\', \'text\': \'溪堡貴族不能被人類阻擋。\\n每當溪堡貴族對一位玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「認真負責的國王當與臣民同行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c112d0e-f024-4639-8575-22a2df0a8b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 272446}, \'multiverseid\': 272446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett des Reisenden\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere das Amulett des Reisenden: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Reiter verschwand im unheimlichen Nebel, in seine Rüstung eingewickelt und mit Amuletten beladen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ce13ca-c659-40ec-aebf-df660b7801bc\', \'multiverseId\': 273625}, \'multiverseid\': 273625}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del viajero\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar el Amuleto del viajero: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El jinete se aventuró en la extraña niebla, cubierto de armadura y cargado de amuletos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc76ed16-4286-4684-8c33-b0b0247115ad\', \'multiverseId\': 273909}, \'multiverseid\': 273909}, {\'name\': \'Amulette du voyageur\', \'text\': "{1}, sacrifiez l\'Amulette du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cavalier disparut dans l\'étrange brume, portant armure et bardé d\'amulettes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117a2309-f74f-43df-8a2b-5801bc85f352\', \'multiverseId\': 273057}, \'multiverseid\': 273057}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': "{1}, Sacrifica l\'Amuleto del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il cavaliere si mise in viaggio nella nebbia innaturale, fasciato nell\'armatura e carico di amuleti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709129c9-34c8-4ae2-ace0-07a3fae46f93\', \'multiverseId\': 274193}, \'multiverseid\': 274193}, {\'name\': \'旅行者の護符\', \'text\': \'{1}, 旅行者の護符を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'乗り手は、鎧に身を包み、護符を山とつけて、不気味な霧の中へ乗り込んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3ea2d5-68c9-4502-91d8-fddd437bc725\', \'multiverseId\': 274477}, \'multiverseid\': 274477}, {\'name\': \'여행자의 부적\', \'text\': \', 여행자의 부적을 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그리고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'그 기사는 갑주를 두르고 부적을 잔뜩 지닌 채 으스스한 안개 속으로 출발했다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd59a3d1-7b60-45cd-8528-4ecff3016e67\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto do Viajante\', \'text\': \'{1}, Sacrifique Amuleto do Viajante: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O ginete partiu pelas brumas misteriosas, coberto de armaduras e carregado de amuletos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5690fe0-5793-4aa5-80fd-3fd3d9549b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 272773}, \'multiverseid\': 272773}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Путешественника\', \'text\': \'{1}, пожертвуйте Амулет Путешественника: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Облаченный в доспехи и обвешанный амулетами, всадник тронулся навстречу жутковатому туману.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04ffc6c-4863-4480-b7e7-bb10571cdc76\', \'multiverseId\': 273341}, \'multiverseid\': 273341}, {\'name\': \'旅人护身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲旅人护身符：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并将它置入你手上。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'旅人策马穿入神秘雾气，紧裹着铠甲，戴满各式护身符。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce418445-fc76-4549-bbe8-cc57deb921dd\', \'multiverseId\': 272205}, \'multiverseid\': 272205}, {\'name\': \'旅人護身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，犧牲旅人護身符：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，並將它置入你手上。 然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'旅人策馬穿入神秘霧氣，緊裹著鎧甲，戴滿各式護身符。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8bfccb0-8d4a-4485-8844-4281f72436fc\', \'multiverseId\': 272489}, \'multiverseid\': 272489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angespitzte Mistgabel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Erstschlag.\\nSolange die ausgerüstete Kreatur ein Mensch ist, erhält sie +1/+1.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht jeder kann ein Schwert aus gesegnetem Silber haben. Aber auch nicht jeder braucht eines.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955f724d-85d1-4e04-a9c8-d978d4df4908\', \'multiverseId\': 273459}, \'multiverseid\': 273459}, {\'name\': \'Tridente afilado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\\nMientras la criatura equipada sea Humano, obtiene +1/+1.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'No todos pueden tener una espada de plata bendita. No todos la necesitan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60cd103-ffc9-432a-8450-c8e4b79dd438\', \'multiverseId\': 273743}, \'multiverseid\': 273743}, {\'name\': \'Fourche aiguisée\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a l\'initiative.\\nTant que la créature équipée est un humain, elle gagne +1/+1.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Ce n\'est pas tout le monde qui a une épée d\'argent béni. Ce n\'est pas tout le monde qui en a besoin non plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d77c65e-3041-4e38-81d3-c83acabc8575\', \'multiverseId\': 272891}, \'multiverseid\': 272891}, {\'name\': \'Forcone Affilato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha attacco improvviso.\\nFintanto che la creatura equipaggiata è un Umano, prende +1/+1.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Non tutti possono avere una spada d\'argento benedetto. Però, non tutti ne hanno bisogno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69cdf71-940e-42c2-8697-6e86da39ed6a\', \'multiverseId\': 274027}, \'multiverseid\': 274027}, {\'name\': \'とがった三つ叉\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが人間であるかぎり、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備 {1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'誰もが祝福された銀の剣を持っているわけではない。 誰もがそれを必要としているわけでもないが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d49f64c5-1270-4c8c-99e2-b2757edd13b5\', \'multiverseId\': 274311}, \'multiverseid\': 274311}, {\'name\': \'날카로운 쇠스랑\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 선제공격 능력을 가진다.장착된 생물이 인간이라면, 그 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.장착\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'아무나 신성한 은으로 만든 검을 가질 수 있는 건 아니고, 모두가 그런 무기를 필요로 하는 것도 아니다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c10724-2839-4e28-97ec-9639ebea1f15\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ancinho Afiado\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem iniciativa.\\nEnquanto a criatura equipada for do tipo Humano, ela receberá +1/+1.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Nem todos podem ter uma espada de prata abençoada. Na verdade, nem todos precisam de uma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7125576-356f-495d-90fe-3513f6f03e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 272607}, \'multiverseid\': 272607}, {\'name\': \'Заточенные Вилы\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Первый удар.\\nПока снаряженное существо является Человеком, оно получает +1/+1.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Не каждый может позволить себе меч из благословенного серебра. Но и нужен он тоже далеко не каждому.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5acfce3c-70e0-450b-80ad-15a6e96d8974\', \'multiverseId\': 273175}, \'multiverseid\': 273175}, {\'name\': \'尖利草叉\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有先攻异能。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物是人类，它便得+1/+1。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'并非人人都可拥有受祝福的银剑。 但也并非人人都有此需要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444255c7-1482-4a33-b746-48989de77e22\', \'multiverseId\': 272039}, \'multiverseid\': 272039}, {\'name\': \'尖利草叉\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有先攻異能。\\n只要佩帶此武具的生物是人類，它便得+1/+1。\\n佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'並非人人都可擁有受祝福的銀劍。 但也並非人人都有此需要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b6a563-518f-4477-94b3-c585b3cebe13\', \'multiverseId\': 272323}, \'multiverseid\': 272323}]', '[{\'name\': \'Apparatur des Geisterfängers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Apparatur des Geisterfängers ins Spiel kommt, kannst du sie einer fliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Apparate waren überall verboten — außer in Nefalen, wo bösartige Geister so häufig sind wie verrückte Erfinder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3cdd0d-8682-457d-845a-ce1eb7c8f865\', \'multiverseId\': 273606}, \'multiverseid\': 273606}, {\'name\': \'Aparejo del atrapageist\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Aparejo del atrapageist entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que le haga 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Los aparejos están prohibidos salvo en Nephalia, donde los espíritus malignos son tan numerosos como los inventores locos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc633407-c6d7-49ed-b8a2-ab989cb5e111\', \'multiverseId\': 273890}, \'multiverseid\': 273890}, {\'name\': \'Moissonneuse de chasse-geist\', \'text\': "Quand la Moissonneuse de chasse-geist arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'Les moissonneuses étaient interdites partout sauf en Néphalie, où les esprits malins sont aussi nombreux que les inventeurs fous.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44662a9d-11cc-4e1d-b644-8ec7ca5f8603\', \'multiverseId\': 273038}, \'multiverseid\': 273038}, {\'name\': \'Carrozza del Catturageist\', \'text\': \'Quando la Carrozza del Catturageist entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi farle infliggere 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Queste carrozze erano proibite ovunque tranne che in Nephalia, dove gli spiriti maligni sono numerosi quanto gli inventori pazzi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ee59fc-1567-4c15-9bd3-7fde80bfed85\', \'multiverseId\': 274174}, \'multiverseid\': 274174}, {\'name\': \'霊捕らえの装置\', \'text\': \'霊捕らえの装置が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「霊捕らえの装置はそれに４点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'この装置は違法だが、狂った発明家が害のある霊魂と同じぐらいいるネファリアでは話が別だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d8c8185-c044-4efe-8875-a91e27e944cb\', \'multiverseId\': 274458}, \'multiverseid\': 274458}, {\'name\': \'심령 채집기\', \'text\': \'심령 채집기가 전장에 들어올 때, 비행 능력을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 심령 채집기로 하여금 그 생물에게 피해 4점을 입히도록 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'이 장치는 거의 모든 지역에서 금지되었지만, 정신나간 발명광들만큼 사악한 혼령들이 많은 네팔리아에서만큼은 예외였다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72910032-51da-4cee-adfc-5c4010fcef34\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Carroça do Caçador de Geists\', \'text\': \'Quando Carroça do Caçador de Geists entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que ela cause 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'As carroças foram declaradas ilegais, exceto em Nefália, onde os espíritos malignos são tão abundantes quanto os inventores malucos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822a7a0e-657e-406b-8ee6-07795d3af046\', \'multiverseId\': 272754}, \'multiverseid\': 272754}, {\'name\': \'Упряжка Ловушки Привидений\', \'text\': \'Когда Упряжка Ловушки Привидений выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить ее нанести 4 повреждения целевому существу с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Упряжки были запрещены повсюду, кроме Нефалии, где злых духов так же много, как и сумасшедших изобретателей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c090551-dae2-46a4-8bcb-4997186ff017\', \'multiverseId\': 273322}, \'multiverseid\': 273322}, {\'name\': \'游魂捕捉械\', \'text\': \'当游魂捕捉械进战场时，你可以让它对目标具飞行异能的生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'这机械在所有地方都是非法物品，但充满恶毒鬼魂与疯狂发明家的涅非利亚除外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2262ff50-86ed-424a-a498-80bdc36f5b19\', \'multiverseId\': 272186}, \'multiverseid\': 272186}, {\'name\': \'遊魂捕捉械\', \'text\': \'當遊魂捕捉械進戰場時，你可以讓它對目標具飛行異能的生物造成4點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'這機械在所有地方都是非法物品，但充滿惡毒鬼魂與瘋狂發明家的涅非利亞除外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09fad0d2-15ec-4c4e-b47d-3434e981b8ba\', \'multiverseId\': 272470}, \'multiverseid\': 272470}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arglist des Waldläufers\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und ist fluchsicher. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'In den abgelegenen Gegenden von Kessig findet man Schutz auch durch geheime Kräfte, die der Kirche von Avacyn unbekannt sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6bba3cf-0ad1-47d9-abc1-6a66e3f4a177\', \'multiverseId\': 273704}, \'multiverseid\': 273704}, {\'name\': \'Astucia del guardabosque\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En los rincones remotos de Kessig, encontrarás protección en poderes secretos desconocidos por la Iglesia de Avacyn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59649b1e-2dc8-4d23-b04c-bd9117e8c6cb\', \'multiverseId\': 273988}, \'multiverseid\': 273988}, {\'name\': \'Sagacité du ranger\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Dans les coins les plus reculés de Kessig, on trouve protection dans des pouvoirs secrets inconnus de l\'Église d\' Avacyn.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387dac9b-23d1-4b63-94f3-6a9a061bbf98\', \'multiverseId\': 273136}, \'multiverseid\': 273136}, {\'name\': \'Astuzia del Ranger\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 e ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nei più lontani angoli di Kessig, si trova protezione in poteri segreti sconosciuti alla Chiesa di Avacyn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24946d6e-1ed8-4248-8266-50b7a5458dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 274272}, \'multiverseid\': 274272}, {\'name\': \'レインジャーの悪知恵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに呪禁を得る。 （それはあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ケッシグの辺鄙な場所では、アヴァシン教の知らない秘密の力で守護が成される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd6451c-8d0a-4b67-935a-0493fea8efd4\', \'multiverseId\': 274556}, \'multiverseid\': 274556}, {\'name\': \'레인저의 간계\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 방호 능력을 얻는다. (방호를 가진 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'케시그의 외딴 지역 주민들은 아바신의 교리가 설명하지 못하는 힘의 보호를 받는다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab353a98-977f-4082-af8d-fc0d21091102\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ardil do Patrulheiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 e ganha resistência à magia até o final do turno. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nos cantos remotos de Kessig, a proteção é encontrada em poderes secretos desconhecidos pela Igreja de Avacyn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06799d6d-445e-4d6a-a71a-914f9b6f9376\', \'multiverseId\': 272852}, \'multiverseid\': 272852}, {\'name\': \'Хитрость Лесничего\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 и Порчеустойчивость до конца хода. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'В далеких уголках Кессига защиту обретают в тайных силах, неведомых Церкви Авацины.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fc40d9-fdaa-4058-8d86-033d9cae3434\', \'multiverseId\': 273420}, \'multiverseid\': 273420}, {\'name\': \'护林人的智谋\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1并获得辟邪异能。 （它不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在凯锡革的边陲地带，保护力量来自艾维欣教会无从知晓的来源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e3286a5-9693-4fe8-b659-254729cc901e\', \'multiverseId\': 272284}, \'multiverseid\': 272284}, {\'name\': \'護林人的智謀\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+1/+1並獲得辟邪異能。 （它不能成為由對手所操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在凱錫革的邊陲地帶，保護力量來自艾維欣教會無從知曉的來源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3151802b-d5c2-46e9-a655-0c54a5be80a2\', \'multiverseId\': 272568}, \'multiverseid\': 272568}]', "[{'name': 'Armee der Verdammten', 'text': 'Bringe dreizehn 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine getappt ins Spiel.\\nRückblende {7}{B}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Manchmal klopft der Tod an. Manchmal reißt er auch Wände ein.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273565&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f56a121-acb7-4210-8842-7dfbfe7d8861', 'multiverseId': 273565}, 'multiverseid': 273565}, {'name': 'Ejército de los condenados', 'text': 'Pon en el campo de batalla giradas trece fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{B}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'A veces la muerte golpea a tu puerta. A veces tira abajo las paredes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273849&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08014240-ad7e-4639-bd63-ef94af1a1274', 'multiverseId': 273849}, 'multiverseid': 273849}, {'name': 'Armée des damnés', 'text': 'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, engagés, treize jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Parfois la mort vient frapper à votre porte. Parfois, elle défonce les murs.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272997&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dba662a-c6b8-43ef-b789-b5a8973be730', 'multiverseId': 272997}, 'multiverseid': 272997}, {'name': 'Esercito dei Dannati', 'text': 'Metti sul campo di battaglia tredici pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere TAPpate.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'A volte la morte viene bussando. A volte sfonda le pareti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274133&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4647fdd0-9e99-4c1c-8c48-5e2b10673ea8', 'multiverseId': 274133}, 'multiverseid': 274133}, {'name': '忌むべき者の軍団', 'text': '黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを13体、タップ状態で戦場に出す。\\nフラッシュバック {7}{B}{B}{B} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ときに死は扉を叩く。 ときに死は壁をぶち破る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274417&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ec3de1b-9cf9-4c60-839f-ca18fdc58117', 'multiverseId': 274417}, 'multiverseid': 274417}, {'name': '저주받은 자들의 군대', 'text': '2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 열세 개를 탭된 채로 전장에 놓는다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을\\n지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22347156-f379-4e9c-872d-94e23dc91d6d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Exército dos Malditos', 'text': 'Coloque no campo de batalha treze fichas de criatura pretas 2/2 do tipo Zumbi viradas.\\nRecapitular {7}{B}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Algumas vezes, a morte bate na porta. Outras vezes, ela derruba a parede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272713&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b443ed54-5376-42c8-ba87-5c790b3406de', 'multiverseId': 272713}, 'multiverseid': 272713}, {'name': 'Полчище Проклятых', 'text': 'Положите на поле битвы повернутыми тринадцать фишек существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\nВоспоминание {7}{B}{B}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Иногда смерть стучится в дверь. А иногда ломает стены.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273281&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c46b7ca-5a04-4884-a6d1-3f81d5084ed9', 'multiverseId': 273281}, 'multiverseid': 273281}, {'name': '厄亡者大军', 'text': '将十三个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物横置放进战场。\\n返照{7}{B}{B}{B} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '有时死亡会先敲个门。 有时它连墙壁都拆掉。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14e8f7b9-0586-49c4-895f-4e1d3cc2a309', 'multiverseId': 272145}, 'multiverseid': 272145}, {'name': '厄亡者大軍', 'text': '將十三個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物橫置放進戰場。\\n返照{7}{B}{B}{B} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '有時死亡會先敲個門。 有時它連牆壁都拆掉。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272429&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1254d281-6284-4e3a-bfdb-53cbefce8d5b', 'multiverseId': 272429}, 'multiverseid': 272429}]", "[{'name': 'Aschenmaul-Hund', 'text': 'Immer wenn der Aschenmaul-Hund eine Kreatur blockt oder von ihr geblockt wird, fügt der Aschenmaul-Hund dieser Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund', 'flavor': 'Seine feurigen Pfoten hinterlassen deutliche Spuren, was sehr nützlich ist, wenn man in die entgegengesetzte Richtung gehen will.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273597&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1061dd4a-043a-482d-ab0c-25501ea66628', 'multiverseId': 273597}, 'multiverseid': 273597}, {'name': 'Sabueso de Bocaceniza', 'text': 'Siempre que el Sabueso de Bocaceniza bloquee o sea bloqueado por una criatura, el Sabueso de Bocaceniza hace 1 puntos de daño a esa criatura.', 'type': 'Criatura — Perro elemental', 'flavor': 'Sus garras lo hacen fácil de rastrear, lo que es muy útil cuando quieres ir exactamente en la dirección opuesta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273881&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7277e7a-f5da-4500-8db2-9073b144ca3a', 'multiverseId': 273881}, 'multiverseid': 273881}, {'name': 'Chien de Cendregueule', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Chien de Cendregueule bloque ou devient bloqué par une créature, le Chien de Cendregueule inflige 1 blessure à cette créature.', 'type': 'Créature : élémental et chien de chasse', 'flavor': 'Ses pattes brûlantes rendent ses traces faciles à pister, ce qui est très utile quand vous voulez prendre la direction opposée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273029&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa726a9a-1389-4437-9f3e-95394d8ab49e', 'multiverseId': 273029}, 'multiverseid': 273029}, {'name': 'Segugio Fauci di Cenere', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta il Segugio Fauci di Cenere blocca o viene bloccato da una creatura, il Segugio Fauci di Cenere infligge 1 danno a quella creatura.', 'type': 'Creatura — Segugio Elementale', 'flavor': 'Le sue zampe infuocate rendono le sue orme facili da riconoscere, che è molto utile quando vuoi andare proprio nella direzione opposta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274165&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec273b83-fb4e-4956-a457-7511234c2652', 'multiverseId': 274165}, 'multiverseid': 274165}, {'name': '灰口の猟犬', 'text': '灰口の猟犬がいずれかのクリーチャーをブロックするかいずれかのクリーチャーにブロックされた状態になるたび、灰口の猟犬はそのクリーチャーに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・猟犬', 'flavor': 'その燃える足を見つけることは容易く、真逆の方向に進むためにはこれほど役立つものは無い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274449&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '582ae865-e9a4-4835-877b-2ded1727f7b6', 'multiverseId': 274449}, 'multiverseid': 274449}, {'name': '애쉬마우스의 사냥개', 'text': '애쉬마우스의 사냥개가 생물을 방어하거나 생물에게 방어당할 때마다, 애쉬마우스의 사냥개는 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.', 'type': '생물 — 사냥개 정령', 'flavor': '그것의 발굽은 불타기 때문에 어느 방향으로 갔는지를 파악하는 것은 쉽다. 따라서 그 반대 방향으로 도망가는 것 역시 쉽다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd76e6d56-4351-4f59-9ac0-685a7c33b21a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sabujo de Boca Cinzenta', 'text': 'Toda vez que Sabujo de Boca Cinzenta bloquear ou for bloqueado por uma criatura, ele causará 1 ponto de dano àquela criatura.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental Sabujo', 'flavor': 'Suas patas ardentes são fáceis de rastrear, o que é muito útil quando você quer ir exatamente na direção oposta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272745&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43ce4a46-6a4e-46e3-8aca-04c1bf09346b', 'multiverseId': 272745}, 'multiverseid': 272745}, {'name': 'Пес Пепельной Пропасти', 'text': 'Каждый раз когда Пес Пепельной Пропасти блокирует или становится заблокирован существом, Пес Пепельной Пропасти наносит тому существу 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль Пес', 'flavor': 'Его огненные следы несложно обнаружить, что особенно на руку, когда вы хотите скрыться в противоположном направлении.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273313&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8e84e35-c8e0-4100-a783-7e70331f6c7a', 'multiverseId': 273313}, 'multiverseid': 273313}, {'name': '烬口猎犬', 'text': '每当烬口猎犬阻挡生物或被生物阻挡时，烬口猎犬对该生物造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物～元素／猎犬', 'flavor': '他强猛脚爪留下的痕迹极易辨识，当你需要避走其相反方向时非常有用。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272177&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '131699be-e1ae-4459-bbfa-89f401dbaba9', 'multiverseId': 272177}, 'multiverseid': 272177}, {'name': '燼口獵犬', 'text': '每當燼口獵犬阻擋生物或被生物阻擋時，燼口獵犬對該生物造成1點傷害。', 'type': '生物～元素／獵犬', 'flavor': '牠強猛腳爪留下的痕跡極易辨識，當你需要避走其相反方向時非常有用。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272461&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6304150b-ec83-4fd4-83df-3d1b40969665', 'multiverseId': 272461}, 'multiverseid': 272461}]", '[{\'name\': \'Atemlose Horde\', \'text\': \'Die Atemlose Horde kommt mit jeweils einer +1/+1-Marke für jede Zombie-Karte in deinem Friedhof und für jeden anderen Zombie, den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel.\\nFalls der Atemlosen Horde Schaden zugefügt würde, verhindere diesen Schaden und entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von ihr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ac167e-8c19-49ae-bd0a-93a09b34b752\', \'multiverseId\': 273583}, \'multiverseid\': 273583}, {\'name\': \'Horda sin aliento\', \'text\': \'La Horda sin aliento entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella por cada otro Zombie que controlas y cada carta de Zombie en tu cementerio.\\nSi la Horda sin aliento fuera a recibir daño, prevén ese daño y remueve un contador +1/+1 de ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55b595c-4e43-433c-a246-68187c71551a\', \'multiverseId\': 273867}, \'multiverseid\': 273867}, {\'name\': \'Horde sans souffle\', \'text\': \'La Horde sans souffle arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque autre zombie que vous contrôlez et chaque carte de zombie dans votre cimetière.\\nSi la Horde sans souffle devait subir des blessures, prévenez ces blessures et retirez-lui un marqueur +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02f9c4a-98cd-4441-9ab9-f879d03b1466\', \'multiverseId\': 273015}, \'multiverseid\': 273015}, {\'name\': \'Orda Senza Respiro\', \'text\': "L\'Orda Senza Respiro entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni altro Zombie che controlli e per ogni carta Zombie nel tuo cimitero.\\nSe all\'Orda Senza Respiro sta per essere inflitto danno, previeni quel danno e rimuovi da essa un segnalino +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a4a34c1-8dfa-4d10-bd36-7a2290fb793c\', \'multiverseId\': 274151}, \'multiverseid\': 274151}, {\'name\': \'息せぬ群れ\', \'text\': \'息せぬ群れは、あなたがコントロールしている他のゾンビ・クリーチャー１体およびあなたの墓地にあるゾンビ・カード１枚につき、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n息せぬ群れにダメージが与えられる場合、そのダメージを軽減し、それの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8eb7c0f-0fcb-465d-8133-d0e9b15358db\', \'multiverseId\': 274435}, \'multiverseid\': 274435}, {\'name\': \'숨쉬지 않는 군단\', \'text\': \'숨쉬지 않는 군단은 당신이 조종하는 다른 좀비 지속물 한 개당, 그리고 당신의 무덤에 있는 좀비 카드 한 장당 +1/+1 카운터 한 개씩을 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.숨쉬지 않는 군단이 피해를 입으려 하면, 그 피해를 방지하고 숨쉬지 않는 군단으로부터 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e662a9ca-78f6-41b1-9efd-1d07cdf79728\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Horda Sem Respiro\', \'text\': \'Horda Sem Respiro entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele para cada outro Zumbi que você controla e cada card do tipo Zumbi no seu cemitério.\\nSe Horda Sem Respiro for sofrer dano, previna aquele dano e remova um marcador +1/+1 dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395a0854-e184-49c9-a906-865ee9712815\', \'multiverseId\': 272731}, \'multiverseid\': 272731}, {\'name\': \'Бездыханная Орда\', \'text\': \'Бездыханная Орда выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на ней за каждого другого Зомби под вашим контролем и каждую карту Зомби на вашем кладбище.\\nЕсли Бездыханной Орде должны быть нанесены повреждения, предотвратите те повреждения и удалите с нее один жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0915f7e1-d897-4098-a240-6f6d5b4aa4fd\', \'multiverseId\': 273299}, \'multiverseid\': 273299}, {\'name\': \'无生气大军\', \'text\': \'无生气大军进战场时上面有若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于由你操控的其他灵俑数量与你坟墓场中的灵俑牌数量之总和。\\n如果无生气大军将受到伤害，则防止该伤害，并从其上移去一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a4b461-1c1b-4f2d-ad89-bcb0bf33012b\', \'multiverseId\': 272163}, \'multiverseid\': 272163}, {\'name\': \'無生氣大軍\', \'text\': \'無生氣大軍進戰場時上面有若干+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於由你操控的其他殭屍數量與你墳墓場中的殭屍牌數量之總和。\\n如果無生氣大軍將受到傷害，則防止該傷害，並從其上移去一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740b4934-beda-4015-a5fb-31a30f2687c9\', \'multiverseId\': 272447}, \'multiverseid\': 272447}]', "[{'name': 'Aufgehender Vollmond', 'text': 'Werwolf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nOpfere den Aufgehenden Vollmond: Regeneriere alle Werwolf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Manche Lykanthropen wünschen sich, sie könnten ihre schwachen menschlichen Hüllen ablegen und nur noch Wolf sein.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273633&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '883b5930-34b7-4f24-a4c9-e93eadab0b34', 'multiverseId': 273633}, 'multiverseid': 273633}, {'name': 'Ascenso de la luna llena', 'text': 'Las criaturas Licántropo que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSacrificar el Ascenso de la luna llena: Regenera todas las criaturas licántropo que controlas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Algunos licántropos desean poder abandonar la débil forma humana y disfrutar del poder del lobo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273917&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd6946d6-2689-41dd-a898-92124317dd13', 'multiverseId': 273917}, 'multiverseid': 273917}, {'name': 'Lever de pleine lune', 'text': 'Les créatures Loup-garou que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et ont le piétinement.\\nSacrifiez le Lever de pleine lune : Régénérez toutes les créatures Loup-garou que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Certains lycanthropes souhaiteraient pouvoir abandonner leur faible forme humaine et se réjouir de la puissance du loup.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273065&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ce201ef-9172-4220-b511-2fa68ca8617d', 'multiverseId': 273065}, 'multiverseid': 273065}, {'name': 'Sorgere della Luna Piena', 'text': 'Le creature Mannaro che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno travolgere.\\nSacrifica Sorgere della Luna Piena: Rigenera tutte le creature Mannaro che controlli.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Alcuni licantropi vorrebbero poter abbandonare le loro deboli forme umane e godersi il potere del lupo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274201&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7478b03e-a011-4fae-b1db-e4ca11362d97', 'multiverseId': 274201}, 'multiverseid': 274201}, {'name': '昇る満月', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする狼男・クリーチャーは、＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを持つ。\\n昇る満月を生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールするすべての狼男・クリーチャーを再生する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '獣人の中には、弱い人間の姿を捨て、狼の力を享楽することを願っている者もいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274485&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63328ef8-ca66-4105-8cda-36aad4ec55fb', 'multiverseId': 274485}, 'multiverseid': 274485}, {'name': '보름달의 밤', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 늑대인간 생물들은 +1/+0을 받고 돌진 능력을 가진다.보름달의 밤을 희생한다: 당신이 조종하는 모든 늑대인간 생물들을 재생한다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '몇몇 늑대인간들은 자신의 나약한 인체를 버리고 완전한 늑대의 힘에 심취하고 싶어한다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7237835a-76bc-43a7-b98f-be8167a3101e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nascer da Lua Cheia', 'text': 'As criaturas do tipo Lobisomem que você controla recebem +1/+0 e têm atropelar.\\nSacrifique Nascer da Lua Cheia: Regenere todas as criaturas do tipo Lobisomem que você controla.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Alguns licantropos gostariam de poder abandonar suas formas humanas para deleitar-se no poder do lobo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272781&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22f74aba-fcb7-4839-b923-17ac1822e159', 'multiverseId': 272781}, 'multiverseid': 272781}, {'name': 'Восход Полной Луны', 'text': 'Существа-Вервольфы под вашим контролем получают +1/+0 и имеют Пробивной удар.\\nПожертвуйте Восход Полной Луны: регенерируйте все существа с типом Вервольф под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Некоторые ликантропы мечтают избавиться от слабого человеческого облика и наслаждаться силой волка.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273349&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fe3e4d9-b0af-4721-8df0-6d55217d73b7', 'multiverseId': 273349}, 'multiverseid': 273349}, {'name': '满月升起', 'text': '由你操控的狼人生物得+1/+0并具有践踏异能。\\n牺牲满月升起：重生由你操控的所有狼人生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '某些化狼者希望自己能摆脱虚弱的人身，并着迷于狼的力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272213&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd42e767-7fc9-4548-b92f-a7aa368ecd23', 'multiverseId': 272213}, 'multiverseid': 272213}, {'name': '滿月升起', 'text': '由你操控的狼人生物得+1/+0並具有踐踏異能。\\n犧牲滿月升起：重生由你操控的所有狼人生物。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '某些化狼者希望自己能擺脫虛弱的人身，並著迷於狼的力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272497&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fefe3cd-4ace-4f94-9399-d3359273b5ef', 'multiverseId': 272497}, 'multiverseid': 272497}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufhetzertrupp // Wildblutrudel\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Aufhetzertrupp, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Aufhetzertrupp\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ae1166-0d40-442b-82d3-86646d138eba\', \'multiverseId\': 273558}, \'multiverseid\': 273558}, {\'name\': \'Banda instigadora // Manada Sangre Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas atacantes que controles obtienen +1/+0.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma a la Banda instigadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Banda instigadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8355c13e-55e4-416a-aa04-f59160fd5679\', \'multiverseId\': 273842}, \'multiverseid\': 273842}, {\'name\': \'Gang instigateur // Meute sangsauvage\', \'text\': "Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Gang instigateur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gang instigateur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edfe4ff5-11d0-4196-89d0-c53b4335d756\', \'multiverseId\': 272990}, \'multiverseid\': 272990}, {\'name\': \'Banda di Fomentatori // Branco del Sangue Selvaggio\', \'text\': "Le creature attaccanti che controlli prendono +1/+0.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma la Banda di Fomentatori.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Banda di Fomentatori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27901c64-5b1a-43a4-8d66-ffdbd831bee0\', \'multiverseId\': 274126}, \'multiverseid\': 274126}, {\'name\': \'扇動する集団 // 野生の血の群れ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、扇動する集団を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'扇動する集団\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e016e513-659d-47ab-8846-71876004eabf\', \'multiverseId\': 274410}, \'multiverseid\': 274410}, {\'name\': \'선동하는 패거리 // 야생혈 늑대떼\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 공격생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 선동하는 패거리를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'선동하는 패거리\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e9db93-aefd-4c79-b2a3-14d00ceb9a3a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gangue de Instigadores // Alcateia do Sangue Selvagem\', \'text\': \'As criaturas atacantes que você controla recebem +1/+0.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Gangue de Instigadores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gangue de Instigadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f79f0f8-f7d1-4410-b802-9793a99e3ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 272706}, \'multiverseid\': 272706}, {\'name\': \'Банда Подстрекателей // Стая Дикой Крови\', \'text\': \'Атакующие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Банду Подстрекателей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Банда Подстрекателей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9214c4ea-2465-4ef6-ad2a-317687740abd\', \'multiverseId\': 273274}, \'multiverseid\': 273274}, {\'name\': \'煽动党徒 // 野血狼群\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的生物得+1/+0。\\n在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化煽动党徒。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'煽动党徒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f587b33-deba-44ba-ae27-6764507a92e8\', \'multiverseId\': 272138}, \'multiverseid\': 272138}, {\'name\': \'煽動黨徒 // 野血狼群\', \'text\': \'由你操控且進行攻擊的生物得+1/+0。\\n在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化煽動黨徒。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'煽動黨徒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da53c9f-289b-49a7-aaf2-c14b4283ebc8\', \'multiverseId\': 272422}, \'multiverseid\': 272422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufhetzertrupp // Wildblutrudel\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAngreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+0.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments das Wildblutrudel, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Wildblutrudel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ae1166-0d40-442b-82d3-86646d138eba\', \'multiverseId\': 273558}, \'multiverseid\': 273558}, {\'name\': \'Banda instigadora // Manada Sangre Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nLas criaturas atacantes que controlas obtienen +3/+0.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma a la Manada Sangre Salvaje.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Manada Sangre Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8355c13e-55e4-416a-aa04-f59160fd5679\', \'multiverseId\': 273842}, \'multiverseid\': 273842}, {\'name\': \'Gang instigateur // Meute sangsauvage\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLes créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+0.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez la Meute sangsauvage.\', \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Meute sangsauvage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edfe4ff5-11d0-4196-89d0-c53b4335d756\', \'multiverseId\': 272990}, \'multiverseid\': 272990}, {\'name\': \'Banda di Fomentatori // Branco del Sangue Selvaggio\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nLe creature attaccanti che controlli prendono +3/+0.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma il Branco del Sangue Selvaggio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Branco del Sangue Selvaggio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27901c64-5b1a-43a4-8d66-ffdbd831bee0\', \'multiverseId\': 274126}, \'multiverseid\': 274126}, {\'name\': \'扇動する集団 // 野生の血の群れ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールする攻撃クリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、野生の血の群れを変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'野生の血の群れ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e016e513-659d-47ab-8846-71876004eabf\', \'multiverseId\': 274410}, \'multiverseid\': 274410}, {\'name\': \'선동하는 패거리 // 야생혈 늑대떼\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n당신이 조종하는 공격생물들은 +3/+0을 받는다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 야생혈 늑대떼를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'야생혈 늑대떼\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e9db93-aefd-4c79-b2a3-14d00ceb9a3a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gangue de Instigadores // Alcateia do Sangue Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nAs criaturas atacantes que você controla recebem +3/+0.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Alcateia do Sangue Selvagem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Alcateia do Sangue Selvagem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f79f0f8-f7d1-4410-b802-9793a99e3ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 272706}, \'multiverseid\': 272706}, {\'name\': \'Банда Подстрекателей // Стая Дикой Крови\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nАтакующие существа под вашим контролем получают +3/+0.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Стаю Дикой Крови.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Стая Дикой Крови\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9214c4ea-2465-4ef6-ad2a-317687740abd\', \'multiverseId\': 273274}, \'multiverseid\': 273274}, {\'name\': \'煽动党徒 // 野血狼群\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n由你操控且进行攻击的生物得+3/+0。\\n在每个维持开始时，如果某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化野血狼群。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'野血狼群\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f587b33-deba-44ba-ae27-6764507a92e8\', \'multiverseId\': 272138}, \'multiverseid\': 272138}, {\'name\': \'煽動黨徒 // 野血狼群\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n由你操控且進行攻擊的生物得+3/+0。\\n在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化野血狼群。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'野血狼群\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da53c9f-289b-49a7-aaf2-c14b4283ebc8\', \'multiverseId\': 272422}, \'multiverseid\': 272422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflösung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Wird der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Scheußlichkeit gehörte nie in unsere Welt. Ich lasse sie nur frei." —Dierk, Geistermagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef8dbfb-1580-49e2-959c-55e6964c8206\', \'multiverseId\': 273637}, \'multiverseid\': 273637}, {\'name\': \'Disipar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Si ese hechizo se contrarresta de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta abominación nunca perteneció a nuestro mundo. Simplemente estoy liberándola." —Dierk, mago de geists\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b077d80-aa68-44c1-b482-d58c9889f606\', \'multiverseId\': 273921}, \'multiverseid\': 273921}, {\'name\': \'Dissipation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Cette abomination n\'a jamais eu sa place sur notre monde. Je ne fais que la libérer. » —Dierk, geistmage", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8405e7-330b-4055-aa8d-52ce9a98a85b\', \'multiverseId\': 273069}, \'multiverseid\': 273069}, {\'name\': \'Dissipare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo abominio non è mai stato del nostro mondo. Lo sto semplicemente liberando." —Dierk, mago dei geist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b66991e-71d5-432a-87e0-27f737a7278f\', \'multiverseId\': 274205}, \'multiverseid\': 274205}, {\'name\': \'雲散霧消\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。 その呪文がこれにより打ち消された場合、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この忌まわしきものは我々の世界のものではない。 単に自由の身にしてやっただけだ。」 ――霊魔道士、ディールク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0827e311-67b3-4b02-bf20-938edc7b7f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 274489}, \'multiverseid\': 274489}, {\'name\': \'일소\', \'text\': \'주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 이렇게 무효화된 주문은 소유자의 무덤에 들어가는 대신에 추방된다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 흉물은 우리 세상의 것이 아니야. 즉, 난 이것을 해방시키고 있는 셈이지."—심령술사 디어크\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89409075-83a2-440e-8105-8f7821b3bda2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dissipar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta abominação não pertence ao nosso mundo. Eu estou apenas liberando-a." — Dierk, geisteomago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a48a852-9d08-49f2-902f-86ae3f6e76c9\', \'multiverseId\': 272785}, \'multiverseid\': 272785}, {\'name\': \'Развеивание\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Если то заклинание отменяется таким способом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Этой мерзости никогда не было места в нашем мире. Я просто выпускаю ее на свободу». — Дьерк, маг привидений\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090a99f2-b1bf-48b3-a716-6838cd49e25b\', \'multiverseId\': 273353}, \'multiverseid\': 273353}, {\'name\': \'云消雾散\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。 如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非将它置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这憎恨兽从不属于我们的世界。 我只是让它自由。」 ～游魂法师第尔克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4caf0b2-f665-489d-a436-0025c0e4553d\', \'multiverseId\': 272217}, \'multiverseid\': 272217}, {\'name\': \'雲消霧散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。 如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非將它置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這憎恨獸從不屬於我們的世界。 我只是讓它自由。」 ～遊魂法師第爾克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d69d1eb-90a3-4399-9f13-72d162209351\', \'multiverseId\': 272501}, \'multiverseid\': 272501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufpasser von Hennweier // Unheil von Hennweier\', \'text\': \'Das Unheil von Hennweier greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments das Unheil von Hennweier, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Technisch gesehen verlässt er seinen Posten nie. Er schaut nach dem Wolf, wo auch immer dieser ist.\', \'faceName\': \'Unheil von Hennweier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6cd86c-a34a-402b-8ab1-31a2920e2304\', \'multiverseId\': 273654}, \'multiverseid\': 273654}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de Hanweir // Ruina de Hanweir\', \'text\': \'La Ruina de Hanweir ataca cada turno si puede.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma a la Ruina de Hanweir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': \'Técnicamente, nunca dejó su puesto. Busca al lobo donde sea que haya ido.\', \'faceName\': \'Ruina de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9b78ff-8ed5-4649-b8b3-97f9f5934857\', \'multiverseId\': 273938}, \'multiverseid\': 273938}, {\'name\': \'Guetteur de Hanweir // Fléau de Hanweir\', \'text\': \'Le Fléau de Hanweir attaque à chaque tour si possible.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez le Fléau de Hanweir.\', \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "Techniquement, il n\'a jamais quitté son poste. Il suit le loup.", \'faceName\': \'Fléau de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d767ba4-c7df-4ebe-8aec-3a7a7b783966\', \'multiverseId\': 273086}, \'multiverseid\': 273086}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella di Hanweir // Flagello di Hanweir\', \'text\': "Il Flagello di Hanweir attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma il Flagello di Hanweir.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': \'Tecnicamente non ha mai lasciato la sua postazione. Si occupa del lupo ovunque vada.\', \'faceName\': \'Flagello di Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'049d0cbd-0e41-4208-a8fd-5e5ef138bf0a\', \'multiverseId\': 274222}, \'multiverseid\': 274222}, {\'name\': \'ハンウィアーの砦守り // ハンウィアーの災い\', \'text\': \'ハンウィアーの災いは、可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、ハンウィアーの災いを変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': \'理論上は、彼は持ち場を離れていない。狼の行くところすべてに目を向けていただけだ。\', \'faceName\': \'ハンウィアーの災い\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4966c545-0cbd-455e-910b-deb3df35e4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 274506}, \'multiverseid\': 274506}, {\'name\': \'한웨이르의 파수꾼 // 한웨이르의 공포\', \'text\': \'한웨이르의 공포는 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 한웨이르의 공포를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'엄밀히 따지면 그는 근무지를 이탈한 게 아니다. 그는 항상 늑대와 같이 있으니까.\', \'faceName\': \'한웨이르의 공포\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e1d4463-a480-456e-bea2-92d814109f76\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante de Hanweir // Desgraça de Hanweir\', \'text\': \'Desgraça de Hanweir ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Desgraça de Hanweir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Tecnicamente, ele jamais abandonou seu posto. Ele cuida do lobo onde quer que ele vá.\', \'faceName\': \'Desgraça de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dbe0cf0-4999-4e27-b14f-6cb0b0f9d8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 272802}, \'multiverseid\': 272802}, {\'name\': \'Ханвирский Сторожевой // Ханвирское Проклятие\', \'text\': \'Ханвирское Проклятие атакует в каждом ходу, если может.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Ханвирское Проклятие.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Строго говоря, он не оставлял своего поста. Он присматривает за волком, куда бы тот ни пошел.\', \'faceName\': \'Ханвирское Проклятие\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3504bcf-3b6e-4c8b-9a5d-909e06a8f2a5\', \'multiverseId\': 273370}, \'multiverseid\': 273370}, {\'name\': \'翰威看守 // 翰威孽种\', \'text\': \'翰威孽种每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化翰威孽种。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'技术上来说，他从未离开岗位。 狼去了哪里，他就跟到哪里。\', \'faceName\': \'翰威孽种\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea92b38-29d3-4ef0-bc97-49fc4d61b768\', \'multiverseId\': 272234}, \'multiverseid\': 272234}, {\'name\': \'翰威看守 // 翰威孽種\', \'text\': \'翰威孽種每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化翰威孽種。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'技術上來說，他從未離開崗位。 狼去了哪裡，他就跟到哪裡。\', \'faceName\': \'翰威孽種\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9df103-7274-408a-887b-93ec46058a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 272518}, \'multiverseid\': 272518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufpasser von Hennweier // Unheil von Hennweier\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Aufpasser von Hennweier, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Er sucht nach Wölfen, doch er weiß, dass er einen nicht vorhersehen kann.\', \'faceName\': \'Aufpasser von Hennweier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6cd86c-a34a-402b-8ab1-31a2920e2304\', \'multiverseId\': 273654}, \'multiverseid\': 273654}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de Hanweir // Ruina de Hanweir\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Guardia de Hanweir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Busca lobos, sabiendo que hay uno contra el que nunca está preparado.\', \'faceName\': \'Guardia de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9b78ff-8ed5-4649-b8b3-97f9f5934857\', \'multiverseId\': 273938}, \'multiverseid\': 273938}, {\'name\': \'Guetteur de Hanweir // Fléau de Hanweir\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Guetteur de Hanweir.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "Il cherche les loups, sachant qu\'il y en a un qu\'il ne trouvera jamais.", \'faceName\': \'Guetteur de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d767ba4-c7df-4ebe-8aec-3a7a7b783966\', \'multiverseId\': 273086}, \'multiverseid\': 273086}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella di Hanweir // Flagello di Hanweir\', \'text\': "Difensore\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma la Sentinella di Hanweir.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': "Scruta in cerca di lupi, pur sapendo che ce n\'è uno che non potrà mai prevedere.", \'faceName\': \'Sentinella di Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'049d0cbd-0e41-4208-a8fd-5e5ef138bf0a\', \'multiverseId\': 274222}, \'multiverseid\': 274222}, {\'name\': \'ハンウィアーの砦守り // ハンウィアーの災い\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、ハンウィアーの砦守りを変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'予測できないのが一匹いるのを知りつつ、彼は狼が来るのを見張っている。\', \'faceName\': \'ハンウィアーの砦守り\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4966c545-0cbd-455e-910b-deb3df35e4bb\', \'multiverseId\': 274506}, \'multiverseid\': 274506}, {\'name\': \'한웨이르의 파수꾼 // 한웨이르의 공포\', \'text\': \'수비태세각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 한웨이르의 파수꾼을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'그는 늑대가 나타나는지를 감시하지만, 예측할 수 없는 늑대가 한 마리 있다.\', \'faceName\': \'한웨이르의 파수꾼\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e1d4463-a480-456e-bea2-92d814109f76\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante de Hanweir // Desgraça de Hanweir\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Vigilante de Hanweir.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Ele vasculha a floresta em busca de lobos, embora saiba que há um cujo ataque jamais poderá prever.\', \'faceName\': \'Vigilante de Hanweir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dbe0cf0-4999-4e27-b14f-6cb0b0f9d8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 272802}, \'multiverseid\': 272802}, {\'name\': \'Ханвирский Сторожевой // Ханвирское Проклятие\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Ханвирского Сторожевого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Он высматривает волков, зная, что одного из них ему никогда не опередить.\', \'faceName\': \'Ханвирский Сторожевой\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3504bcf-3b6e-4c8b-9a5d-909e06a8f2a5\', \'multiverseId\': 273370}, \'multiverseid\': 273370}, {\'name\': \'翰威看守 // 翰威孽种\', \'text\': \'守军\\n在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化翰威看守。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他审视着狼群，但心里明白有一个是自己永远见不到的。\', \'faceName\': \'翰威看守\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea92b38-29d3-4ef0-bc97-49fc4d61b768\', \'multiverseId\': 272234}, \'multiverseid\': 272234}, {\'name\': \'翰威看守 // 翰威孽種\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化翰威看守。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他審視著狼群，但心裡明白有一個是自己永遠見不到的。\', \'faceName\': \'翰威看守\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9df103-7274-408a-887b-93ec46058a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 272518}, \'multiverseid\': 272518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufzeichnungen der Toten\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, wirf eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Lege eine Studiumsmarke auf die Aufzeichnungen der Toten.\\n{T}, entferne drei Studiumsmarken von den Aufzeichnungen der Toten und opfere sie: Bringe alle Kreaturenkarten aus allen Friedhöfen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen schwarze Zombies.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2e47770-2589-4b37-9ffb-39b33b1709e3\', \'multiverseId\': 273587}, \'multiverseid\': 273587}, {\'name\': \'Grimorio de los muertos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, descartar una carta: Pon un contador de estudio sobre el Grimorio de los muertos.\\n{T}, remover tres contadores de estudio del Grimorio de los muertos y sacrificarlo: Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control todas las cartas de criatura de todos los cementerios. Son Zombies negros además de sus otros colores y tipos.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e642bd25-6cbd-4dd5-b9a9-91da0d77e994\', \'multiverseId\': 273871}, \'multiverseid\': 273871}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire des morts\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Mettez un marqueur « étude » sur le Grimoire des morts.\\n{T}, retirez trois marqueurs « étude » du Grimoire des morts et sacrifiez-le : Mettez toutes les cartes de créature de tous les cimetières sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Ce sont des zombies noirs en plus de leurs autres couleurs et de leurs autres types.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273019&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad0f8d5-8f7d-4b59-ba0c-c737f3926e35\', \'multiverseId\': 273019}, \'multiverseid\': 273019}, {\'name\': \'Grimorio dei Morti\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Metti un segnalino studio sul Grimorio dei Morti.\\n{T}, Rimuovi tre segnalini studio dal Grimorio dei Morti e sacrificalo: Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo tutte le carte creatura in tutti i cimiteri. Sono Zombie neri in aggiunta ai propri altri tipi e colori.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd216402-6109-4fb2-885b-7fa3f4a2279b\', \'multiverseId\': 274155}, \'multiverseid\': 274155}, {\'name\': \'死者の呪文書\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, カードを１枚捨てる：死者の呪文書の上に学習カウンターを１個置く。\\n{T}, 死者の呪文書を、その上から学習カウンターを３個取り除いて生け贄に捧げる：墓地にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードを、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。 それらは他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビである。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6318754-5bf8-4ea2-beed-9888f4bf0223\', \'multiverseId\': 274439}, \'multiverseid\': 274439}, {\'name\': \'망자의 마도서\', \'text\': \', , 카드 한 장을 버린다: 망자의 마도서에 학습 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다., 망자의 마도서에서 학습 카운터 세 개를 제거하고 망자의 마도서를 희생한다: 모든 무덤에 있는 모든 생물 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다. 이 생물들은 자신의 다른 색에 더불어 흑색이며, 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 좀비다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898dc7e7-6e08-44b9-b534-0c9202200471\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Grimório dos Mortos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Descarte um card: Coloque um marcador de estudo sobre Grimório dos Mortos.\\n{T}, Remova três marcadores de estudo de Grimório dos Mortos e sacrifique-o: Coloque no campo de batalha sob seu controle todos os cards de criatura de todos os cemitérios. Eles se tornam do tipo Zumbi e da cor preta além de seus outros tipos e cores.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3739e5d8-12da-420d-bffa-fcb4743c9280\', \'multiverseId\': 272735}, \'multiverseid\': 272735}, {\'name\': \'Рукопись Мертвецов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, сбросьте карту: положите один жетон изучения на Рукопись Мертвецов.\\n{T}, удалите три жетона изучения с Рукописи Мертвецов и пожертвуйте ее: положите на поле битвы под вашим контролем все карты существ из всех кладбищ. Они являются черными Зомби в дополнение к своим другим цветам и типам.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c06aa4d-cbe3-4733-9736-a82e416427a7\', \'multiverseId\': 273303}, \'multiverseid\': 273303}, {\'name\': \'亡者秘录\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，弃一张牌：在亡者秘录上放置一个读书指示物。\\n{T}，从亡者秘录上移去三个读书指示物并牺牲它：将所有坟墓场中的所有生物牌在你的操控下放进战场。 它们额外具有黑色此颜色与「灵俑」此类别。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9eff72-a999-44fa-b43b-a28ef8f4d54c\', \'multiverseId\': 272167}, \'multiverseid\': 272167}, {\'name\': \'亡者秘錄\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，棄一張牌：在亡者秘錄上放置一個讀書指示物。\\n{T}，從亡者秘錄上移去三個讀書指示物並犧牲它：將所有墳墓場中的所有生物牌在你的操控下放進戰場。 它們額外具有黑色此顏色與「殭屍」此類別。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c768afea-3e54-41cb-9616-95820ae8f706\', \'multiverseId\': 272451}, \'multiverseid\': 272451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auswellendes Erdbeben\', \'text\': \'Das Auswellende Erdbeben fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {4}{R}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Dämonen einen Pfad zu deiner Haustür freilegen, ist es Zeit zum Umziehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e618b75e-aedf-495c-b125-d906f0792b68\', \'multiverseId\': 273699}, \'multiverseid\': 273699}, {\'name\': \'Temblor replicado\', \'text\': \'El Temblor replicado hace 2 puntos de daño a cada criatura que no tenga la habilidad de volar.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los demonios abren una camino a tu puerta, es hora de mudarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d37c3ae-b7e5-4b53-aaa9-2c2270e1bb01\', \'multiverseId\': 273983}, \'multiverseid\': 273983}, {\'name\': \'Secousse agressive\', \'text\': \'La Secousse agressive inflige 2 blessures à chaque créature sans le vol.\\nFlashback {4}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quand les démons ouvrent un chemin jusqu\'à votre porte, il est temps de partir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed9ff84-bf2d-442e-a487-9c60408d865f\', \'multiverseId\': 273131}, \'multiverseid\': 273131}, {\'name\': \'Rotolamento Tellurico\', \'text\': \'Il Rotolamento Tellurico infligge 2 danni a ogni creatura senza volare.\\nFlashback {4}{R}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Quando i demoni aprono un varco fin davanti alla tua porta, è il momento di andarsene.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea8cfcb-afc5-44a4-ae31-da49bc97055d\', \'multiverseId\': 274267}, \'multiverseid\': 274267}, {\'name\': \'轟く激震\', \'text\': \'轟く激震は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック {4}{R}{R} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'悪魔がお前の玄関までの道を開いたら、引っ越すべき時だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e71a6c02-027a-40a5-8117-b177ef8fe6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 274551}, \'multiverseid\': 274551}, {\'name\': \'구르는 지진\', \'text\': \'구르는 지진은 비행 능력이 없는 각 생물에게 피해 2점씩을 입힌다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'악마들이 당신의 집앞에 통로를 개방하면 집을 옮길 때가 된 것이다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9cfdcb3-d240-448d-8264-ab249df97b52\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Terremoto Reverberante\', \'text\': \'Terremoto Reverberante causa 2 pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar.\\nRecapitular {4}{R}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os demônios abrem caminho até sua porta da frente, é hora de se mudar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460b20cb-2204-4cf7-8246-0c9975d16f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 272847}, \'multiverseid\': 272847}, {\'name\': \'Волны Землетрясения\', \'text\': \'Волны Землетрясения наносят 2 повреждения каждому существу без Полета.\\nВоспоминание {4}{R}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда демоны протаптывают дорожку к вашей входной двери, время съезжать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79640848-707b-48a9-afbb-2259e4bc2d98\', \'multiverseId\': 273415}, \'multiverseid\': 273415}, {\'name\': \'地动隆响\', \'text\': \'地动隆响对每个不具飞行异能的生物各造成2点伤害。\\n返照{4}{R}{R} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当恶魔开路通往你家大门，就该搬家了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b826a78-e30f-4f49-b2a5-352d82e98607\', \'multiverseId\': 272279}, \'multiverseid\': 272279}, {\'name\': \'地動隆響\', \'text\': \'地動隆響對每個不具飛行異能的生物各造成2點傷害。\\n返照{4}{R}{R} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'當惡魔開路通往你家大門，就該搬家了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0e027e-95e1-4c17-8c75-2c81d9897a6a\', \'multiverseId\': 272563}, \'multiverseid\': 272563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyns Maske\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+2 und ist fluchsicher. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Sie versteckt das Gesicht und schützt die Seele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c385f50d-6512-4ed5-84ef-55882f575ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 273472}, \'multiverseid\': 273472}, {\'name\': \'Máscara de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+2 y tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Esconde el rostro y protege el alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b6e709-0e9c-4527-a909-40b55e0497e9\', \'multiverseId\': 273756}, \'multiverseid\': 273756}, {\'name\': "Masque d\'Avacyn", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+2 et a la défense talismanique. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Il dissimule le visage et protège l\'âme.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6003c44-8047-452a-a90b-b06df0705929\', \'multiverseId\': 272904}, \'multiverseid\': 272904}, {\'name\': \'Maschera di Avacyn\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+2 e ha anti-malocchio. (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Cela il volto e protegge l\'anima.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26d5b4e-a1ac-4cfd-b24e-c8b7e5eb55f7\', \'multiverseId\': 274040}, \'multiverseid\': 274040}, {\'name\': \'アヴァシンの仮面\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋２の修整を受けるとともに呪禁を持つ。 （それはあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備 {3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'それは顔を隠し、魂を守る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37bbf93-2b60-4f31-bec8-d9edeaf78584\', \'multiverseId\': 274324}, \'multiverseid\': 274324}, {\'name\': \'아바신의 가면\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +1/+2를 받고 방호 능력을 가진다. (방호를 가진 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)장착\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 얼굴을 가리고 영혼을 보호한다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a93b57-19bd-4c99-8b48-ba4ce54347a2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Máscara de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+2 e tem resistência à magia. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ela esconde a face e protege a alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda389e5-d24d-4345-97bb-d1a70aeb1a22\', \'multiverseId\': 272620}, \'multiverseid\': 272620}, {\'name\': \'Маска Авацины\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+2 и имеет Порчеустойчивость. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Она скрывает лицо и защищает душу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42b9401f-af0e-4798-899e-d2fc409f5b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 273188}, \'multiverseid\': 273188}, {\'name\': \'艾维欣的面具\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+2且具有辟邪异能。 （它不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'它掩藏面容，保护灵魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a41dd2b-ba60-4739-a6fb-2a89eb960fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 272052}, \'multiverseid\': 272052}, {\'name\': \'艾維欣的面具\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+2且具有辟邪異能。 （它不能成為由對手所操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\\n佩帶{3}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'它掩藏面容，保護靈魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185d0ca8-440a-4232-9410-403296a66cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 272336}, \'multiverseid\': 272336}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyns Pilger\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Avacyn schützt uns überall. Die geweihte Kirche, die gesegnete Lichtung — alles überblickt sie mir ihren wachsamen, heiligen Augen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f1606a-7ed9-49e9-9ea0-ce7a455d5123\', \'multiverseId\': 273644}, \'multiverseid\': 273644}, {\'name\': \'Peregrino de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La protección de Avacyn está en todos lados. Desde la iglesia sagrada hasta el claro bendito, todo lo que vemos está bajo su mirada protectora."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0534c0-26d8-4d46-b6f5-8eae073ab234\', \'multiverseId\': 273928}, \'multiverseid\': 273928}, {\'name\': "Pèlerin d\'Avacyn", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« La protection d\'Avacyn est partout. De la sainte église au bosquet sacré, tout ce que nous voyons porte sa bénédiction. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe9e763-4d46-44dc-84e3-452592b16527\', \'multiverseId\': 273076}, \'multiverseid\': 273076}, {\'name\': \'Pellegrino di Avacyn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La protezione di Avacyn è ovunque. Dalla santa chiesa alla radura sacra, tutto ciò che vediamo è sotto il suo sguardo benedetto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc9cdb17-4bd5-45b9-8d45-ce5b5e2a265c\', \'multiverseId\': 274212}, \'multiverseid\': 274212}, {\'name\': \'アヴァシンの巡礼者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「アヴァシンの守護はどこにでもあります。 神聖な教会から聖なる地まで、見る物全ては彼女の祝福の監視下にあるのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4f14e8-4f4f-46b5-aaf1-6b9669e8126f\', \'multiverseId\': 274496}, \'multiverseid\': 274496}, {\'name\': \'아바신의 순례자\', \'text\': \'{T}: {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 수도승\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 어디를 가던 아바신께서는 우리를 지켜보신다. 교회에서부터 성스러운 숲 속의 공터까지, 그녀는 우리가 보는 모든 걸 지켜보고 계시느니라."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b97b3e57-29af-45e4-a76b-4f7d32270797\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Peregrino de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"A proteção de Avacyn está em todo lugar. Desde a igreja sagrada à clareira sacra, tudo o que vemos está sob sua proteção abençoada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5e7903-36e8-4fb9-8cd3-05307974cbf1\', \'multiverseId\': 272792}, \'multiverseid\': 272792}, {\'name\': \'Пилигрим Авацины\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Монах\', \'flavor\': \'«Заступничество Авацины повсюду. От святой церкви до священных просек, все, что мы видим, находится под ее благословенным блюдением».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2aa200e-e0eb-41fa-a197-0ef39ed4f4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 273360}, \'multiverseid\': 273360}, {\'name\': \'艾维欣朝圣客\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「艾维欣的守护遍布各处。 从神圣教会到圣洁林地，我们双眼所见之物尽受她慈爱眼神的关照。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185f7847-7f58-4c51-b761-dbd91136c92a\', \'multiverseId\': 272224}, \'multiverseid\': 272224}, {\'name\': \'艾維欣朝聖客\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「艾維欣的守護遍佈各處。 從神聖教會到聖潔林地，我們雙眼所見之物盡受她慈愛眼神的關照。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecb1212-a815-4e77-a85a-1e4054705a62\', \'multiverseId\': 272508}, \'multiverseid\': 272508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyns Priester\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Tappe eine nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Moorbewohner sprechen voll Hochachtung vom Talent der Priester, immer rechtzeitig aufzutauchen, um die üblen Wesen zu verjagen, die durch ihr entzückendes Sprengel schleichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273449&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d93dcef0-8764-4aa9-a618-d7fb1fb140d5\', \'multiverseId\': 273449}, \'multiverseid\': 273449}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotisa avacyna\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los moradores de los páramos alaban el talento de los sacerdotes para llegar justo a tiempo para ahuyentar a las cosas malvadas que acechan a la hambrienta parroquia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9e49580-4ff8-470e-b06e-a3d618f22e22\', \'multiverseId\': 273733}, \'multiverseid\': 273733}, {\'name\': \'Prêtresse avacynienne\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Engagez une créature non-Humain ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Les habitants des landes s\'émerveillent du talent inné des prêtres arrivant toujours juste à temps pour chasser les horreurs qui assaillent la paroisse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ce8017-dbd6-49a5-bbf9-f3378e36fab2\', \'multiverseId\': 272881}, \'multiverseid\': 272881}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotessa di Avacyn\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura non Umano bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': "Gli abitanti della brughiera parlano con soggezione del talento dei sacerdoti nell\'arrivare in tempo per scacciare gli esseri maligni che vagano nella parrocchia devastata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53c2ec2e-555b-48c3-9da0-4a71be62a37b\', \'multiverseId\': 274017}, \'multiverseid\': 274017}, {\'name\': \'アヴァシン教の僧侶\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'ムーアランド人は、教区が奇怪なものに襲われた時にここぞと駆けつける僧侶の才能を恐れながら口にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c539f7ef-dd21-498b-af1b-5fbb19489463\', \'multiverseId\': 274301}, \'multiverseid\': 274301}, {\'name\': \'아바신의 사제\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: 인간이 아닌 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'이탄지 사람들은 유린당한 교구 근처를 돌아다니는 마물들이 습격할 때마다 나타나는 사제들의 능력을 칭송한다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7af61a0-f0c0-4385-8117-10165159d543\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Avacyniano\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo que não seja do tipo Humano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Os habitantes dos pântanos falam com grande respeito sobre o talento dos sacerdotes de chegar em tempo para afugentar os seres abomináveis que rondam a paróquia violada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77765dae-404a-4209-87dd-62ff3fdc18d3\', \'multiverseId\': 272597}, \'multiverseid\': 272597}, {\'name\': \'Жрица-Авацинианка\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: поверните целевое существо, не являющееся Человеком.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Обитатели вересковых пустошей с благоговейным трепетом говорят о даре жрецов появляться в самый нужный момент, чтобы отогнать злых тварей, рыщущих по разграбленному приходу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0b6e8b-1028-4bdd-8a1d-1a352f9ced6a\', \'multiverseId\': 273165}, \'multiverseid\': 273165}, {\'name\': \'艾维欣僧侣\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：横置目标非人类生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'僧侣总能即时现身、赶走横行教区的邪物，因此备受荒野居民敬仰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'897670f3-01b1-45c3-b438-3a96a84a42d0\', \'multiverseId\': 272029}, \'multiverseid\': 272029}, {\'name\': \'艾維欣僧侶\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：橫置目標非人類生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'僧侶總能即時現身、趕走橫行教區的邪物，因此備受荒野居民敬仰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddfb46a-2408-4875-8e86-803cbfb1678a\', \'multiverseId\': 272313}, \'multiverseid\': 272313}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baum der Erlösung\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Tausche deine Lebenspunktezahl mit der Widerstandskraft des Baums der Erlösung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'Der Henkersbaum an der Kathedrale von Thraben hat die Macht, mehr als nur die Seelen der Gehängten aufzunehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273694&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3df56c9-a074-4d3e-9382-6ef9ff4d2dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 273694}, \'multiverseid\': 273694}, {\'name\': \'Árbol de la redención\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{T}: Intercambia tu total de vidas con la resistencia del Árbol de la redención.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'El árbol del verdugo en la Catedral de Thraben tiene el poder de absolver algo más que las almas de los condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d8cc34-9c44-4c7a-bd0c-f5fa4a163aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 273978}, \'multiverseid\': 273978}, {\'name\': \'Arbre de la rédemption\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{T} : Échangez votre total de points de vie contre l\'endurance de l\'Arbre de la rédemption.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante\', \'flavor\': "L\'arbre du bourreau dans la Cathédrale de Thraben a le pouvoir d\'absoudre bien plus que l\'âme des pendus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daa312b6-b1a4-451c-8356-eb8640664feb\', \'multiverseId\': 273126}, \'multiverseid\': 273126}, {\'name\': \'Albero della Redenzione\', \'text\': "Difensore\\n{T}: Scambia i tuoi punti vita con la costituzione dell\'Albero della Redenzione.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pianta\', \'flavor\': "L\'albero del boia nella Cattedrale di Thraben ha il potere di assolvere più delle anime degli impiccati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010b85a7-797e-4400-b62d-0a1a0d883eee\', \'multiverseId\': 274262}, \'multiverseid\': 274262}, {\'name\': \'解放の樹\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{T}：あなたのライフの総量と解放の樹のタフネスを交換する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物\', \'flavor\': \'スレイベン大聖堂の処刑人の樹には、そこに吊られた魂よりも多くの赦しの力がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e255bb96-a25c-4edb-9973-5a3dacab50cf\', \'multiverseId\': 274546}, \'multiverseid\': 274546}, {\'name\': \'구원의 나무\', \'text\': \'수비태세: 당신의 생명 총점을 구원의 나무의 방어력과 교환한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 식물\', \'flavor\': \'트레이벤 성당에 있는 사형 집행인의 나무는 교수형을 당한 자들의 영혼을 구원하고도 남을 만큼의 힘을 갖고 있다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b9d106-1126-46c7-80c4-18641e5a4646\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Árvore da Redenção\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{T}: Permute seu total de pontos de vida com a resistência de Árvore da Redenção.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'A árvore do carrasco na Catedral de Thraben tem o poder de absolver mais do que as almas dos enforcados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f15183b5-0e24-4e67-a875-3728f59c1345\', \'multiverseId\': 272842}, \'multiverseid\': 272842}, {\'name\': \'Древо Искупления\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\n{T}: обменяйте количество ваших жизней на выносливость Древа Искупления.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Растение\', \'flavor\': \'Древо палача в Трейбенском Соборе обладает силой искупить не только души повешенных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ae1895-a25d-48f6-8408-6e887218add4\', \'multiverseId\': 273410}, \'multiverseid\': 273410}, {\'name\': \'救赎之树\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{T}：将你的总生命与救赎之树的防御力交换。\', \'type\': \'生物～植物\', \'flavor\': \'瑟班大教堂处刑树拥有的力量，不只是能够宽恕受吊刑者的灵魂而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66677b57-4804-42fa-877d-a16862f2f7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 272274}, \'multiverseid\': 272274}, {\'name\': \'救贖之樹\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n{T}：將你的總生命與救贖之樹的防禦力交換。\', \'type\': \'生物～植物\', \'flavor\': \'瑟班大教堂處刑樹擁有的力量，不只是能夠寬恕受吊刑者的靈魂而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49afdcd1-af0e-4ec9-ba07-71653c4f8cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 272558}, \'multiverseid\': 272558}]', "[{'name': 'Besessen von Gespenstern', 'text': 'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nVerhindere allen Kampfschaden, der der verzauberten Kreatur zugefügt und von ihr zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273441&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec54e015-86f8-4674-bbd6-95ab4df5108a', 'multiverseId': 273441}, 'multiverseid': 273441}, {'name': 'Posesión fantasmal', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nPrevén todo el daño de combate que se le fuera a hacer y que fuera a hacer la criatura encantada.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273725&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2a7deaa-a1a1-4c32-a07c-317751bb8e65', 'multiverseId': 273725}, 'multiverseid': 273725}, {'name': 'Possession fantomale', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a le vol.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées à et par la créature enchantée.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272873&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '371af5ab-ec6a-4212-be45-b2e49b2c7da6', 'multiverseId': 272873}, 'multiverseid': 272873}, {'name': 'Possessione Spettrale', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha volare.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alla e dalla creatura incantata.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274009&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b3f2469-3692-4ce7-a0f3-827a3463dd58', 'multiverseId': 274009}, 'multiverseid': 274009}, {'name': '幽霊の憑依', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが与える戦闘ダメージと与えられる戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274293&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2bdcc1d-eaa7-48f2-a691-c9203bc94474', 'multiverseId': 274293}, 'multiverseid': 274293}, {'name': '유령 빙의', 'text': '생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 비행 능력을 가진다.부여된 생물이 입히려고 하거나 입으려고 하는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ca2d43d-c68d-460c-941a-17db4f097558'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Possessão Espectral', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada tem voar.\\nPrevina todo o dano de combate que seria sofrido e causado pela criatura encantada.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272589&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ae14c6-a64e-45b2-adc3-9a3ac3750800', 'multiverseId': 272589}, 'multiverseid': 272589}, {'name': 'Одержимость Призраком', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо имеет Полет.\\nПредотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены зачарованному существу и зачарованным существом.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273157&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6788fb85-fc98-4793-a809-4c488b59c04e', 'multiverseId': 273157}, 'multiverseid': 273157}, {'name': '魂魅上身', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有飞行异能。\\n防止所结附的生物将受到或造成的所有战斗伤害。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272021&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f2c6260-8b8f-4450-9d64-70c6c866ac0b', 'multiverseId': 272021}, 'multiverseid': 272021}, {'name': '魂魅上身', 'text': '結附於生物\\n所結附的生物具有飛行異能。\\n防止所結附的生物將受到或造成的所有戰鬥傷害。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272305&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb39049c-8a12-40d0-ab6e-fd2acf158d61', 'multiverseId': 272305}, 'multiverseid': 272305}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bestrafung des Ketzers\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Bestimme eine Kreatur oder einen Spieler deiner Wahl, dann lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof. Die Bestrafung des Ketzers fügt dieser Kreatur bzw. diesem Spieler so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter diesen Karten betragen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b8f299-c279-4b09-b34d-675986864c08\', \'multiverseId\': 273705}, \'multiverseid\': 273705}, {\'name\': \'Castigo del hereje\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Elige una criatura o jugador objetivo, luego pon las primeras tres cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. El Castigo del hereje hace daño a esa criatura o jugador igual al mayor coste de maná convertido entre esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda3a911-da95-41a2-aa21-3290903260fa\', \'multiverseId\': 273989}, \'multiverseid\': 273989}, {\'name\': "Punition de l\'hérétique", \'text\': "{3}{R} : Choisissez une cible, créature ou joueur, puis mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière. La Punition de l\'hérétique inflige à cette créature ou à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi ces cartes.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf81b5a4-60e1-433d-90fe-de7c25918c35\', \'multiverseId\': 273137}, \'multiverseid\': 273137}, {\'name\': "Punizione dell\'Eretico", \'text\': "{3}{R}: Scegli una creatura o un giocatore bersaglio, poi metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. La Punizione dell\'Eretico infligge danno a quella creatura o a quel giocatore pari al costo di mana convertito più alto tra quelle carte.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac4668e-7549-42d4-adaf-faef689f8919\', \'multiverseId\': 274273}, \'multiverseid\': 274273}, {\'name\': \'異教徒の罰\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とし、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。 異教徒の罰はそのクリーチャーやプレイヤーに、それらのカードの中で最も大きい点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6123dfe4-12ec-4e3a-b925-6dc3ed1cb771\', \'multiverseId\': 274557}, \'multiverseid\': 274557}, {\'name\': \'이단자의 처벌\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다. 이단자의 처벌은 그 목표에게 이렇게 무덤에 넣어진 카드들 중 가장 높은 전환마나비용을 가진 카드의 전환마나비용만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb29266-5df4-42fe-8c64-f861594864d5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Punição do Herege\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Escolha uma criatura ou jogador alvo e depois coloque os três cards do topo do seu grimório em seu próprio cemitério. Punição do Herege causa àquela criatura ou jogador uma quantidade de dano igual ao custo de mana convertido mais alto entre aqueles cards.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92e7aec4-4f82-4b90-8e50-67277a0722b8\', \'multiverseId\': 272853}, \'multiverseid\': 272853}, {\'name\': \'Наказание Еретика\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: выберите целевое существо или игрока, затем положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище. Наказание Еретика наносит тому существу или игроку повреждения, равные наибольшему значению конвертированной мана-стоимости среди тех карт.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ffe8f8-a7ec-45dd-8c0b-86af3f501047\', \'multiverseId\': 273421}, \'multiverseid\': 273421}, {\'name\': \'异教徒的惩罚\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：选择目标生物或牌手，然后将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。 异教徒的惩罚对该生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于这些牌之间最高的总法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b80081-aa7c-44f2-9467-87d58e35f1a3\', \'multiverseId\': 272285}, \'multiverseid\': 272285}, {\'name\': \'異教徒的懲罰\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：選擇目標生物或玩家，然後將你牌庫頂的三張牌置入你的墳墓場。 異教徒的懲罰對該生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於這些牌之間最高的總魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fdd42bb-2229-4aba-9c38-c651b5197bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 272569}, \'multiverseid\': 272569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bindungen des Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, solange sie ein Mensch ist. Anderenfalls kann sie nicht angreifen oder blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Was nicht zerstört werden kann, wird gebunden." —Avacyns Eid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c74fb9-fd3a-4887-8e8c-1bd3f6f3613e\', \'multiverseId\': 273478}, \'multiverseid\': 273478}, {\'name\': \'Vínculos de fe\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 mientras sea Humano. De lo contrario, no puede atacar o bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que no puede ser destruido, será atado." —Juramento de Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68abe03d-5a29-440f-a440-e1529b8d81ac\', \'multiverseId\': 273762}, \'multiverseid\': 273762}, {\'name\': \'Liens de foi\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 tant qu\'elle est un humain. Sinon, elle ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui ne peut être détruit sera emprisonné. » —Serment d\'Avacyn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0487e077-f0d2-4a16-ae41-41afbef23e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 272910}, \'multiverseid\': 272910}, {\'name\': \'Schiavitù della Fede\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 fintanto che è un Umano. Altrimenti, non può attaccare o bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che non può essere distrutto sarà costretto in schiavitù." —Giuramento di Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23642889-6fa3-4a77-81d3-66678ccc5a93\', \'multiverseId\': 274046}, \'multiverseid\': 274046}, {\'name\': \'信仰の縛め\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それが人間であるかぎり＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。 そうでないかぎり、それは攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「破壊し得ぬ物は縛られるであろう。」 アヴァシンの誓約\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9791314-941f-429e-9024-c812d705ccf2\', \'multiverseId\': 274330}, \'multiverseid\': 274330}, {\'name\': \'신앙의 결속\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 인간이라면 +2/+2를 받는다. 만약 인간이 아니라면, 부여된 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"파괴될 수 없는 것은 묶어버릴 지어니."—아바신의 서약\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba7eba0d-3cd3-42a6-a98e-0f9c8e758805\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Laços de Fé\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 enquanto é do tipo Humano. Do contrário, ela não pode atacar nem bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"O que não puder ser destruído será amarrado." — Juramento de Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61df2ec0-70f1-4538-bb74-f83c19ea6132\', \'multiverseId\': 272626}, \'multiverseid\': 272626}, {\'name\': \'Узы Веры\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2, пока оно является Человеком. В противном случае оно не может атаковать или блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Что не может быть уничтожено, будет заковано». — Клятва Авацины\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273c7bdf-d884-4a3a-ac90-883ba7a3364e\', \'multiverseId\': 273194}, \'multiverseid\': 273194}, {\'name\': \'信念羁绊\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n只要所结附的生物是人类，它便得+2/+2。 若否，则它不能进行攻击或阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「就算无法消灭的，也会被镇住。」 ～艾维欣的誓言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7816a620-e19a-4b0b-8623-099cc77c59a9\', \'multiverseId\': 272058}, \'multiverseid\': 272058}, {\'name\': \'信念羈絆\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n只要所結附的生物是人類，它便得+2/+2。 若否，則它不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「就算無法消滅的，也會被鎮住。」 ～艾維欣的誓言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a70589-8cf9-415d-b6ee-bdb582b2f787\', \'multiverseId\': 272342}, \'multiverseid\': 272342}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bis auf die Knochen abnagen\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst für jede Kreatur-Karte auf deinem Friedhof 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nRückblende {2}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a402542f-f14f-41ac-9573-905b3207286f\', \'multiverseId\': 273693}, \'multiverseid\': 273693}, {\'name\': \'Roer hasta el hueso\', \'text\': \'Gana 2 vidas por cada carta de criatura que haya en tu cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329c7a5f-346b-46ce-8063-a36f0820c2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 273977}, \'multiverseid\': 273977}, {\'name\': "Ronger jusqu\'à l\'os", \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {2}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52df5ce0-53ee-42f9-8379-67c0f5bb600f\', \'multiverseId\': 273125}, \'multiverseid\': 273125}, {\'name\': "Rosicchiare Fino all\'Osso", \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {2}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c9110d-ad6c-4dfa-99d4-a6190c10d6a2\', \'multiverseId\': 274261}, \'multiverseid\': 274261}, {\'name\': \'骨までの齧りつき\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき２点のライフを得る。\\nフラッシュバック {2}{G} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4430c343-fa3c-4713-9c1e-6042b3c10637\', \'multiverseId\': 274545}, \'multiverseid\': 274545}, {\'name\': \'뼈까지 갉아먹기\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장당 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85f02b6-0505-4c61-8105-d951f7fe186f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Roer até os Ossos\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida para cada card de criatura no seu cemitério.\\nRecapitular {2}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c64f56-832c-42fb-877a-3e5d37cdf33c\', \'multiverseId\': 272841}, \'multiverseid\': 272841}, {\'name\': \'Обгладывание Костей\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 2 жизни за каждую карту существа на вашем кладбище.\\nВоспоминание {2}{G} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20256326-215d-4641-ab5a-69110d537e44\', \'multiverseId\': 273409}, \'multiverseid\': 273409}, {\'name\': \'啃至白骨\', \'text\': \'你的坟墓场每有一张生物牌，便获得2点生命。\\n返照{2}{G} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e05683-d561-4df1-9936-ff7e8b988b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 272273}, \'multiverseid\': 272273}, {\'name\': \'啃至白骨\', \'text\': \'你的墳墓場每有一張生物牌，便獲得2點生命。\\n返照{2}{G} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046d6816-51fc-4fe1-bc4c-e10c25561d92\', \'multiverseId\': 272557}, \'multiverseid\': 272557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitterherzhexe\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn die Bitterherzhexe stirbt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Fluchkarte durchsuchen, sie an einen Spieler deiner Wahl angelegt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3edc6701-462c-4f48-9c83-a02e0bd2b114\', \'multiverseId\': 273506}, \'multiverseid\': 273506}, {\'name\': \'Bruja de corazón amargo\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando la Bruja de corazón amargo muera, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Maldición, ponerla en el campo de batalla anexada al jugador objetivo, y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6123e58-a13c-48b7-9dc2-53ff2f46fd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 273790}, \'multiverseid\': 273790}, {\'name\': \'Envoûteuse au cœur amer\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand l\'Envoûteuse au cœur amer meurt, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de malédiction, la mettre sur le champ de bataille attachée au joueur ciblé, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4982bc-4721-4f30-adf1-6c988fb3f18c\', \'multiverseId\': 272938}, \'multiverseid\': 272938}, {\'name\': \'Strega dal Cuore Duro\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando la Strega dal Cuore Duro muore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Anatema, metterla sul campo di battaglia assegnata a un giocatore bersaglio, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d43d84-aebb-4e04-b966-c8f0cbd2c84c\', \'multiverseId\': 274074}, \'multiverseid\': 274074}, {\'name\': \'苦心の魔女\', \'text\': \'接死\\n苦心の魔女が死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたはあなたのライブラリーから呪いカードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それをそのプレイヤーにつけられた状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3dd1c9-57d4-47d4-aa00-bb97ed432baf\', \'multiverseId\': 274358}, \'multiverseid\': 274358}, {\'name\': \'쓰린심장 마녀\', \'text\': \'치명타쓰린심장 마녀가 죽을 때, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 당신의 서고에서 저주 카드 한 장을 찾아 그 플레이어에게 부착된 상태로 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0776ace-70e5-4426-bba5-bf3127ce016b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bruxa do Coração Amargo\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Bruxa do Coração Amargo morre, você pode procurar um card do tipo Maldição em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha anexado ao jogador alvo e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45bc6c45-88d1-4106-bf96-e6de165a3db6\', \'multiverseId\': 272654}, \'multiverseid\': 272654}, {\'name\': \'Жесткосердная Ведьма\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Жесткосердная Ведьма умирает, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Проклятия, положить ее на поле битвы прикрепленной к целевому игроку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f6378c-c8e4-4fc8-abd4-3c6fca7ed53a\', \'multiverseId\': 273222}, \'multiverseid\': 273222}, {\'name\': \'仇心女巫\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当仇心女巫死去时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张诅咒牌，将之放进战场并结附于目标牌手，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38edc529-9627-400a-8e49-269b4aca2ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 272086}, \'multiverseid\': 272086}, {\'name\': \'仇心女巫\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n當仇心女巫死去時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張詛咒牌，將之放進戰場並結附於目標玩家，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fabb7188-64b8-4de3-a743-999e85221c08\', \'multiverseId\': 272370}, \'multiverseid\': 272370}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Die Blasphemische Tat zu wirken kostet für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem." —Thalia, Katharer-Ritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b7c1b6-ddd7-4d95-b05b-bc164dab3244\', \'multiverseId\': 273507}, \'multiverseid\': 273507}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} menos lanzar el Acto blasfemo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada." —Thalia, Caballero Cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd28cc7-9ecf-4b67-a94d-fcc5b55e55be\', \'multiverseId\': 273791}, \'multiverseid\': 273791}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "L\'Acte blasphématoire coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. » —Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272939&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d368e371-2d9b-4edf-93dc-216911fadfa9\', \'multiverseId\': 272939}, \'multiverseid\': 272939}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "L\'Atto Blasfemo costa {1} in meno per essere lanciato per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla." —Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9531cca-1667-4424-97f4-9513363c8211\', \'multiverseId\': 274075}, \'multiverseid\': 274075}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'冒涜の行動を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にいるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでにあらゆるものにとっての安住の地ではありません。」 ――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b4db06-3c29-4063-b513-a782b7a58cad\', \'multiverseId\': 274359}, \'multiverseid\': 274359}, {\'name\': \'신성모독 행위\', \'text\': \'신성모독 행위는 전장에 있는 생물 한 개당 발동하는 데 가 덜 든다.신성모독 행위는 각 생물에게 피해 13점씩을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"성소는 더 이상 우리를 죽음으로부터 지켜줄 수 없고, 죽음은 더 이상 우리를 무엇으로부터도 지켜줄 수 없다."—카타르 기사 탈리아\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c9f7af-1a37-4338-9777-0b22003098b3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ato Blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Ato Blasfemo custa {1} a menos para ser conjurado para cada criatura no campo de batalha.\\nAto Blasfemo causa 13 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lugares sagrados não são mais refúgios contra a morte, e a morte não é mais refúgio contra nada." — Thalia, Cátara Cavaleira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66703da0-06c8-4005-93aa-fec7c9acf590\', \'multiverseId\': 272655}, \'multiverseid\': 272655}, {\'name\': \'Кощунственный Акт\', \'text\': \'Стоимость разыгрывания Кощунственного Акта уменьшается на {1} за каждое существо на поле битвы.\\nКощунственный Акт наносит 13 повреждений каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Святые места больше не служат убежищем от смерти, а смерть больше не является убежищем ни от чего». — Талия, рыцарь-катар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c956fa31-874b-4c63-a5c9-6d25835891cc\', \'multiverseId\': 273223}, \'multiverseid\': 273223}, {\'name\': \'渎神行径\', \'text\': \'战场上每有一个生物，渎神行径便减少{1}来施放。\\n渎神行径对每个生物各造成13点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「圣地不再免于死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免于任何沾惹。」 ～护教军骑士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559d9155-a74f-4ea2-8620-2637d521afdd\', \'multiverseId\': 272087}, \'multiverseid\': 272087}, {\'name\': \'瀆神行徑\', \'text\': \'戰場上每有一個生物，瀆神行徑便減少{1}來施放。\\n瀆神行徑對每個生物各造成13點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「聖地不再免於死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免於任何沾惹。」 ～護教軍騎士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f397021a-b1aa-4b6a-865c-92c17c6d3c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 272371}, \'multiverseid\': 272371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutgabendämon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments zieht ein Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte und verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Er genießt die Hingabe seiner Skirsdag-Popanzen und deren Glaube, dass sie dadurch Unsterblichkeit erlangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c89753-c430-4c5b-a7ed-f85d79d1cb35\', \'multiverseId\': 273534}, \'multiverseid\': 273534}, {\'name\': \'Demonio regalo de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el jugador objetivo roba una carta y pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Él disfruta de la devoción de sus marionetas Skirsdag y de que crean que eso les garantizará la inmortalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1fe564-eb6f-4aed-b79d-3cefee5f742e\', \'multiverseId\': 273818}, \'multiverseid\': 273818}, {\'name\': "Démon d\'offresang", \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, le joueur ciblé pioche une carte et perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Il se délecte de la dévotion de ses marionnettes de Skirsdag et de leur conviction qu\'elle leur apportera l\'immortalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401d2ef7-cc1f-4cff-a035-ad663a527bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 272966}, \'multiverseid\': 272966}, {\'name\': \'Demone del Dono di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, un giocatore bersaglio pesca una carta e perde 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': "Apprezza molto la devozione dei suoi burattini Skirsdag e la loro convinzione che farà loro guadagnare l\'immortalità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'030bbaad-038d-482e-93eb-bf229ec17c85\', \'multiverseId\': 274102}, \'multiverseid\': 274102}, {\'name\': \'血の贈与の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'彼はスカースダグの傀儡の献身と、それにより不死になるという誤った信仰を嗜好する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d7cf36-6ed7-41e2-8977-70108165c3c6\', \'multiverseId\': 274386}, \'multiverseid\': 274386}, {\'name\': \'피를 선사하는 악마\', \'text\': \'비행당신의 유지단 시작에, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'그는 스커스대그 꼭두각시들의 헌신과, 그를 통해 영생을 얻을 것이라는 그들의 어긋난 믿음을 즐긴다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a624be4-7d06-43f5-9ae1-47d9db627ce1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Demônio da Oferenda de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, o jogador alvo compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Ele se delicia com a devoção de suas marionetes Skirsdag e sua crença de que isso possa lhes garantir a imortalidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4364b45a-7432-48dd-bcd3-128cfbca8a47\', \'multiverseId\': 272682}, \'multiverseid\': 272682}, {\'name\': \'Демон Кроваваго Дара\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки целевой игрок берет карту и теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Он упивается ревностным служением своих скирдагских марионеток и их верой в то, что этим они заслужат себе бессмертие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0deb41a1-ec72-4d44-a433-aafa7bc1ff8a\', \'multiverseId\': 273250}, \'multiverseid\': 273250}, {\'name\': \'血礼恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，目标牌手抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'手下的史革达傀儡为他作出奉献，相信这能为自己带来永生；这让他非常受用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf819046-b47d-4312-ac0c-d488354c3ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 272114}, \'multiverseid\': 272114}, {\'name\': \'血禮惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的維持開始時，目標玩家抽一張牌且失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'手下的史革達傀儡為他作出奉獻，相信這能為自己帶來永生；這讓他非常受用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90c032e-1e1e-45a1-a1c8-fae10c6a7916\', \'multiverseId\': 272398}, \'multiverseid\': 272398}]', "[{'name': 'Blutgieriger Neugeborener', 'text': 'Der Blutgierige Neugeborene greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.\\nImmer wenn der Blutgierige Neugeborene einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir', 'flavor': 'Während ältere Vampire sich sorgfältig ihre Mahlzeiten aussuchen, werden die Neuzugänge schon bei leichtem Blutgeruch wild.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273446&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '594703e1-208b-4c6a-b1d6-3c21d17ef523', 'multiverseId': 273446}, 'multiverseid': 273446}, {'name': 'Neonata sanguinaria', 'text': 'La Neonata sanguinaria ataca cada turno si puede.\\nSiempre que la Neonata sanguinaria haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': 'Mientras los vampiros ancianos eligen sus comidas con cuidado, los neonatos entran en frenesí al primer aroma.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273730&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41c1521a-b63b-4673-8807-e032ed55b2fe', 'multiverseId': 273730}, 'multiverseid': 273730}, {'name': 'Nouveau-né sanguinaire', 'text': 'Le Nouveau-né sanguinaire attaque à chaque tour si possible.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Nouveau-né sanguinaire inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.', 'type': 'Créature : vampire', 'flavor': 'Alors que les vampires plus anciens suivent un régime alimentaire sophistiqué, les nouvellement transformés deviennent frénétiques dès les premières effluves de sang.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272878&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '350256c8-3c02-4f08-8a40-2eec902b23d6', 'multiverseId': 272878}, 'multiverseid': 272878}, {'name': 'Neonata Smaniosa di Sangue', 'text': 'La Neonata Smaniosa di Sangue attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.\\nOgniqualvolta la Neonata Smaniosa di Sangue infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Neonata Smaniosa di Sangue.', 'type': 'Creatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': 'Mentre i vampiri anziani scelgono con cura i loro pasti, quanti sono generati da poco smaniano al minimo sentore.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274014&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '799065e8-c6fd-422b-960a-f21396e1bf7b', 'multiverseId': 274014}, 'multiverseid': 274014}, {'name': '血に狂った新生子', 'text': '血に狂った新生子は可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\\n血に狂った新生子がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '古参の吸血鬼が注意深く食事を選ぶのに対し、新参者は最初の臭いに狂乱する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274298&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c39b30ae-88d3-4ac2-8787-5c3eeec377ea', 'multiverseId': 274298}, 'multiverseid': 274298}, {'name': '피에 미친 신생흡혈귀', 'text': '피에 미친 신생흡혈귀는 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.피에 미친 신생흡혈귀가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 피에 미친 신생흡혈귀에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '생물 — 흡혈귀', 'flavor': '나이를 먹은 흡혈귀들은 식사감을 조심스레 고르는 반면, 새로 태어난 흡혈귀들은 피 냄새만 맡으면 흥분한다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0672d5ed-7a77-4991-a1ff-748bcfd30c81'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Neonato Sanguimaníaco', 'text': 'Neonato Sanguimaníaco ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.\\nToda vez que Neonato Sanguimaníaco causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': 'Enquanto os vampiros mais antigos selecionam suas refeições com cuidado, os novatos mergulham num frenesi ao primeiro odor de sangue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272594&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aec607f1-e623-4340-b4c3-fd8aa9d999cb', 'multiverseId': 272594}, 'multiverseid': 272594}, {'name': 'Одержимая Кровью Малолетка', 'text': 'Одержимая Кровью Малолетка атакует в каждом ходу, если может.\\nКаждый раз когда Одержимая Кровью Малолетка наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на нее один жетон +1/+1.', 'type': 'Существо — Вампир', 'flavor': 'В то время как вампиры постарше тщательно выбирают свою пищу, молодые впадают в исступление при малейшем запахе крови.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273162&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5508de4e-4626-4777-9126-d4b118739e76', 'multiverseId': 273162}, 'multiverseid': 273162}, {'name': '血狂稚儿', 'text': '血狂稚儿每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n每当血狂稚儿对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': '老一辈吸血鬼会仔细挑选餐点，但初获新生者总因嗅到的第一缕气息而陷入狂热。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272026&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c654346d-ff28-45be-bf5f-484802355fa1', 'multiverseId': 272026}, 'multiverseid': 272026}, {'name': '血狂稚兒', 'text': '血狂稚兒每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n每當血狂稚兒對一位玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': '老一輩吸血鬼會仔細挑選餐點，但初獲新生者總因嗅到的第一縷氣息而陷入狂熱。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272310&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '341cea56-c145-4095-b15d-2c44a9e76ad6', 'multiverseId': 272310}, 'multiverseid': 272310}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bluthalle in Stenzen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: Die Bluthalle in Stenzen fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Das Schwelgen endet, wenn der Vorrat an naiven Mädchen zu Ende geht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f961d35-3395-43f2-a1c2-06da2921a846\', \'multiverseId\': 273592}, \'multiverseid\': 273592}, {\'name\': \'Salón sangriento de Stensia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: El Salón sangriento de Stensia hace 2 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La fiesta se termina cuando se corta el flujo de ingenuos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'005c16df-50c1-4054-9f1c-9e101c7a2c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 273876}, \'multiverseid\': 273876}, {\'name\': \'Hall de sang stensien\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T} : Le Hall de sang stensien inflige 2 blessures à un joueur ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les festivités se terminent quand les réserves d\'ingénues sont à sec.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273024&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803e6be7-b848-498b-a8a5-87c086a8b947\', \'multiverseId\': 273024}, \'multiverseid\': 273024}, {\'name\': \'Sala del Sangue di Stensia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: La Sala del Sangue di Stensia infligge 2 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La baldoria termina quando si prosciugano le scorte di fanciulle fresche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a95eea-00b0-4929-8d89-616742e32def\', \'multiverseId\': 274160}, \'multiverseid\': 274160}, {\'name\': \'ステンシアの血の間\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: プレイヤー１人を対象とする。ステンシアの血の間はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'享楽は新鮮な少女が品切れになったところで終わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd8c86c-7f80-49ea-8bc5-806ab0eed7ef\', \'multiverseId\': 274444}, \'multiverseid\': 274444}, {\'name\': \'스텐시아 혈회관\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 스텐시아 혈회관은 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'처녀들이 모두 사라져야 광란은 끝난다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5940aa7e-fa4a-46d3-8a93-9fb458d1c5cf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Salão do Sangue de Stensia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: Salão do Sangue de Stensia causa 2 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A farra termina quando acabam as provisões de ingênuos frescos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b1e728-e02d-4001-8c88-e6bf5ce24f47\', \'multiverseId\': 272740}, \'multiverseid\': 272740}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Зал в Стенсии\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: Кровавый Зал в Стенсии наносит 2 повреждения целевому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Пирушка заканчивается, когда иссякает запас свеженьких наивных девушек.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13674db-92dd-422a-9792-2fb7176b73b3\', \'multiverseId\': 273308}, \'multiverseid\': 273308}, {\'name\': \'史顿襄血厅\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{3}{B}{R}，{T}：史顿襄血厅对目标牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'当年轻纯真的少女流干了血，欢宴就此结束。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7bbd02e-fd0f-4373-aded-4888be72e33d\', \'multiverseId\': 272172}, \'multiverseid\': 272172}, {\'name\': \'史頓襄血廳\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{3}{B}{R}，{T}：史頓襄血廳對目標玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'當年輕純真的少女流乾了血，歡宴就此結束。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e1e7305-262b-46cf-8320-1f2ef65c9a20\', \'multiverseId\': 272456}, \'multiverseid\': 272456}]', "[{'name': 'Blutlinien-Bewahrer // Fürst des Geschlechts', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nAndere Vampir-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\\n{T}: Bringe einen 2/2 schwarzen Vampir-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Fürst des Geschlechts', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273537&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43004531-bb7d-4d99-947b-087c675d2d1b', 'multiverseId': 273537}, 'multiverseid': 273537}, {'name': 'Guardián de la línea de sangre // Señor del linaje', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLas otras criaturas Vampiro que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\\n{T}: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vampiro negra 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Señor del linaje', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273821&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11b5f626-9851-4a56-8412-3f4de49bfce5', 'multiverseId': 273821}, 'multiverseid': 273821}, {'name': 'Gardien de la lignée // Seigneur de la succession', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres créatures Vampire que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\\n{T} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Vampire avec le vol.', 'type': 'Créature : - vampire', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Seigneur de la succession', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27fe6cb7-8904-499f-9fc9-1b9a501cab6c', 'multiverseId': 272969}, 'multiverseid': 272969}, {'name': 'Custode della Stirpe // Signore del Lignaggio', 'text': 'Volare\\nLe altre creature Vampiro che controlli prendono +2/+2.\\n{T}: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Vampiro 2/2 nera con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Signore del Lignaggio', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274105&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '476fd7ad-2599-4471-a4e7-61a3b7ce06a1', 'multiverseId': 274105}, 'multiverseid': 274105}, {'name': '血統の守り手 // 系統の王', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールする他の吸血鬼・クリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n{T}：飛行を持つ黒の２/２の吸血鬼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー ― - 吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '系統の王', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274389&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '658c837b-469d-4b34-ba0d-f0035d37f39a', 'multiverseId': 274389}, 'multiverseid': 274389}, {'name': '혈통의 수호자 // 혈족의 군주', 'text': '비행\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 흡혈귀 생물들은 +2/+2를 받는다.\\n{T}: 비행 능력을 가진 2/2 흑색 흡혈귀 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.', 'type': '생물 — 흡혈귀', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '혈족의 군주', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d128a95-4f64-4803-ac1d-022bf3ef00ff'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guardião da Estirpe // Senhor da Linhagem', 'text': 'Voar\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Vampiro que você controla recebem +2/+2.\\n{T}: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Vampiro com voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Senhor da Linhagem', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272685&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cff6666-c932-49b1-8ec0-416bff9d4be0', 'multiverseId': 272685}, 'multiverseid': 272685}, {'name': 'Хранитель Кровной Линии // Повелитель Рода', 'text': 'Полет\\nДругие существа-Вампиры под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\\n{T}: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Вампир с Полетом.', 'type': 'Существо — Вампир', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Повелитель Рода', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273253&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1029a675-8483-4156-9d28-d0e1983b268f', 'multiverseId': 273253}, 'multiverseid': 273253}, {'name': '血脉维系者 // 世系之王', 'text': '飞行\\n由你操控的其他吸血鬼生物得+2/+2。\\n{T}：将一个2/2黑色，具飞行异能的吸血鬼衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～ - 吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '世系之王', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272117&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4eb4ca9-2f39-418a-9d99-472bb684b698', 'multiverseId': 272117}, 'multiverseid': 272117}, {'name': '血脈維繫者 // 世系之王', 'text': '飛行\\n由你操控的其他吸血鬼生物得+2/+2。\\n{T}：將一個2/2黑色，具飛行異能的吸血鬼衍生生物放進戰場。', 'type': '生物～ - 吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '世系之王', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272401&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bf474aa-2882-454c-ba38-9fa89ee8d6b3', 'multiverseId': 272401}, 'multiverseid': 272401}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutlinien-Bewahrer // Fürst des Geschlechts\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Bringe einen 2/2 schwarzen Vampir-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\\n{B}: Transformiere den Blutlinien-Bewahrer. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Vampire kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Blutlinien-Bewahrer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43004531-bb7d-4d99-947b-087c675d2d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 273537}, \'multiverseid\': 273537}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de la línea de sangre // Señor del linaje\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Vampiro negra 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{B}: Transforma al Guardián de la línea de sangre. Activa esta habilidad sólo si controlas cinco o más Vampiros.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Guardián de la línea de sangre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b5f626-9851-4a56-8412-3f4de49bfce5\', \'multiverseId\': 273821}, \'multiverseid\': 273821}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de la lignée // Seigneur de la succession\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{T} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Vampire avec le vol.\\n{B} : Transformez le Gardien de la lignée. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq vampires.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gardien de la lignée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272969&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fe6cb7-8904-499f-9fc9-1b9a501cab6c\', \'multiverseId\': 272969}, \'multiverseid\': 272969}, {\'name\': \'Custode della Stirpe // Signore del Lignaggio\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Vampiro 2/2 nera con volare.\\n{B}: Trasforma il Custode della Stirpe. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli cinque o più Vampiri.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Custode della Stirpe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476fd7ad-2599-4471-a4e7-61a3b7ce06a1\', \'multiverseId\': 274105}, \'multiverseid\': 274105}, {\'name\': \'血統の守り手 // 系統の王\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：飛行を持つ黒の２/２の吸血鬼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n{B}：血統の守り手を変身させる。 この能力は、あなたが５体以上の吸血鬼をコントロールしている場合にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'血統の守り手\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658c837b-469d-4b34-ba0d-f0035d37f39a\', \'multiverseId\': 274389}, \'multiverseid\': 274389}, {\'name\': \'혈통의 수호자 // 혈족의 군주\', \'text\': \'비행\\n{T}: 비행 능력을 가진 2/2 흑색 흡혈귀 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n{B}: 혈통의 수호자를 변신시킨다. 당신이 다섯 개 이상의 흡혈귀 지속물을 조종하는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'혈통의 수호자\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d128a95-4f64-4803-ac1d-022bf3ef00ff\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Guardião da Estirpe // Senhor da Linhagem\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{T}: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Vampiro com voar.\\n{B}: Transforme Guardião da Estirpe. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar cinco ou mais Vampiros.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Guardião da Estirpe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cff6666-c932-49b1-8ec0-416bff9d4be0\', \'multiverseId\': 272685}, \'multiverseid\': 272685}, {\'name\': \'Хранитель Кровной Линии // Повелитель Рода\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{T}: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Вампир с Полетом.\\n{B}: трансформируйте Хранителя Кровной Линии. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете не менее пяти Вампиров.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Хранитель Кровной Линии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1029a675-8483-4156-9d28-d0e1983b268f\', \'multiverseId\': 273253}, \'multiverseid\': 273253}, {\'name\': \'血脉维系者 // 世系之王\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}：将一个2/2黑色，具飞行异能的吸血鬼衍生生物放进战场。\\n{B}：转化血脉维系者 你只可以于你操控五个或更多吸血鬼时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'血脉维系者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4eb4ca9-2f39-418a-9d99-472bb684b698\', \'multiverseId\': 272117}, \'multiverseid\': 272117}, {\'name\': \'血脈維繫者 // 世系之王\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：將一個2/2黑色，具飛行異能的吸血鬼衍生生物放進戰場。\\n{B}：轉化血脈維繫者。 你只可以於你操控五個或更多吸血鬼時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'血脈維繫者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bf474aa-2882-454c-ba38-9fa89ee8d6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 272401}, \'multiverseid\': 272401}]', "[{'name': 'Brennende Rache', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch aus deinem Friedhof wirkst, fügt die Brennende Rache einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Nebel ist die Reue der Geister. Wind ist ihr Schmerz. Feuer ist ihre Rache.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273643&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd053cc80-50be-4e66-a99a-6313790ea09c', 'multiverseId': 273643}, 'multiverseid': 273643}, {'name': 'Venganza ardiente', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo desde tu cementerio, la Venganza ardiente le hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'La niebla es el sufrimiento de los geists. El viento es su dolor. El fuego es su venganza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273927&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38d28de7-eafc-45dc-8ec0-b69b99857078', 'multiverseId': 273927}, 'multiverseid': 273927}, {'name': 'Vengeance brûlante', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis votre cimetière, la Vengeance brûlante inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'La brume est la tristesse des geists. Le vent est leur souffrance. Le feu est leur vengeance.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273075&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcce7fe1-ff33-4ece-ad7d-1cdee40b8d8f', 'multiverseId': 273075}, 'multiverseid': 273075}, {'name': 'Vendetta Scottante', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia dal tuo cimitero, la Vendetta Scottante infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'La foschia è il dolore dei geist. Il vento la loro sofferenza. Il fuoco la loro vendetta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274211&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d64bbbf-c7c6-452c-9052-e3717f5a6b89', 'multiverseId': 274211}, 'multiverseid': 274211}, {'name': '燃え立つ復讐', 'text': 'あなたが呪文を１つあなたの墓地から唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。燃え立つ復讐はそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '霧は霊の悲哀だ。 風は霊の苦痛だ。 火は霊の復讐だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274495&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4051222-d4aa-44e0-804f-fc6f86520c9b', 'multiverseId': 274495}, 'multiverseid': 274495}, {'name': '불타는 복수심', 'text': '당신이 무덤에서 주문을 발동할 때마다, 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 불타는 복수심은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '안개는 심령들의 슬픔이요, 바람은 그들의 고통이요, 불은 그들의 복수심이다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ca15646-dd1a-469d-bcdf-dff4a3a95d07'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vingança Incandescente', 'text': 'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de seu cemitério, Vingança Incandescente causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'As brumas são o sofrimento dos geists. O vento, a sua dor. O fogo, a sua vingança.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272791&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74cad50d-6b22-45e9-ae7b-38600aedbcb3', 'multiverseId': 272791}, 'multiverseid': 272791}, {'name': 'Пылающая Месть', 'text': 'Каждый раз когда вы разыгрываете заклинание из вашего кладбища, Пылающая Месть наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Туман — это печаль привидений. Ветер — их боль. Огонь же — их месть.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273359&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e83d9af-1167-46b5-8d0b-e7b4201668a7', 'multiverseId': 273359}, 'multiverseid': 273359}, {'name': '火热复仇', 'text': '每当你从你的坟墓场施放一个咒语时，火热复仇对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '雾是游魂的悲伤。 风是其痛苦。 火是其复仇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272223&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad4381a4-a297-4b43-b33e-ad183b135744', 'multiverseId': 272223}, 'multiverseid': 272223}, {'name': '火熱復仇', 'text': '每當你從你的墳墓場施放一個咒語時，火熱復仇對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '霧是遊魂的悲傷。 風是其痛苦。 火是其復仇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272507&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60fea6ec-a358-466d-87f5-389e774e0029', 'multiverseId': 272507}, 'multiverseid': 272507}]", '[{\'name\': \'Böser Zwilling\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Bösen Zwilling als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass er „{U}{B}, {T}: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit dem gleichen Namen wie diese Kreatur" erhält.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst den Bösen an dem Dolch erkennen, den er in dich rammt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b56dfc1-d211-4c07-b8b1-fe22649db5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 273564}, \'multiverseid\': 273564}, {\'name\': \'Gemelo malvado\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Gemelo malvado entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que gana "{U}{B}, {T}: Destruye la criatura objetivo con el mismo nombre que esta criatura".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Siempre puedes identificar al malvado por la daga que te está clavando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719dcae0-68dd-431d-9140-316eeaf449e0\', \'multiverseId\': 273848}, \'multiverseid\': 273848}, {\'name\': \'Jumeau maléfique\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que le Jumeau maléfique arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature du champ de bataille, excepté qu\'il acquiert « {U}{B}, {T} : Détruisez une créature ciblée du même nom que cette créature. »", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': "On reconnaît toujours le mauvais jumeau à la dague qu\'il vous plante entre les côtes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272996&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef101b2-b068-42fb-b140-6b0244c0a839\', \'multiverseId\': 272996}, \'multiverseid\': 272996}, {\'name\': \'Gemello Cattivo\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare nel campo di battaglia il Gemello Cattivo come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia tranne che ha "{U}{B}, {T}: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con lo stesso nome di questa creatura".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Puoi sempre riconoscere qual è il cattivo dal pugnale con cui ti trafigge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d484229b-daae-4422-a9de-04bb73f8892c\', \'multiverseId\': 274132}, \'multiverseid\': 274132}, {\'name\': \'邪悪な双子\', \'text\': \'あなたは邪悪な双子を、それが「{U}{B}, {T}：このクリーチャーと同じ名前を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。」を得ることを除き、戦場にいるいずれかのクリーチャーのコピーとして戦場に出してよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'悪い方は、そいつがお前に突き立てた短剣で判別できる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3f1068-d709-497a-b957-1e5b8a8fd60e\', \'multiverseId\': 274416}, \'multiverseid\': 274416}, {\'name\': \'사악한 쌍둥이\', \'text\': \'당신은 전장에 있는 원하는 생물 한 개의 복사본으로 사악한 쌍둥이를 전장에 들어오게 할 수 있다. 단, 이 경우 사악한 쌍둥이는 ", : 이 생물과 동일한 명칭을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다."라는 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': \'쌍둥이 중 어느 녀석이 사악한 지를 알려면, 당신의 등에 비수를 꽂아넣는 녀석이 누구인지를 보면 된다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31549445-77b7-4925-a83f-7a02547f7c33\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gêmeo Malévolo\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Gêmeo Malévolo entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer criatura no campo de batalha, com a exceção de que ele ganha "{U}{B}, {T}: Destrua a criatura alvo com o mesmo nome desta criatura."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'É fácil saber quem é o mau: é aquele que está fincando a adaga em você.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eac2625-f743-4325-a1c2-f41409ff0836\', \'multiverseId\': 272712}, \'multiverseid\': 272712}, {\'name\': \'Злой Двойник\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заставить Злого Двойника выйти на поле битвы в качестве копии любого существа на поле битвы, но при этом он получает способность «{U}{B}, {T}: уничтожьте целевое существо с тем же именем, что у этого существа».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Злого всегда можно отличить по кинжалу, который он в вас вонзает.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d419d1-4680-44cb-a234-f3f73896ed0e\', \'multiverseId\': 273280}, \'multiverseid\': 273280}, {\'name\': \'邪恶双生子\', \'text\': \'你可以使邪恶双生子当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它额外获得「{U}{B}，{T}：消灭目标与此生物同名的生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'等到邪恶的那一个在你身上捅把刀，就能认出来了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f15a1bc-328e-4752-b8ac-e468eb8a76fe\', \'multiverseId\': 272144}, \'multiverseid\': 272144}, {\'name\': \'邪惡雙生子\', \'text\': \'你可以使邪惡雙生子當成戰場上任一生物的複製品來進入戰場，但它額外獲得「{U}{B}，{T}：消滅目標與此生物同名的生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物～變形獸\', \'flavor\': \'等到邪惡的那一個在你身上捅把刀，就能認出來了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e08c03-aa07-4262-8e73-cd8aa5b2f131\', \'multiverseId\': 272428}, \'multiverseid\': 272428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bürger aus Eschwald // Heulerrudel aus Eschwald\', \'text\': \'Transformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments das Heulerrudel aus Eschwald, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Die Bewohner von Eschwald haben nichts gegen Fremde — solange sie gut schmecken.\', \'faceName\': \'Heulerrudel aus Eschwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77424574-8b72-4328-b770-dafa10678ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 273514}, \'multiverseid\': 273514}, {\'name\': \'Aldeanos de Estwald // Jauría aullante de Estwald\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma a la Jauría aullante de Estwald.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': \'A los ciudadanos de Estwald no les disgustan los forasteros... saben bien.\', \'faceName\': \'Jauría aullante de Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81bf4234-d459-4d31-98cd-bc4d42a87895\', \'multiverseId\': 273798}, \'multiverseid\': 273798}, {\'name\': "Villageois d\'Estwald // Hurlemeute d\'Estwald", \'text\': "Au début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez la Hurlemeute d\'Estwald.", \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "Les citoyens d\'Estwald ne détestent pas les étrangers ; ils ont très bon goût.", \'faceName\': "Hurlemeute d\'Estwald", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fc2244-9599-4821-8b68-34c0a06e0105\', \'multiverseId\': 272946}, \'multiverseid\': 272946}, {\'name\': \'Abitanti di Estwald // Ulubranco di Estwald\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma l\'Ulubranco di Estwald.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': \'Non è che ai cittadini di Estwald non piacciano gli estranei... anzi hanno un buon sapore.\', \'faceName\': \'Ulubranco di Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8449cd37-fd3f-41c8-8ad3-8b2732686a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 274082}, \'multiverseid\': 274082}, {\'name\': \'エストワルドの村人 // エストワルドの吠え群れ\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、エストワルドの吠え群れを変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': \'エストワルドの人々はよそ者を嫌っていない――彼らは十分美味い。\', \'faceName\': \'エストワルドの吠え群れ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c24d7a6-628d-42e2-b574-298eb5d1ab80\', \'multiverseId\': 274366}, \'multiverseid\': 274366}, {\'name\': \'에스트왈드의 주민들 // 에스트왈드의 포효떼\', \'text\': \'각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 에스트왈드의 포효떼를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'에스트왈드의 시민들은 외부인들을 환영한다 — 맛있으니까.\', \'faceName\': \'에스트왈드의 포효떼\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c44042-2d07-43b0-9062-49602ec85fca\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aldeões de Estwald // Alcateia Uivante de Estwald\', \'text\': \'No início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Alcateia Uivante de Estwald.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Os cidadãos de Estwald não rechaçam os forasteiros — o gosto deles também é bom.\', \'faceName\': \'Alcateia Uivante de Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989ed759-71f7-4bd6-9aef-e8fd50bb1e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 272662}, \'multiverseid\': 272662}, {\'name\': \'Эствальдские Селяне // Эствальдская Воющая Стая\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Эствальдскую Воющую Стаю.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Жители Эствальда не имеют ничего против чужаков — на вкус они совершенно нормальные.\', \'faceName\': \'Эствальдская Воющая Стая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481f54cd-f195-48e0-87f0-300025b3142f\', \'multiverseId\': 273230}, \'multiverseid\': 273230}, {\'name\': \'恩资森村民 // 恩资森嚎群\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化恩资森嚎群。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'恩资森人民并不讨厌外来者～他们滋味不错。\', \'faceName\': \'恩资森嚎群\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a6eb993-8a34-4a44-b4fd-2235fd9ebcbc\', \'multiverseId\': 272094}, \'multiverseid\': 272094}, {\'name\': \'恩資森村民 // 恩資森嚎群\', \'text\': \'在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化恩資森嚎群。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'恩資森人民並不討厭外來者～他們滋味不錯。\', \'faceName\': \'恩資森嚎群\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0fa287-17a3-468f-9e3e-f17919f1d070\', \'multiverseId\': 272378}, \'multiverseid\': 272378}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bürger aus Eschwald // Heulerrudel aus Eschwald\', \'text\': \'Transformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Bürger aus Eschwald, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst eine Werwolfstadt daran erkennen, dass es keine Metzgerei gibt.\', \'faceName\': \'Bürger aus Eschwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77424574-8b72-4328-b770-dafa10678ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 273514}, \'multiverseid\': 273514}, {\'name\': \'Aldeanos de Estwald // Jauría aullante de Estwald\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma a los Aldeanos de Estwald.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Puedes identificar una ciudad ocupada por licántropos por la falta de carnicerías.\', \'faceName\': \'Aldeanos de Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81bf4234-d459-4d31-98cd-bc4d42a87895\', \'multiverseId\': 273798}, \'multiverseid\': 273798}, {\'name\': "Villageois d\'Estwald // Hurlemeute d\'Estwald", \'text\': "Au début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez les Villageois d\'Estwald.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "On remarque qu\'une ville est infestée de loups-garous par le manque de boucheries.", \'faceName\': "Villageois d\'Estwald", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fc2244-9599-4821-8b68-34c0a06e0105\', \'multiverseId\': 272946}, \'multiverseid\': 272946}, {\'name\': \'Abitanti di Estwald // Ulubranco di Estwald\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma gli Abitanti di Estwald.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Puoi riconoscere se una città è infestata dai lupi mannari dalla mancanza di macellerie.\', \'faceName\': \'Abitanti di Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8449cd37-fd3f-41c8-8ad3-8b2732686a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 274082}, \'multiverseid\': 274082}, {\'name\': \'エストワルドの村人 // エストワルドの吠え群れ\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、エストワルドの村人を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'狼男の蔓延している村は、肉屋が無いことでそれと知れる。\', \'faceName\': \'エストワルドの村人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c24d7a6-628d-42e2-b574-298eb5d1ab80\', \'multiverseId\': 274366}, \'multiverseid\': 274366}, {\'name\': \'에스트왈드의 주민들 // 에스트왈드의 포효떼\', \'text\': \'각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 에스트왈드의 주민들을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'마을에 정육점이 없다면, 그곳은 늑대인간들이 들끓는 곳이다.\', \'faceName\': \'에스트왈드의 주민들\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c44042-2d07-43b0-9062-49602ec85fca\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aldeões de Estwald // Alcateia Uivante de Estwald\', \'text\': \'No início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Aldeões de Estwald.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'É possível dizer se uma cidade está infestada de lobisomens pela ausência de açougues.\', \'faceName\': \'Aldeões de Estwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989ed759-71f7-4bd6-9aef-e8fd50bb1e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 272662}, \'multiverseid\': 272662}, {\'name\': \'Эствальдские Селяне // Эствальдская Воющая Стая\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Эствальдских Селян.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Населенный вервольфами город можно вычислить по отсутствию в нем мясных лавок.\', \'faceName\': \'Эствальдские Селяне\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481f54cd-f195-48e0-87f0-300025b3142f\', \'multiverseId\': 273230}, \'multiverseid\': 273230}, {\'name\': \'恩资森村民 // 恩资森嚎群\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化恩资森村民。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'若某城镇没有屠夫开店，就是狼人在此出没的指标。\', \'faceName\': \'恩资森村民\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a6eb993-8a34-4a44-b4fd-2235fd9ebcbc\', \'multiverseId\': 272094}, \'multiverseid\': 272094}, {\'name\': \'恩資森村民 // 恩資森嚎群\', \'text\': \'在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化恩資森村民。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'若某城鎮沒有屠夫開店，就是狼人在此出沒的指標。\', \'faceName\': \'恩資森村民\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0fa287-17a3-468f-9e3e-f17919f1d070\', \'multiverseId\': 272378}, \'multiverseid\': 272378}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bürgermeister von Auerbrück // Alphatier des Heulerrudels\', \'text\': \'Andere Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Bürgermeister von Auerbrück, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Er kann seine wahre Natur nur kurzzeitig leugnen.\', \'faceName\': \'Bürgermeister von Auerbrück\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c87b6ac8-c174-481b-bbd6-a6a9bd41b4f3\', \'multiverseId\': 273500}, \'multiverseid\': 273500}, {\'name\': \'Alcalde de Avabruck // Alfa de la jauría aullante\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Humano que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Alcalde de Avabruck.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Puede negar su verdadera naturaleza, pero no para siempre.\', \'faceName\': \'Alcalde de Avabruck\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c5d266-5710-49c1-8b0d-40ced0270dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 273784}, \'multiverseid\': 273784}, {\'name\': "Maire d\'Avabruck // Alpha hurlemeute", \'text\': "Les autres créatures Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Maire d\'Avabruck.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': \'Il ne peut pas dénier sa véritable nature très longtemps.\', \'faceName\': "Maire d\'Avabruck", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf7d51da-3f0d-4ca9-8dcb-09beb22541ba\', \'multiverseId\': 272932}, \'multiverseid\': 272932}, {\'name\': \'Sindaco di Avabruck // Ulubranco Alfa\', \'text\': "Le altre creature Umano che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma il Sindaco di Avabruck.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Non può negare la sua vera natura molto a lungo.\', \'faceName\': \'Sindaco di Avabruck\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f507b2e-ad37-4f64-bde3-e035c49e42ed\', \'multiverseId\': 274068}, \'multiverseid\': 274068}, {\'name\': \'アヴァブルックの町長 // 吠え群れの頭目\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他の人間・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、アヴァブルックの町長を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'彼は自らの本性にあまり長くは抗えない。\', \'faceName\': \'アヴァブルックの町長\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47e9aba-8d8b-4a36-a429-a7c42be541c9\', \'multiverseId\': 274352}, \'multiverseid\': 274352}, {\'name\': \'아바브룩의 촌장 // 포효떼 우두머리\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 인간 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 아바브룩의 촌장을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 참모 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'그가 본성을 억제하는 데에는 한계가 있다.\', \'faceName\': \'아바브룩의 촌장\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df4e68a-1332-41c2-8ff7-c3b50356eebc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Prefeito de Avabruck // Alfa da Alcateia Uivante\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas do tipo Humano que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Prefeito de Avabruck.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Ele pode negar sua verdadeira natureza apenas por um curto período de tempo.\', \'faceName\': \'Prefeito de Avabruck\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc9aa56-23ca-4265-a78f-ab747d85f242\', \'multiverseId\': 272648}, \'multiverseid\': 272648}, {\'name\': \'Бургомистр Авабрюка // Вожак Воющей Стаи\', \'text\': \'Другие существа с типом Человек под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Бургомистра Авабрюка.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Советник Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Он может отрицать свою истинную сущность, но лишь до поры до времени.\', \'faceName\': \'Бургомистр Авабрюка\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a7823b-f4d3-4785-bc1b-868dfb3258e8\', \'multiverseId\': 273216}, \'multiverseid\': 273216}, {\'name\': \'阿瓦布镇长 // 嚎群首领\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他人类生物得+1/+1。\\n在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化阿瓦布镇长。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／参谋／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他想抗拒自己的本性，但也撑不了太久。\', \'faceName\': \'阿瓦布镇长\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d1d3e64-ff23-44d5-918b-d8742e14cde4\', \'multiverseId\': 272080}, \'multiverseid\': 272080}, {\'name\': \'阿瓦布鎮長 // 嚎群首領\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他人類生物得+1/+1。\\n在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化阿瓦布鎮長。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／參謀／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他想抗拒自己的本性，但也撐不了太久。\', \'faceName\': \'阿瓦布鎮長\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a443b8-b2c0-45b4-98e2-2e0420007661\', \'multiverseId\': 272364}, \'multiverseid\': 272364}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bürgermeister von Auerbrück // Alphatier des Heulerrudels\', \'text\': \'Andere Werwolf- und Wolf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nBringe zu Beginn deines Endsegments einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments das Alphatier des Heulerrudels, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Alphatier des Heulerrudels\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c87b6ac8-c174-481b-bbd6-a6a9bd41b4f3\', \'multiverseId\': 273500}, \'multiverseid\': 273500}, {\'name\': \'Alcalde de Avabruck // Alfa de la jauría aullante\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Licántropo y Lobo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Alfa de la jauría aullante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Alfa de la jauría aullante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c5d266-5710-49c1-8b0d-40ced0270dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 273784}, \'multiverseid\': 273784}, {\'name\': "Maire d\'Avabruck // Alpha hurlemeute", \'text\': "Les autres créatures Loup-garou et Loup que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez l\'Alpha hurlemeute.", \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Alpha hurlemeute\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf7d51da-3f0d-4ca9-8dcb-09beb22541ba\', \'multiverseId\': 272932}, \'multiverseid\': 272932}, {\'name\': \'Sindaco di Avabruck // Ulubranco Alfa\', \'text\': "Le altre creature Mannaro e Lupo che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma l\'Ulubranco Alfa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Ulubranco Alfa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f507b2e-ad37-4f64-bde3-e035c49e42ed\', \'multiverseId\': 274068}, \'multiverseid\': 274068}, {\'name\': \'アヴァブルックの町長 // 吠え群れの頭目\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他の狼男・クリーチャーと狼・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、吠え群れの頭目を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'吠え群れの頭目\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47e9aba-8d8b-4a36-a429-a7c42be541c9\', \'multiverseId\': 274352}, \'multiverseid\': 274352}, {\'name\': \'아바브룩의 촌장 // 포효떼 우두머리\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 늑대인간과 늑대 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 2/2 녹색 늑대 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 포효떼 우두머리를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'포효떼 우두머리\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df4e68a-1332-41c2-8ff7-c3b50356eebc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Prefeito de Avabruck // Alfa da Alcateia Uivante\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas dos tipos Lobisomem e Lobo que você controla ganham +1/+1.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Lobo.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Alfa da Alcateia Uivante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Alfa da Alcateia Uivante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc9aa56-23ca-4265-a78f-ab747d85f242\', \'multiverseId\': 272648}, \'multiverseid\': 272648}, {\'name\': \'Бургомистр Авабрюка // Вожак Воющей Стаи\', \'text\': \'Другие существа-Вервольфы и -Волки под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Волк.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Вожака Воющей Стаи.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Вожак Воющей Стаи\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a7823b-f4d3-4785-bc1b-868dfb3258e8\', \'multiverseId\': 273216}, \'multiverseid\': 273216}, {\'name\': \'阿瓦布镇长 // 嚎群首领\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他狼人生物与狼生物得+1/+1。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，将一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物放进战场。\\n在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化嚎群首领。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'嚎群首领\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d1d3e64-ff23-44d5-918b-d8742e14cde4\', \'multiverseId\': 272080}, \'multiverseid\': 272080}, {\'name\': \'阿瓦布鎮長 // 嚎群首領\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他狼人生物與狼生物得+1/+1。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，將一個2/2綠色的狼衍生生物放進戰場。\\n在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化嚎群首領。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'嚎群首領\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a443b8-b2c0-45b4-98e2-2e0420007661\', \'multiverseId\': 272364}, \'multiverseid\': 272364}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Sprengels\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion des Sprengels.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kämpfe für jeden Schuster, jeden Gerber und jeden Dummkopf in dieser Stadt — und sie kämpfen für mich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0ad5af-495a-46ef-b55c-6ad91afc22ae\', \'multiverseId\': 273710}, \'multiverseid\': 273710}, {\'name\': \'Campeón de la parroquia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Humano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Campeón de la parroquia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Estoy aquí por cada zapatero, curtidor y bufón de este pueblo... y ellos están aquí por mí."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d183bc-63da-474e-a642-c6d3fd069a56\', \'multiverseId\': 273994}, \'multiverseid\': 273994}, {\'name\': \'Champion de la paroisse\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Champion de la paroisse.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Je défends chaque cordonnier, tanneur, et idiot de cette ville, et chacun d\'eux fait de même pour moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea9c928-8f22-4acd-843c-52719b31be85\', \'multiverseId\': 273142}, \'multiverseid\': 273142}, {\'name\': \'Campione del Popolo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Umano entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Campione del Popolo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Rappresento ogni ciabattino, conciatore e sempliciotto di questa città... e loro mi sostengono."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6e8b54-36be-45a8-b1cb-0e529dba5318\', \'multiverseId\': 274278}, \'multiverseid\': 274278}, {\'name\': \'教区の勇者\', \'text\': \'他の人間があなたのコントロール下で１体戦場に出るたび、教区の勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「私はこの町の靴屋や皮職人や愚か者のために戦う――そして、彼らも私のために戦ってくれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862e48fb-396e-49d7-85f0-4a07f26f238a\', \'multiverseId\': 274562}, \'multiverseid\': 274562}, {\'name\': \'교구의 투사\', \'text\': \'다른 인간 지속물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 교구의 투사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 이 마을의 모든 수선공, 무두장이, 그리고 얼간이를 위해 싸우고, 그들은 나를 위해 싸우지."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5912604d-858c-4332-95d7-1cbc9b7a8946\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Campeão da Paróquia\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Humano entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Campeão da Paróquia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu defendo cada sapateiro, curtidor e tolo nesta cidade — e eles me defendem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87542af1-8361-4641-a22c-bfedeccb0cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 272858}, \'multiverseid\': 272858}, {\'name\': \'Приходской Заступник\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда другой Человек выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Приходского Заступника.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Я стою за каждого сапожника, кожевника и юродивого в этом городе, а они стоят за меня».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f52fb4-ab87-4d6b-a69b-30e81281bc14\', \'multiverseId\': 273426}, \'multiverseid\': 273426}, {\'name\': \'教区斗士\', \'text\': \'每当另一个人类在你的操控下进战场时，在教区斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我挺城里每一个鞋匠，染匠，以及愚人～而他们也挺我。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c92d05-37a0-4fac-9d02-c6c23cd8675d\', \'multiverseId\': 272290}, \'multiverseid\': 272290}, {\'name\': \'教區鬥士\', \'text\': \'每當另一個人類在你的操控下進戰場時，在教區鬥士上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我挺城裡每一個鞋匠，染匠，以及愚人～而他們也挺我。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57287d0e-f9e3-4249-9057-db421cf9eb3f\', \'multiverseId\': 272574}, \'multiverseid\': 272574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Grab reinigen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nRückblende {W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Priester reden ganz leise über die Höllgruft, ein silbernes Gefängnis für ungeläutertes Übel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9ffefe-4a67-4fad-a410-299d96d738fd\', \'multiverseId\': 273533}, \'multiverseid\': 273533}, {\'name\': \'Purificar la tumba\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos sacerdotes susurran sobre el Helvault, la prisión de plata para los males sin purgar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43810e0-279b-4dd7-b9ef-884aa75df203\', \'multiverseId\': 273817}, \'multiverseid\': 273817}, {\'name\': \'Purification de la tombe\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte ciblée d\'un cimetière.\\nFlashback {W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Certains prêtres parlent à mi-voix du Helgruft, la prison d\'argent des maux non exorcisés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d7ce573-d6d4-43c1-a2e7-0916219c1be8\', \'multiverseId\': 272965}, \'multiverseid\': 272965}, {\'name\': \'Purificare il Sepolcro\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\nFlashback {W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Alcuni sacerdoti parlano sottovoce dell\'Helvault, una prigione d\'argento per malvagità inespiate.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb45cc0f-4466-4de8-b30e-695223d25449\', \'multiverseId\': 274101}, \'multiverseid\': 274101}, {\'name\': \'墓場の浄化\', \'text\': \'いずれかの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。\\nフラッシュバック {W} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'僧侶の中には、粛正されぬ邪悪を閉じ込める銀の牢獄、獄庫の話を囁く者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f284486-320c-484c-b6dc-71df4a71d7b1\', \'multiverseId\': 274385}, \'multiverseid\': 274385}, {\'name\': \'무덤 정화\', \'text\': \'무덤에 있는 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'사제들은 숙청되지 않은 악이 감금된 은의 감옥 헬볼트에 대해 수군거리곤 한다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73daa7ef-1c1b-4bd9-81e3-28a1ad0f5cd9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Purificar o Túmulo\', \'text\': \'Exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\\nRecapitular {W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns sacerdotes sussurram ao falar sobre a Câmara Infernal, uma prisão prateada para as forças malignas impuras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3648a84-732b-4e34-ac12-91b9dd6fc817\', \'multiverseId\': 272681}, \'multiverseid\': 272681}, {\'name\': \'Очищение Могилы\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевую карту из кладбища.\\nВоспоминание {W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые священники осмеливаются лишь шепотом говорить о Хелволте — серебряной темнице для неискупленного зла.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b83c9a2e-5c44-4095-997c-3c73b09e1af3\', \'multiverseId\': 273249}, \'multiverseid\': 273249}, {\'name\': \'净化墓地\', \'text\': \'将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\\n返照{W} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'某些僧侣会私下提及狱窖，这是用以监禁未净化邪物的银牢笼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e866c141-fce9-4210-8dad-91ebc40b282b\', \'multiverseId\': 272113}, \'multiverseid\': 272113}, {\'name\': \'淨化墓地\', \'text\': \'將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。\\n返照{W} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'某些僧侶會私下提及獄窖，這是用以監禁未淨化邪物的銀牢籠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261559f9-bf9a-4831-9707-cf42d7036c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 272397}, \'multiverseid\': 272397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Bauern sammeln\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nRückblende {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nachts nach draußen musst, nimm alle deine Freunde mit." —Meister der Katharer von Ellgau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c999f96-1dcd-4206-8067-0f3686106999\', \'multiverseId\': 273628}, \'multiverseid\': 273628}, {\'name\': \'Agrupar a los campesinos\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controles obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si debes salir de noche, lleva una turba." —Maestro de los Cátaros de Elgaud\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c3a965-d5d7-4b2a-a54f-2b9857e18a4b\', \'multiverseId\': 273912}, \'multiverseid\': 273912}, {\'name\': \'Ralliement des paysans\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous devez sortir la nuit, faites-vous accompagner par une foule. » —Maître des cathares d\'Elgaud", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c725e6-0cbd-42c7-ae56-da9da491dd94\', \'multiverseId\': 273060}, \'multiverseid\': 273060}, {\'name\': \'Radunare i Contadini\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se devi uscire di notte, portati una folla." —Maestro dei Catari di Elgaud\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f6f232-32de-4c3e-b958-434096c9c96a\', \'multiverseId\': 274196}, \'multiverseid\': 274196}, {\'name\': \'農民の結集\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nフラッシュバック {2}{R} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「夜中に出歩かねばならぬなら、烏合の衆を連れて行け。」 ――エルゴードの聖戦士の師\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178ac3f8-d73b-4a6f-b1cf-3c11c5f137de\', \'multiverseId\': 274480}, \'multiverseid\': 274480}, {\'name\': \'농민 궐기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\\n그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"밤에 꼭 나가야 한다면, 무리를 지어서 나가라."—엘고드 지부 카타르 대장\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e10604-7909-45e6-9a66-d7a160437139\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Reunir os Camponeses\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno.\\nRecapitular {2}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você precisar sair de noite, leve uma multidão com você." — Mestre dos Cátaros de Elgaud\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa004fab-d5e8-4049-978b-8d02c9dd9018\', \'multiverseId\': 272776}, \'multiverseid\': 272776}, {\'name\': \'Подъем Крестьян\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+0 до конца хода.\\nВоспоминание {2}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если вам нужно выйти из дома ночью, берите с собой толпу». — Глава элгодских катаров\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3931722-4c45-4402-b3ec-c268ef52fd00\', \'multiverseId\': 273344}, \'multiverseid\': 273344}, {\'name\': \'集结农民\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\\n返照{2}{R} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果必须在夜间出门，就与一群人同行。」 ～艾尔告护教军领袖\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f392f43-bf59-4fdc-8ec3-b7fd8a76a631\', \'multiverseId\': 272208}, \'multiverseid\': 272208}, {\'name\': \'集結農民\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。\\n返照{2}{R} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果必須在夜間出門，就與一群人同行。」 ～艾爾告護教軍領袖\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f26d016-a179-48f3-9f8a-3b6c1c2efd63\', \'multiverseId\': 272492}, \'multiverseid\': 272492}]', "[{'name': 'Die Blutlinie unterbrechen', 'text': 'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und alle anderen Kreaturen, die den gleichen Namen wie diese Kreatur haben, ins Exil.\\nRückblende {5}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273659&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a48af60-026b-4f6d-a258-90549ae637e0', 'multiverseId': 273659}, 'multiverseid': 273659}, {'name': 'Cortar la línea de sangre', 'text': 'Exilia la criatura objetivo y todas las otras criaturas con el mismo nombre que esa criatura.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273943&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '219c3cb4-8ed3-456b-b5fb-d32a0e62dd61', 'multiverseId': 273943}, 'multiverseid': 273943}, {'name': 'Interrompre la lignée', 'text': 'Exilez la créature ciblée et toutes les autres créatures ayant le même nom que cette créature.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Puis exilez-la.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273091&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e521d1-2dc8-49cc-bb7e-73a894fdc534', 'multiverseId': 273091}, 'multiverseid': 273091}, {'name': 'Interrompere la Stirpe', 'text': 'Esilia una creatura bersaglio e tutte le altre creature con lo stesso nome di quella creatura.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274227&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16656b80-a461-49fe-9fa8-1f4f287be210', 'multiverseId': 274227}, 'multiverseid': 274227}, {'name': '血統の切断', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それと、そのクリーチャーと同じ名前を持つ他のすべてのクリーチャーを追放する。\\nフラッシュバック {5}{B}{B} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274511&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3cfdea6-d00c-4594-b6e7-b2c839a8a0c3', 'multiverseId': 274511}, 'multiverseid': 274511}, {'name': '멸문지화', 'text': '생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물 및 그 생물과 동일한 명칭을 가진 모든 생물을 추방한다.회상 (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b24f45cd-b67e-48ec-8b4d-52dec5f30da6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Decepar a Estirpe', 'text': 'Exile a criatura alvo e todas as outras criaturas com o mesmo nome daquela criatura.\\nRecapitular {5}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272807&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27af8ac6-e9e9-40ba-abd9-9b857d8c36d3', 'multiverseId': 272807}, 'multiverseid': 272807}, {'name': 'Прерывание Кровной Линии', 'text': 'Изгоните целевое существо и все остальные существа с тем же именем, что у него.\\nВоспоминание {5}{B}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273375&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a991b710-a55b-4a9a-b3ab-0cb735006119', 'multiverseId': 273375}, 'multiverseid': 273375}, {'name': '斩断血脉', 'text': '放逐目标生物与所有与该生物同名的其它生物。\\n返照{5}{B}{B} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272239&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '197fb8c7-2cb8-4cdf-88f1-0670add710b7', 'multiverseId': 272239}, 'multiverseid': 272239}, {'name': '斬斷血脈', 'text': '放逐目標生物與所有與該生物同名的其它生物。\\n返照{5}{B}{B} （你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272523&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4645f0f0-8f45-40b4-820b-7ff07ff7018f', 'multiverseId': 272523}, 'multiverseid': 272523}]", "[{'name': 'Die Monster erschlagen', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder größer.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Obwohl die alten Schutzzauber und Schreine am Straßenrand nicht mehr ihre einstige Kraft haben, ist der Glaube an Avacyn immer noch äußerst mächtig.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273447&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd2fe368-a462-4559-92ec-4190ba1ca530', 'multiverseId': 273447}, 'multiverseid': 273447}, {'name': 'Abatir al monstruo', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Aunque las viejas guardas sagradas y los altares de los caminos comenzaron a fallar, la fe en Avacyn todavía tiene poder verdadero.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273731&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0bf5619-dda6-4f63-813b-0be8a8de225b', 'multiverseId': 273731}, 'multiverseid': 273731}, {'name': 'Pourfendre le monstrueux', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les vieilles défenses sacrées et les reliquaires des routes ont beau faiblir, la foi en Avacyn reste toujours la source de la véritable puissance.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272879&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84d5de6a-bdf5-411a-8364-4ecfa8dd051a', 'multiverseId': 272879}, 'multiverseid': 272879}, {'name': 'Punire i Mostruosi', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Sebbene le vecchie protezioni sacre e i santuari sulla strada abbiano iniziato a mancare, la fede in Avacyn ha ancora molto potere.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274015&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4f22426-9645-4faa-97bc-896585b6431e', 'multiverseId': 274015}, 'multiverseid': 274015}, {'name': '大物潰し', 'text': 'パワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '古えの聖なる結界や道路脇の神殿が崩れ初めても、アヴァシンへの信仰は真の力を持ち続ける。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274299&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3a3ff55-a5ef-459c-a291-4d712b9a5826', 'multiverseId': 274299}, 'multiverseid': 274299}, {'name': '괴물의 격파', 'text': '4 이상의 공격력을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '오래된 마법진과 길가의 전당들은 무너지고 있지만, 여전히 아바신에 대한 신앙에는 힘이 존재한다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d0cce9f-1297-4ce0-9bbc-47c019171c31'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Golpear o Monstruoso', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo com poder maior ou igual a 4.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Embora os antigos guardiões sagrados e os sacrários na beira das estradas tenham começado a ceder, a fé em Avacyn ainda é potente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272595&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b3a6bd4-6e9d-453d-a898-f689cd99c9e8', 'multiverseId': 272595}, 'multiverseid': 272595}, {'name': 'Сразить Чудовище', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо с силой 4 или больше.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Хотя старинные обереги и придорожные святилища уже не имеют прежнего действия, вера в Авацину до сих пор дает настоящую силу.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273163&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97f52a18-b8e2-479c-9900-c29f7cc40cba', 'multiverseId': 273163}, 'multiverseid': 273163}, {'name': '击灭恶物', 'text': '消灭目标力量大于或等于4的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '虽然古老的神圣守护与路旁圣坛已经开始失效，对艾维欣的信仰依旧具有力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272027&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dbd4cec-6767-4f2f-adf6-d5b5c8951883', 'multiverseId': 272027}, 'multiverseid': 272027}, {'name': '擊滅惡物', 'text': '消滅目標力量大於或等於4的生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '雖然古老的神聖守護與路旁聖壇已經開始失效，對艾維欣的信仰依舊具有力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272311&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21f990ee-bcb1-46b8-abf8-04c0e9488eb6', 'multiverseId': 272311}, 'multiverseid': 272311}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dolch mit Silberintarsien\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nSolange die ausgerüstete Kreatur ein Mensch ist, erhält sie zusätzlich +1/+0.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Magische Linien machten ein Schnitzwerkzeug zu einer Waffe für die Wolfsjagd.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739e85c8-028b-4aad-a18d-93cfb1c05f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 273501}, \'multiverseid\': 273501}, {\'name\': \'Daga tallada con plata\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nMientras la criatura equipada sea Humano, obtiene +1/+0 adicional.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Grabados mágicos convirtieron la herramienta del esquilador en el arma de un cazador de lobos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba86e68b-7e67-4d15-bc9b-4bdef39595da\', \'multiverseId\': 273785}, \'multiverseid\': 273785}, {\'name\': "Dague incrustée d\'argent", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nTant que la créature équipée est un humain, elle gagne +1/+0 supplémentaire.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Des gravures magiques transformèrent l\'outil d\'un tailleur de bois en arme de chasseur de loups.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8255a1d9-d980-433f-a22d-fe2872455f76\', \'multiverseId\': 272933}, \'multiverseid\': 272933}, {\'name\': \'Pugnale Damaschinato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nFintanto che la creatura equipaggiata è un Umano, prende +1/+0 addizionale.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Le incisioni magiche trasformarono l\'arnese di un intagliatore nell\'arma di un cacciatore di lupi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f560500f-3555-43f7-9bed-892b451acd30\', \'multiverseId\': 274069}, \'multiverseid\': 274069}, {\'name\': \'銀の象眼の短刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが人間であるかぎり、それは追加で＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備 {2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'魔法の刻印が、彫刻師の道具を狼狩りの武器に変えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7d6647-db97-42cd-8c42-02c1c9c04771\', \'multiverseId\': 274353}, \'multiverseid\': 274353}, {\'name\': \'은세공 단도\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받는다.장착된 생물이 인간이라면, 그 생물은 +1/+0을 추가로 받는다.장착\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'마법이 부여된 글씨가 새겨진 후, 그 단도는 나무를 깎는 도구에서 늑대사냥꾼의 무기로 변했다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37fcc782-4252-4e87-92a8-1546449ff47e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Adaga Incrustada de Prata\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nEnquanto a criatura equipada for do tipo Humano, ela receberá um +1/+0 adicional.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os entalhes mágicos transformaram a ferramenta de entalhador numa arma de caçador de lobos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11dbcc7c-8181-4d3d-86c9-fc1e75de54f5\', \'multiverseId\': 272649}, \'multiverseid\': 272649}, {\'name\': \'Посеребренный Кинжал\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0.\\nПока снаряженное существо является Человеком, оно получает дополнительные +1/+0.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Магическая гравировка превратила инструмент резчика в оружие охотника на волков.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f41b822b-8753-41f9-a772-f0bbaea7d648\', \'multiverseId\': 273217}, \'multiverseid\': 273217}, {\'name\': \'嵌银匕首\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物是人类，它便额外得+1/+0。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'魔力蚀刻让普通的切削工具化作狼猎手的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b263be0d-4276-461c-a3e0-98b29d702390\', \'multiverseId\': 272081}, \'multiverseid\': 272081}, {\'name\': \'嵌銀匕首\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n只要佩帶此武具的生物是人類，它便額外得+1/+0。\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'魔力蝕刻讓普通的切削工具化作狼獵手的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b62c65-b191-4810-a0db-417563b2a270\', \'multiverseId\': 272365}, \'multiverseid\': 272365}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfkannibalen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Mensch-Kreatur stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Dorfkannibalen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Manche haben die Schrecken von Innistrad nur dadurch überlebt, indem sie die schlimmsten Monster von allen geworden sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ed9ef6-b7f3-4fb0-aab6-46af9e1aa50f\', \'multiverseId\': 273508}, \'multiverseid\': 273508}, {\'name\': \'Caníbales de la aldea\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura Humano muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre los Caníbales de la aldea.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos toleran los horrores de Innistrad convirtiéndose en los monstruos más temibles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d19cfba-99de-4d68-b293-e10e5b205e98\', \'multiverseId\': 273792}, \'multiverseid\': 273792}, {\'name\': \'Cannibales du village\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature Humain meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur les Cannibales du village.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': "Certains ont survécu aux horreurs d\'Innistrad en devenant des monstres encore pires.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41162e89-0cd3-4fef-9279-640df9a3a28d\', \'multiverseId\': 272940}, \'multiverseid\': 272940}, {\'name\': \'Cannibali del Villaggio\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura Umano muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sui Cannibali del Villaggio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni hanno sopportato gli orrori di Innistrad divenendo i peggiori tra tutti i mostri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e73c58-7a95-42ca-9e29-2071c35bfe95\', \'multiverseId\': 274076}, \'multiverseid\': 274076}, {\'name\': \'村の食人者\', \'text\': \'他の人間・クリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、村の食人者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'イニストラードの恐怖に耐えるのに、自ら最悪の怪物になるものもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd13f50a-aee1-4dbb-9aba-e4aecbbf9bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 274360}, \'multiverseid\': 274360}, {\'name\': \'마을 식인종들\', \'text\': \'다른 인간 생물이 죽을 때마다, 마을 식인종들에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간\', \'flavor\': \'몇몇 사람들은 이니스트라드의 참상을 견뎌내기 위해 스스로 최악의 괴물이 되는 길을 택했다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3df086-a0cf-42d3-a5de-2645410f5e65\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Canibais da Aldeia\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura do tipo Humano morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Canibais da Aldeia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Para suportar os horrores de Innistrad, alguns de seus habitantes se tornaram os piores monstros de todos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb72886-7d18-47ec-82da-ca163fcd6f58\', \'multiverseId\': 272656}, \'multiverseid\': 272656}, {\'name\': \'Деревенские Людоеды\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда другое существо-Человек умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Деревенских Людоедов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые выживают среди ужасов Иннистрада, становясь самыми отвратительными из всех монстров.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e39207f-0bf4-44a9-ac5a-eb19f73f9cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 273224}, \'multiverseid\': 273224}, {\'name\': \'食人村民\', \'text\': \'每当另一个人类生物死去时，在食人村民上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类\', \'flavor\': \'有些人活过依尼翠无所不在的恐惧，因为已变成更可怕的怪物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e5116a-98c6-42f1-a106-50b29a9a88ef\', \'multiverseId\': 272088}, \'multiverseid\': 272088}, {\'name\': \'食人村民\', \'text\': \'每當另一個人類生物死去時，在食人村民上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類\', \'flavor\': \'有些人活過依尼翠無所不在的恐懼，因為已變成更可怕的怪物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1da7769-8264-4eb3-a7d2-e0b5796cd6ea\', \'multiverseId\': 272372}, \'multiverseid\': 272372}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfläuter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nWenn der Dorfläuter ins Spiel kommt, enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Priester, Jäger, Schlächter — zu den Waffen! Der Feind rückt an!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cfed476-ca41-47a0-9123-1acb0095c903\', \'multiverseId\': 273517}, \'multiverseid\': 273517}, {\'name\': \'Campanero de la aldea\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nCuando el Campanero de la aldea entre al campo de batalla, endereza todas las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sacerdotes, cazadores, asesinos, ¡a las armas! ¡El enemigo se acerca!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc68f0f6-e253-4fb0-a6fd-983a7f34f711\', \'multiverseId\': 273801}, \'multiverseid\': 273801}, {\'name\': \'Sonneur de cloche du village\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nQuand le Sonneur de cloche du village arrive sur le champ de bataille, dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Prêtres, chasseurs, tueurs — aux armes ! L\'ennemi approche ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1695bc-e4fe-4f06-9a29-9a6048c3fc39\', \'multiverseId\': 272949}, \'multiverseid\': 272949}, {\'name\': \'Campanaro del Villaggio\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nQuando il Campanaro del Villaggio entra nel campo di battaglia, STAPpa tutte le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sacerdoti, cacciatori, assassini... alle armi! Il nemico si avvicina!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2627f6-bedc-4b4c-9ee0-c58c151339e2\', \'multiverseId\': 274085}, \'multiverseid\': 274085}, {\'name\': \'村の鐘鳴らし\', \'text\': \'瞬速 （あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n村の鐘鳴らしが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「僧よ、狩人よ、処刑者よ――武器を取れ！ 敵が近づいているぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad5ab91-9120-4c24-b292-18af4b949df9\', \'multiverseId\': 274369}, \'multiverseid\': 274369}, {\'name\': \'마을 종지기\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면, 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)마을 종지기가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 모든 생물들을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'"사제들이여, 사냥꾼들이여, 퇴치사들이여, 무장하라! 적들이 다가오고 있다!"\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd1eede-cb75-43fc-be37-39f1a94bf37a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sineiro da Aldeia\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nQuando Sineiro da Aldeia entrar no campo de batalha, desvire todas as criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Sacerdotes, caçadores, matadores — armem-se! O inimigo está se aproximando!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc127d26-1bf7-4f09-87ed-6fd2c76dbfd0\', \'multiverseId\': 272665}, \'multiverseid\': 272665}, {\'name\': \'Деревенский Звонарь\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nКогда Деревенский Звонарь выходит на поле битвы, разверните все существа под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Священники, охотники, истребители, — к оружию! Враг приближается!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d552d73a-d9a2-439f-86f9-3e1f0d9967ae\', \'multiverseId\': 273233}, \'multiverseid\': 273233}, {\'name\': \'村庄司钟\', \'text\': \'闪现 （你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n当村庄司钟进战场时，重置所有由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「僧侣，猎人，克星～全副武装！ 敌人接近了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'383d3ace-e779-444c-aef6-46dc15ee03ac\', \'multiverseId\': 272097}, \'multiverseid\': 272097}, {\'name\': \'村莊司鐘\', \'text\': \'閃現 （你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n當村莊司鐘進戰場時，重置所有由你操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「僧侶，獵人，剋星～全副武裝！ 敵人接近了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204ac89a-40bf-48d0-bfea-b3a5e40cd9ac\', \'multiverseId\': 272381}, \'multiverseid\': 272381}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfschmied // Eisenfang\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Dorfschmied, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Nacht streift er alle Anzeichen von Zivilisation ab.\', \'faceName\': \'Dorfschmied\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5388c0e-c9f0-4926-b8d1-8e26fded20d7\', \'multiverseId\': 273490}, \'multiverseid\': 273490}, {\'name\': \'Herrero de la aldea // Colmillo de hierro\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Herrero de la aldea.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cada noche, abandona las molestias de la civilización.\', \'faceName\': \'Herrero de la aldea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27de4cbc-749f-4473-beda-fcc070e673fd\', \'multiverseId\': 273774}, \'multiverseid\': 273774}, {\'name\': \'Forgeron du village // Crocdefer\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Forgeron du village.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque nuit, il oublie les contraintes de la civilisation.\', \'faceName\': \'Forgeron du village\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462f7c44-c948-423e-afdf-a86f849dd3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 272922}, \'multiverseid\': 272922}, {\'name\': \'Fabbro del Villaggio // Zanna di Ferro\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma il Fabbro del Villaggio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni notte, abbandona gli ornamenti della civiltà.\', \'faceName\': \'Fabbro del Villaggio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43a26d6-93bf-4d08-9a63-2f1f202dfa71\', \'multiverseId\': 274058}, \'multiverseid\': 274058}, {\'name\': \'村の鉄鍛冶 // 鉄牙\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、村の鉄鍛冶を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'彼は毎晩文明の象徴を遺棄している。\', \'faceName\': \'村の鉄鍛冶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eecd1a6-c726-4cca-89b1-19a8236cd3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 274342}, \'multiverseid\': 274342}, {\'name\': \'마을 철공 // 철송곳니\', \'text\': \'선제공격각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 마을 철공을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'매일 밤마다 그는 문명의 구속에서 벗어난다.\', \'faceName\': \'마을 철공\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309b0e9e-51c9-4a6e-87f4-96e83a2a7b93\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ferreiro da Aldeia // Canino de Ferro\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Ferreiro da Aldeia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Toda noite, ele abandona os adornos da civilização.\', \'faceName\': \'Ferreiro da Aldeia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5dd1cd9-768b-4f1c-acc8-0a61143317e8\', \'multiverseId\': 272638}, \'multiverseid\': 272638}, {\'name\': \'Деревенский Кузнец // Железный Клык\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Деревенского Кузнеца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Каждую ночь он избавляется от оков цивилизации.\', \'faceName\': \'Деревенский Кузнец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb4aaed7-c267-49ed-8b5c-be61a70d02ef\', \'multiverseId\': 273206}, \'multiverseid\': 273206}, {\'name\': \'村庄铁匠 // 钢牙狼\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化村庄铁匠。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'每个夜晚，他都抛开文明束缚。\', \'faceName\': \'村庄铁匠\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701bdbcf-502b-4bcc-85dd-71577d2a52ac\', \'multiverseId\': 272070}, \'multiverseid\': 272070}, {\'name\': \'村莊鐵匠 // 鋼牙狼\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化村莊鐵匠。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'每個夜晚，他都拋開文明束縛。\', \'faceName\': \'村莊鐵匠\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf2bde4-82fc-417f-a47e-dbe131dfcdae\', \'multiverseId\': 272354}, \'multiverseid\': 272354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfschmied // Eisenfang\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Eisenfang, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Jeden Morgen repariert er die Haustür.\', \'faceName\': \'Eisenfang\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5388c0e-c9f0-4926-b8d1-8e26fded20d7\', \'multiverseId\': 273490}, \'multiverseid\': 273490}, {\'name\': \'Herrero de la aldea // Colmillo de hierro\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Colmillo de hierro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada mañana, repara la puerta de entrada.\', \'faceName\': \'Colmillo de hierro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27de4cbc-749f-4473-beda-fcc070e673fd\', \'multiverseId\': 273774}, \'multiverseid\': 273774}, {\'name\': \'Forgeron du village // Crocdefer\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez Crocdefer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "Chaque matin, il répare la porte d\'entrée.", \'faceName\': \'Crocdefer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462f7c44-c948-423e-afdf-a86f849dd3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 272922}, \'multiverseid\': 272922}, {\'name\': \'Fabbro del Villaggio // Zanna di Ferro\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma la Zanna di Ferro.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni mattina, ripara la porta di casa.\', \'faceName\': \'Zanna di Ferro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43a26d6-93bf-4d08-9a63-2f1f202dfa71\', \'multiverseId\': 274058}, \'multiverseid\': 274058}, {\'name\': \'村の鉄鍛冶 // 鉄牙\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、鉄牙を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': \'彼は毎朝玄関を修理している。\', \'faceName\': \'鉄牙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eecd1a6-c726-4cca-89b1-19a8236cd3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 274342}, \'multiverseid\': 274342}, {\'name\': \'마을 철공 // 철송곳니\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 철송곳니를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'매일 아침마다 그는 정문을 수리한다.\', \'faceName\': \'철송곳니\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309b0e9e-51c9-4a6e-87f4-96e83a2a7b93\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ferreiro da Aldeia // Canino de Ferro\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Canino de Ferro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Toda manhã, ele conserta a porta da frente.\', \'faceName\': \'Canino de Ferro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5dd1cd9-768b-4f1c-acc8-0a61143317e8\', \'multiverseId\': 272638}, \'multiverseid\': 272638}, {\'name\': \'Деревенский Кузнец // Железный Клык\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Железного Клыка.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Каждое утро он чинит входную дверь.\', \'faceName\': \'Железный Клык\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb4aaed7-c267-49ed-8b5c-be61a70d02ef\', \'multiverseId\': 273206}, \'multiverseid\': 273206}, {\'name\': \'村庄铁匠 // 钢牙狼\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化钢牙狼。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'每个早晨，他都得修补大门。\', \'faceName\': \'钢牙狼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701bdbcf-502b-4bcc-85dd-71577d2a52ac\', \'multiverseId\': 272070}, \'multiverseid\': 272070}, {\'name\': \'村莊鐵匠 // 鋼牙狼\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化鋼牙狼。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'每個早晨，他都得修補大門。\', \'faceName\': \'鋼牙狼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf2bde4-82fc-417f-a47e-dbe131dfcdae\', \'multiverseId\': 272354}, \'multiverseid\': 272354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dringender Exorzismus\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre einen Geist oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hat man Mitleid mit Geistern, verlängert man nur ihr Leiden. Ob sie es wissen oder nicht, sie sehnen sich nach dem Heiligen Schlaf, und wir werden ihnen dazu verhelfen." —Lunarch Mikaeus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def52fc0-ef52-4f6a-b6c1-c3944801c373\', \'multiverseId\': 273539}, \'multiverseid\': 273539}, {\'name\': \'Exorcismo urgente\', \'text\': \'Destruye el Espíritu o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostrarle piedad a los geists es prolongar su agonía. Lo sepan o no, buscan el Sueño Bendito, y se lo vamos a dar." —Mikaeus, el Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24fa7af4-aa25-486b-9978-062fcb98ca8a\', \'multiverseId\': 273823}, \'multiverseid\': 273823}, {\'name\': \'Exorcisme urgent\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'esprit ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Montrer de la pitié aux geists ne fait que prolonger leurs souffrances. Qu\'ils le sachent ou non, ils sont à la recherche du Sommeil béni, et c\'est à nous de le leur offrir. » —Mikaeus, le lunarque", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272971&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6499164f-f31c-45e6-aeaa-fec48ce2a7af\', \'multiverseId\': 272971}, \'multiverseid\': 272971}, {\'name\': \'Esorcismo Urgente\', \'text\': \'Distruggi uno Spirito o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostrare compassione ai geist ne prolunga l\\\'agonia. Che ne siano o meno consapevoli, cercano il Sonno Benedetto e noi glielo daremo." —Mikaeus, il Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2ed9c8-6075-4e81-89a2-749fc9cbfc0d\', \'multiverseId\': 274107}, \'multiverseid\': 274107}, {\'name\': \'緊急の除霊\', \'text\': \'スピリット１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「哀れみを見せれば霊の苦悶が長引く。 知ろうと知るまいと、彼らが求めるのは祝福の眠りであり、我々はそれを与えるのだ。」 ――月皇ミケウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a02da670-81ac-4840-8904-5229ddae71d7\', \'multiverseId\': 274391}, \'multiverseid\': 274391}, {\'name\': \'긴급한 퇴마술\', \'text\': \'신령 지속물 한 개나 부여마법 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"심령을 동정하는 건 그것의 고통을 늘리는 것이니라. 그들은 알던 모르던 축복의 영면을 소망하고 있으며, 우리의 임무는 그들에게 그것을 선사하는 것이노라."—달의 교주 미케이우스\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ca3701c-ef00-4dd4-8bd0-7c58d3e94774\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Exorcismo Urgente\', \'text\': \'Destrua o Espírito ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ter piedade dos geists é prolongar sua agonia. Quer eles saibam ou não, eles buscam o Sono Abençoado, e é isso que devemos dar a eles." — Mikaeus, o Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e0e2f8a-246e-46c9-a79d-5f324aac5e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 272687}, \'multiverseid\': 272687}, {\'name\': \'Срочный Экзорцизм\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевого Духа или чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Проявление жалости к привидениям лишь продлевает их муки. Сознательно или нет, все они стремятся забыться Благословенным Сном, и мы обязаны им в этом помочь». — Микеас, Лунарх\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6a9e06-b3ed-4ae6-b59b-a70d3ab415ff\', \'multiverseId\': 273255}, \'multiverseid\': 273255}, {\'name\': \'急切驱魔\', \'text\': \'消灭目标精怪或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「向游魂施恩，只会增长它们的苦痛。 不论它们是否了解，我们都会给予它们所寻求的受福安眠。」 ～月主教米凯耶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7408beea-e5ec-4464-9756-d42fd044c89d\', \'multiverseId\': 272119}, \'multiverseid\': 272119}, {\'name\': \'急切驅魔\', \'text\': \'消滅目標精靈或結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「向遊魂施恩，只會增長它們的苦痛。 不論它們是否了解，我們都會給予它們所尋求的受福安眠。」 ～月主教米凱耶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59de097f-35a2-41b8-9012-51eebe80efee\', \'multiverseId\': 272403}, \'multiverseid\': 272403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkeldickichtwolf\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Der Dunkeldickichtwolf erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Werwolfschlächter wissen nicht genau, wie Werwölfe entstehen. Um sicher zu gehen, töten sie einfach alle Wölfe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f954801-08d3-45e7-841c-847625a8746d\', \'multiverseId\': 273638}, \'multiverseid\': 273638}, {\'name\': \'Lobo de maleza oscura\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: El Lobo de maleza oscura obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad sólo una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Los cazadores de licántropos no saben bien cómo se crean los licántropos. Así que matan a todos los lobos, por si acaso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb57857-01f7-4bc8-bc0c-e479abbd8ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 273922}, \'multiverseid\': 273922}, {\'name\': \'Loup des halliers sombres\', \'text\': "{2}{G} : Le Loup des halliers sombres gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'Les tueurs de loups-garous ne savent pas vraiment comment les loups-garous sont créés. Alors, par prudence, ils tuent tous les loups.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c717d79d-83d5-4912-b4f5-ceb9d4cda4ff\', \'multiverseId\': 273070}, \'multiverseid\': 273070}, {\'name\': \'Lupo della Selva Oscura\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Il Lupo della Selva Oscura prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli assassini di lupi mannari non sanno per certo come sono creati i lupi mannari. Così uccidono tutti i lupi, per stare sul sicuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e5108f-941c-47be-a9c7-8ee512bdb4fb\', \'multiverseId\': 274206}, \'multiverseid\': 274206}, {\'name\': \'暗茂みの狼\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：暗茂みの狼はターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。 この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'狼男処刑者は、狼男が生まれる訳を知らない。 なので、彼らは念のため、全ての狼を殺している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d26a0b6-4f67-4dd0-ad07-d4f59e560480\', \'multiverseId\': 274490}, \'multiverseid\': 274490}, {\'name\': \'어둠덤불 늑대\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: 어둠덤불 늑대는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 한 턴에 한 번씩만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'늑대인간 퇴치사들은 늑대인간들이 정확히 어떻게 생겨나는지를 모르기 때문에, 안전 차원에서 늑대들을 보이는 대로 죽여버린다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6211e2e-e2f7-40d3-b7b6-b95582cfb8d4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lobo do Matagal Escuro\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Lobo do Matagal Escuro recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Os matadores de lobisomem não sabem ao certo como os lobisomens são criados. Portanto, eles matam todos os lobos, apenas por segurança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec3ff91-8142-482a-9274-dcf5df957074\', \'multiverseId\': 272786}, \'multiverseid\': 272786}, {\'name\': \'Волк Темной Чащи\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Волк Темной Чащи получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность только один раз за ход.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'Истребители вервольфов точно не знают, как получаются вервольфы. Поэтому они убивают всех волков — так, на всякий случай.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e793c8a2-2c0b-49f7-b131-d7a064e3b508\', \'multiverseId\': 273354}, \'multiverseid\': 273354}, {\'name\': \'暗丛狼\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：暗丛狼得+2/+2直到回合结束。 此异能每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'狼人克星并不确知狼人是如何产生的。 所以他们见狼就杀，以防万一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0deaba28-e400-4f9e-8696-2377f5e162d5\', \'multiverseId\': 272218}, \'multiverseid\': 272218}, {\'name\': \'暗叢狼\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：暗叢狼得+2/+2直到回合結束。 此異能每回合只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'狼人剋星並不確知狼人是如何產生的。 所以他們見狼就殺，以防萬一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2990e6-d8d9-41b8-bf06-bd02d127f675\', \'multiverseId\': 272502}, \'multiverseid\': 272502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerwaldspinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nMorbide — Die Dämmerwaldspinne kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, falls eine Kreatur in diesem Zug gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Stenzische Vampire bieten Spinnen in der Nähe ihrer Herrenhäuser gute Bedingungen, damit sie die Netze ausrauben können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c1c70ad-f309-4ba3-beee-d44a321322ed\', \'multiverseId\': 273619}, \'multiverseid\': 273619}, {\'name\': \'Araña de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nNecrario — La Araña de Somberwald entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Los vampiros de Stensia alientan a las arañas cerca de sus mansiones para poder robar de las telarañas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e5601f-2ab2-4916-a63e-83cb260e1884\', \'multiverseId\': 273903}, \'multiverseid\': 273903}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de Somberwald\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nMorbidité — L\'Araignée de Somberwald arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': \'Les vampires stensiens favorisent la présence des araignées près de leurs manoirs pour pouvoir piller les toiles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6211924f-c1f1-49f5-ab57-25836223b42c\', \'multiverseId\': 273051}, \'multiverseid\': 273051}, {\'name\': \'Ragno di Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nMorboso — Il Ragno di Somberwald entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1 se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'I vampiri di Stensia favoriscono i ragni vicini ai loro manieri per poter sottrarre loro le ragnatele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27304ac3-3afe-407b-bc13-3d90190f63b1\', \'multiverseId\': 274187}, \'multiverseid\': 274187}, {\'name\': \'ソンバーワルドの蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n陰鬱 ― このターンいずれかのクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、ソンバーワルドの蜘蛛は＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'ステンシアの吸血鬼は、屋敷のそばの蜘蛛をそそのかし、その蜘蛛の巣を奪う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'181c3a3e-3d84-40f2-b289-775d49002fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 274471}, \'multiverseid\': 274471}, {\'name\': \'솜버왈드 거미\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물들을 방어할 수 있다.)사망 — 만약 이 턴에 생물이 죽었다면, 솜버왈드 거미는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'스텐시아의 흡혈귀들은 저택 근처에 거미들이 서식하도록 놔둔 후, 거미줄에 걸린 자들을 주기적으로 수확한다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09148705-bbc0-47ef-8349-f07786683117\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aranha de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\nMórbido — Aranha de Somberwald entrará no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1 sobre ela se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Os vampiros stensianos favorecem a presença de aranhas nas proximidades de seus casarões para poder roubar suas teias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2803316-6652-46df-a796-8030e3b3374c\', \'multiverseId\': 272767}, \'multiverseid\': 272767}, {\'name\': \'Сомбервальдский Паук\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nБолезненность — Сомбервальдский Паук выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем, если в этом ходу умерло существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Стенсийские вампиры покровительствуют паукам рядом со своими замками и воруют добычу из их паутин.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4df4be-df34-43fc-a0d7-8ad7a3fa8c60\', \'multiverseId\': 273335}, \'multiverseid\': 273335}, {\'name\': \'松柏森蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延势 （此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，松柏森蜘蛛进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'史顿襄的吸血鬼乐见蜘蛛在庄园附近繁衍，如此便可在网中抢食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d4f567-7c77-4886-8e08-63e0d0834a07\', \'multiverseId\': 272199}, \'multiverseid\': 272199}, {\'name\': \'松柏森蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延勢 （此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n喪心～如果本回合有生物死去，松柏森蜘蛛進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'史頓襄的吸血鬼樂見蜘蛛在莊園附近繁衍，如此便可在網中搶食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5475af71-6472-4ffb-98c9-3e3413237be6\', \'multiverseId\': 272483}, \'multiverseid\': 272483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonisches Kettenhemd\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +4/+2.\\nAusrüsten — Opfere eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst es so leicht ausziehen wie deine Haut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695492dc-718f-437e-9dd0-2c161f068a83\', \'multiverseId\': 273553}, \'multiverseid\': 273553}, {\'name\': \'Cota de malla demoníaca\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +4/+2.\\nEquipar — Sacrificar una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Sale tan fácil como tu propia piel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e277e606-e4a1-446e-8f9d-6405aabd1b72\', \'multiverseId\': 273837}, \'multiverseid\': 273837}, {\'name\': \'Haubert de maille de démon\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +4/+2.\\nÉquipement — Sacrifiez une créature.\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Il s\'enlève aussi facilement que votre propre peau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f99b8be2-da65-4b55-b032-07ffd780553e\', \'multiverseId\': 272985}, \'multiverseid\': 272985}, {\'name\': \'Cotta di Maglia Demoniaca\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +4/+2.\\nEquipaggiare—Sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Viene via facilmente come la tua stessa pelle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b16182-7cce-48d7-bb19-b7b619e9935e\', \'multiverseId\': 274121}, \'multiverseid\': 274121}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の長帷子\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋４/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備 ― クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'お前の皮膚と同じぐらいに脱ぎやすい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d69387-42de-417d-ae27-e60a4e5144f5\', \'multiverseId\': 274405}, \'multiverseid\': 274405}, {\'name\': \'악마의 갑주\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +4/+2를 받는다.장착—생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'그 갑옷은 당신의 피부만큼 쉽게 벗겨진다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa806ab3-2e33-4ce6-a154-afd92f489589\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Cota de Malha Demoníaca\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +4/+2.\\nEquipar — Sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'É tão fácil de tirar como a sua própria pele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7170cc-926a-44f1-af6b-6183eea3ca0a\', \'multiverseId\': 272701}, \'multiverseid\': 272701}, {\'name\': \'Демоническая Кольчуга\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +4/+2.\\nСнарядить — Пожертвуйте существо.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Она снимается так же легко, как ваша кожа.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e013f0e0-47dd-4607-bdcb-55e7e0dfb7de\', \'multiverseId\': 273269}, \'multiverseid\': 273269}, {\'name\': \'恶魔锁子甲\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+4/+2。\\n佩带～牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'脱下它就跟脱下自己的皮一样简单。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c0c857-3285-45c6-9a19-e0515765a7b4\', \'multiverseId\': 272133}, \'multiverseid\': 272133}, {\'name\': \'惡魔鎖子甲\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+4/+2。\\n佩帶～犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'脫下它就跟脫下自己的皮一樣簡單。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d4b4f2-266c-4f7b-bee4-dd0ec2f4a878\', \'multiverseId\': 272417}, \'multiverseid\': 272417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstergrab-Ghul\', \'text\': \'Der Düstergrab-Ghul kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Zumindest hat dieser hier noch Arme und Beine. Nun, die meisten seiner Beine." —Enslow, Ghulrufer aus Nefalen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cec14f1-2f1b-4dcd-bc0e-ed93583ea6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 273519}, \'multiverseid\': 273519}, {\'name\': \'Necrófaga de la tumbanefasta\', \'text\': \'La Necrófaga de la tumbanefasta entra al campo de batalla girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Al menos este todavía tiene brazos y piernas. Bueno, la mayoría de sus piernas." —Enslow, llamamuertos de Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb65118-7346-41df-8c79-2e370c493435\', \'multiverseId\': 273803}, \'multiverseid\': 273803}, {\'name\': \'Goule du diregraf\', \'text\': \'La Goule du diregraf arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Au moins, celle-là a encore tous ses membres. Enfin, presque. » —Enslow, meneur de goule de Néphalie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b29fe7c-3ffd-450c-8227-23033a574e82\', \'multiverseId\': 272951}, \'multiverseid\': 272951}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul del Cimitero di Guerra\', \'text\': \'La Ghoul del Cimitero di Guerra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Almeno questa ha ancora braccia e gambe. Beh, buona parte delle gambe." —Enslow, evocaghoul di Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac953cff-83bb-42f4-9041-ac5e8ed61827\', \'multiverseId\': 274087}, \'multiverseid\': 274087}, {\'name\': \'戦墓のグール\', \'text\': \'戦墓のグールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「少なくとも、こいつはまだ腕も脚もある。 まあ、脚の大部分だがな。」 ――ネファリアのグール呼び、エンスロウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bace1e-cf1d-4735-b914-d27ce45567c5\', \'multiverseId\': 274371}, \'multiverseid\': 274371}, {\'name\': \'전장묘지 악귀\', \'text\': \'전장묘지 악귀는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"적어도 이건 팔다리라도 갖추고 있다고. 에, 적어도 다리의 대부분은 말이지."—네팔리아의 악귀소환술사 엔슬로우\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75772bc0-9f13-4a90-83d6-fec08654ea2d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal do Cemitério do Terror\', \'text\': \'Carniçal do Cemitério do Terror entra no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Pelo menos esse aqui ainda tem braços e pernas. Quer dizer, uma boa parte das pernas." — Enslow, invocador de carniçais de Nefália\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c667d8a2-ceb3-4907-9711-ae4b8471545c\', \'multiverseId\': 272667}, \'multiverseid\': 272667}, {\'name\': \'Упырь с Места Резни\', \'text\': \'Упырь с Места Резни выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«У этой хотя бы еще есть руки и ноги. По крайней мере, большая их часть». — Энслоу, призыватель упырей из Нефалии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb487d79-c68d-4279-9068-88ddf98e6d17\', \'multiverseId\': 273235}, \'multiverseid\': 273235}, {\'name\': \'战墓食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'战墓食尸鬼须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「至少这个还有手脚。 嗯，大部份的脚。」 ～涅非利亚尸鬼牧者恩斯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac50e0ec-58a9-4890-8010-c654973be893\', \'multiverseId\': 272099}, \'multiverseid\': 272099}, {\'name\': \'戰墓食屍鬼\', \'text\': \'戰墓食屍鬼須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「至少這個還有手腳。 嗯，大部份的腳。」 ～涅非利亞屍鬼牧者恩斯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=272383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'137c81ca-1c3c-495f-807c-90f7aab96e01\', \'multiverseId\': 272383}, \'multiverseid\': 272383}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273664&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43768540-a2c8-485e-9445-db9382967ade', 'multiverseId': 273664}, 'multiverseid': 273664}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273948&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '767d4846-c31d-48c1-b23e-88b594368251', 'multiverseId': 273948}, 'multiverseid': 273948}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=273096&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '536030d6-4d6a-4f40-93a7-37f8a1399e60', 'multiverseId': 273096}, 'multiverseid': 273096}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274232&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '398a7651-3bde-4ea0-b2a4-c3eaad1ccac5', 'multiverseId': 274232}, 'multiverseid': 274232}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=274516&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '912085e4-43ef-4780-82b6-25064578cb6b', 'multive